{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjFPeefsibkBuaPrk6Xn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01R75sTWgio8fcB3nA3nQLxV","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport re\ndef patch(path, pairs):\n    s = open(path).read()\n    for a, b in pairs:\n        assert a in s, (path, a[:70])\n        s = s.replace(a, b, 1)\n    open(path, 'w').write(s)\n\npatch('crates/pav_core/src/input.rs', [\n(\"\"\"    pub const POTION: u32 = 1 << 14;\n\n\"\"\", \"\"\"    pub const POTION: u32 = 1 << 14;\n    /// Whiff Fit: menu and action buttons, each a device-independent meaning.\n    pub const CONFIRM: u32 = 1 << 15;\n    pub const BACK: u32 = 1 << 16;\n    pub const MENU_UP: u32 = 1 << 17;\n    pub const MENU_DOWN: u32 = 1 << 18;\n    pub const MENU_LEFT: u32 = 1 << 19;\n    pub const MENU_RIGHT: u32 = 1 << 20;\n    pub const TAB_L: u32 = 1 << 21;\n    pub const TAB_R: u32 = 1 << 22;\n    pub const PAUSE: u32 = 1 << 23;\n    pub const SCHEDULE: u32 = 1 << 24;\n    pub const WAVE: u32 = 1 << 25;\n    pub const STEP_L: u32 = 1 << 26;\n    pub const STEP_R: u32 = 1 << 27;\n    /// The AI Hub's round has started (the page's `__hub.go`).\n    pub const HUB_GO: u32 = 1 << 28;\n\n\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"        (\"potion\", POTION),\n\"\"\", \"\"\"        (\"potion\", POTION),\n        (\"confirm\", CONFIRM),\n        (\"back\", BACK),\n        (\"menu_up\", MENU_UP),\n        (\"menu_down\", MENU_DOWN),\n        (\"menu_left\", MENU_LEFT),\n        (\"menu_right\", MENU_RIGHT),\n        (\"tab_l\", TAB_L),\n        (\"tab_r\", TAB_R),\n        (\"pause\", PAUSE),\n        (\"schedule\", SCHEDULE),\n        (\"wave\", WAVE),\n        (\"step_l\", STEP_L),\n        (\"step_r\", STEP_R),\n        (\"hub_go\", HUB_GO),\n\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, Default, PartialEq, Serialize, Deserialize)]\npub struct InputFrame {\"\"\", \"\"\"/// What the pointer did to an item of a game's UI this frame (`pav_ui` hit-tests its rects).\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq, Serialize, Deserialize)]\npub enum UiEvent {\n    Hover(u16),\n    Click(u16),\n    /// A slider dragged to this fraction (0..1).\n    Slider(u16, f32),\n}\n\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, Default, PartialEq, Serialize, Deserialize)]\npub struct InputFrame {\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"    #[serde(default, skip_serializing_if = \"Option::is_none\")]\n    pub cmd: Option<crate::arpg::GameCmd>,\n}\"\"\", \"\"\"    #[serde(default, skip_serializing_if = \"Option::is_none\")]\n    pub cmd: Option<crate::arpg::GameCmd>,\n    /// Screen-space lean (x right, y up, unit disc), already shaped per device by the host.\n    #[serde(default)]\n    pub lean: Vec2,\n    /// Any real input this tick: a key, a button, a stick past 0.3, a click or a mouse move.\n    #[serde(default)]\n    pub any: bool,\n    /// What the pointer did to the game's UI.\n    #[serde(default, skip_serializing_if = \"Option::is_none\")]\n    pub ui: Option<UiEvent>,\n    /// The music's position (seconds, latency corrected) when sound is running.\n    #[serde(default, skip_serializing_if = \"Option::is_none\")]\n    pub song_pos: Option<f32>,\n}\"\"\"),\n])\n\npatch('crates/pav_core/src/frame.rs', [\n(\"\"\"    /// Arrived somewhere else (Shardfall place code).\n    Travel {\n        place: u32,\n    },\n}\"\"\", \"\"\"    /// Arrived somewhere else (Shardfall place code).\n    Travel {\n        place: u32,\n    },\n    /// A numbered sound from the game's bank (`pav_audio::sfx_bank`).\n    Sfx {\n        id: u16,\n        gain: f32,\n        pitch: f32,\n    },\n    /// One gibberish syllable of a talking character.\n    Syllable {\n        speaker: u8,\n        vowel: u8,\n        pitch: f32,\n    },\n    /// Change the song (0 fades to silence).\n    Music {\n        song: u8,\n    },\n    /// A splash scaled by `size` (1 = a big dive): water dents and bursts.\n    BigSplash {\n        pos: Vec3,\n        size: f32,\n    },\n    /// A small silent dent in the water (a wake).\n    Wake {\n        pos: Vec3,\n    },\n}\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"    /// A `games` game's HUD lines (`Game::hud`).\n    pub lines: Vec<String>,\n}\"\"\", \"\"\"    /// A `games` game's HUD lines (`Game::hud`).\n    pub lines: Vec<String>,\n    /// The game's status as JSON for the page (`window.__gameStatus`).\n    pub status: Option<String>,\n    /// Whiff Fit's whole UI: a list of things to draw (`pav_ui::fit_ui`).\n    pub fit: Option<std::sync::Arc<crate::games::fit::ui_model::UiFrame>>,\n    /// The game drives the camera's yaw this tick (a chase camera on a curving path).\n    pub camera_yaw: Option<f32>,\n}\"\"\"),\n])\n\npatch('crates/pav_core/src/games/mod.rs', [\n(\"\"\"pub mod starter;\n\"\"\", \"\"\"pub mod fit;\npub mod starter;\n\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"pub static GAMES: &[Entry] =\n    &[entry::<starter::Starter>(\"Starter: collect every shard while slimes chase you (the template to copy).\", starter::build)];\n\"\"\", \"\"\"pub static GAMES: &[Entry] = &[\n    entry::<starter::Starter>(\"Starter: collect every shard while slimes chase you (the template to copy).\", starter::build),\n    entry::<fit::FitGame>(\"Whiff Fit: a five-day balance-and-wellness comedy at a resort staffed by talking gym equipment.\", fit::build),\n];\n\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"    fn bot(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> InputFrame {\n        InputFrame::default()\n    }\n}\n\n/// One line\"\"\", \"\"\"    fn bot(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> InputFrame {\n        InputFrame::default()\n    }\n\n    /// While true, a tick runs only `pre`, the tick count and events: menus keep working while\n    /// the world stands still.\n    fn frozen(&self) -> bool {\n        false\n    }\n\n    /// The game's status for the page, as JSON text (`window.__gameStatus`).\n    fn page_status(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> Option<String> {\n        None\n    }\n\n    /// The game's own UI, drawn by `pav_ui::fit_ui`.\n    fn ui_frame(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> Option<std::sync::Arc<fit::ui_model::UiFrame>> {\n        None\n    }\n\n    /// The camera's yaw when the game drives it per tick.\n    fn camera_yaw(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> Option<f32> {\n        None\n    }\n\n    /// Extra figures to draw that are not entities (ghost lanes).\n    fn extra_objects(&self, _sim: &Sim) -> Vec<crate::frame::RenderObject> {\n        Vec::new()\n    }\n}\n\n/// One line\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"    pub fn bot(&self, sim: &Sim) -> InputFrame {\n        self.0.bot(sim)\n    }\n}\n\nimpl Clone for GameBox {\"\"\", \"\"\"    pub fn bot(&self, sim: &Sim) -> InputFrame {\n        self.0.bot(sim)\n    }\n\n    pub fn frozen(&self) -> bool {\n        self.0.frozen()\n    }\n\n    pub fn page_status(&self, sim: &Sim) -> Option<String> {\n        self.0.page_status(sim)\n    }\n\n    pub fn ui_frame(&self, sim: &Sim) -> Option<std::sync::Arc<fit::ui_model::UiFrame>> {\n        self.0.ui_frame(sim)\n    }\n\n    pub fn camera_yaw(&self, sim: &Sim) -> Option<f32> {\n        self.0.camera_yaw(sim)\n    }\n\n    pub fn extra_objects(&self, sim: &Sim) -> Vec<crate::frame::RenderObject> {\n        self.0.extra_objects(sim)\n    }\n}\n\nimpl Clone for GameBox {\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"    fn bot(&self, sim: &Sim) -> InputFrame;\n    fn as_any(&self) -> &dyn Any;\"\"\", \"\"\"    fn bot(&self, sim: &Sim) -> InputFrame;\n    fn frozen(&self) -> bool;\n    fn page_status(&self, sim: &Sim) -> Option<String>;\n    fn ui_frame(&self, sim: &Sim) -> Option<std::sync::Arc<fit::ui_model::UiFrame>>;\n    fn camera_yaw(&self, sim: &Sim) -> Option<f32>;\n    fn extra_objects(&self, sim: &Sim) -> Vec<crate::frame::RenderObject>;\n    fn as_any(&self) -> &dyn Any;\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"        Game::bot(self, sim)\n    }\n    fn as_any(&self) -> &dyn Any {\"\"\", \"\"\"        Game::bot(self, sim)\n    }\n    fn frozen(&self) -> bool {\n        Game::frozen(self)\n    }\n    fn page_status(&self, sim: &Sim) -> Option<String> {\n        Game::page_status(self, sim)\n    }\n    fn ui_frame(&self, sim: &Sim) -> Option<std::sync::Arc<fit::ui_model::UiFrame>> {\n        Game::ui_frame(self, sim)\n    }\n    fn camera_yaw(&self, sim: &Sim) -> Option<f32> {\n        Game::camera_yaw(self, sim)\n    }\n    fn extra_objects(&self, sim: &Sim) -> Vec<crate::frame::RenderObject> {\n        Game::extra_objects(self, sim)\n    }\n    fn as_any(&self) -> &dyn Any {\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"    #[cfg(not(target_arch = \"wasm32\"))]\n    if let Ok(text) = std::fs::read_to_string(format!(\"crates/pav_core/src/games/{key}.toml\")) {\"\"\",\n\"\"\"    #[cfg(not(target_arch = \"wasm32\"))]\n    if let Ok(text) = std::fs::read_to_string(format!(\"crates/pav_core/src/games/{key}.toml\"))\n        && (key == \"starter\" || !cfg!(test))\n    {\"\"\"),\n])\n\npatch('crates/pav_core/src/sim.rs', [\n(\"\"\"        self.run_behaviors(dt);\n\n        // Getting in and out of vehicles.\n        self.vehicle_interact(input);\n\"\"\", \"\"\"        let frozen = self.play().is_some_and(|g| g.frozen());\n        if !frozen {\n            self.run_behaviors(dt);\n            // Getting in and out of vehicles.\n            self.vehicle_interact(input);\n        }\n\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"        game_inputs.extend(self.play_pre(input, dt, &mut events));\n\n        // Characters.\"\"\", \"\"\"        game_inputs.extend(self.play_pre(input, dt, &mut events));\n        if frozen {\n            // A paused game: its menus ran in `pre`; the world stands still.\n            self.state.tick += 1;\n            if !self.replaying {\n                self.events.extend(events);\n            }\n            return;\n        }\n\n        // Characters.\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"            lines: self.play_hud(),\n        };\"\"\", \"\"\"            lines: self.play_hud(),\n            status: self.play().and_then(|g| g.page_status(self)),\n            fit: self.play().and_then(|g| g.ui_frame(self)),\n            camera_yaw: self.play().and_then(|g| g.camera_yaw(self)),\n        };\n        let extra = self.play().map(|g| g.extra_objects(self)).unwrap_or_default();\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"                        scenery,\n                    })\n                })\n                .collect(),\n            statics: self.state.statics.clone(),\"\"\", \"\"\"                        scenery,\n                    })\n                })\n                .chain(extra)\n                .collect(),\n            statics: self.state.statics.clone(),\"\"\"),\n])\n\npatch('crates/pav_core/src/puppet.rs', [\n(\"\"\"    /// A dodge was under way last tick (a captured dodge starts once per dodge).\n    #[serde(default)]\n    pub dodged: bool,\n}\"\"\", \"\"\"    /// A dodge was under way last tick (a captured dodge starts once per dodge).\n    #[serde(default)]\n    pub dodged: bool,\n    /// The whole figure tilts about the feet, sideways (toward its `right`) and forward\n    /// (radians): a game's balance lean.\n    #[serde(default)]\n    pub tilt_side: f32,\n    #[serde(default)]\n    pub tilt_fwd: f32,\n}\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"            dodged: o.dodged,\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n/// One rendered part\"\"\", \"\"\"            dodged: o.dodged,\n            tilt_side: l(self.tilt_side, o.tilt_side),\n            tilt_fwd: l(self.tilt_fwd, o.tilt_fwd),\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n/// One rendered part\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"    let sink = Vec3::Y * (-1.2 * k * smooth(0.55, 1.0, down));\n    (topple.unwrap_or(Quat::IDENTITY) * spin.unwrap_or(Quat::IDENTITY), shift + sink)\"\"\",\n\"\"\"    let sink = Vec3::Y * (-1.2 * k * smooth(0.55, 1.0, down));\n    let tilt = Quat::from_axis_angle(Vec3::Y.cross(right).normalize_or(Vec3::Z), st.tilt_side)\n        * Quat::from_axis_angle(Vec3::Y.cross(fwd).normalize_or(Vec3::X), st.tilt_fwd);\n    (tilt * topple.unwrap_or(Quat::IDENTITY) * spin.unwrap_or(Quat::IDENTITY), shift + sink)\"\"\"),\n])\n\npatch('crates/pav_core/src/parts.rs', [\n(\"\"\"        Wings => \"wings\",\n    }\n}\"\"\", \"\"\"        Wings => \"wings\",\n        /// A carrying handle arching over the head (a kettlebell's).\n        Handle => \"handle\",\n    }\n}\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"  