{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjHdeJwbzjwzJp1rSmUJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The game logic compiles on the first try. Now I'll write all the words: script.toml with Pip, the coaches, the guests, titles and names."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":20275,"cache_read_input_tokens":486300,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":20275},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0691f0d6-f08e-44c9-b7bd-c57d7fb96b71","uuid":"72f68386-610f-4daa-9f0a-3e02d3cf469c","timestamp":"2026-11-05T06:13:07.827Z","request_id":"req_011CgjHddzbze6wmPQm3Xb1Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjHdeJwbzjwzJp1rSmUJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LBHKbvrvLFFvv9qzwgPvBp","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223859__x35112d/work/WhiffFit-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-223859/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/script.toml","content":"# All the game's words. Short polite sentences. Upbeat. Then one line too honest.\n# {name} {age} {n} {day} {minutes} {wobbles} are filled in when a line is shown.\n\n\"names\" = [\n  \"Sandra Mostly\", \"Gary Upright\", \"Ms. Tilt\", \"Doug\", \"Barely Brenda\", \"Lean Jean\", \"Wobbly Bob\", \"Stan Still\",\n  \"Dame Slouch\", \"Mister Almost\", \"Ankle Annie\", \"Uncle Pivot\", \"Hovering Hank\", \"Modest Maude\", \"The Other Doug\",\n  \"Teetering Terry\", \"Sir Sits-a-Lot\", \"Polite Paul\", \"Kneecap Kate\", \"Lars Lopsided\", \"Agnes Askew\", \"Dizzy Dennis\",\n  \"Plumb Bob\", \"Mary Middling\", \"Tom Tom's Cousin\", \"Wendy Wavers\", \"Level Lenny\", \"Shifty Shirley\", \"Sway Sue\",\n  \"Grandma Gravity\", \"Bert Balanced-ish\", \"Pat Pending\", \"Crooked Carol\", \"Flat-Foot Fran\", \"Vera Vertical\",\n  \"Nearly Neil\", \"Ron Rollover\", \"Stumbling Stella\", \"Hesitant Hugo\", \"Guest 41\",\n]\n\n\"titles\" = [\n  \"Human Soup\", \"Damp Towel\", \"Loose Gravel\", \"Unattended Luggage\", \"Fallen Deck Chair\", \"Acceptable Human\", \"Moderate Puddle\",\n  \"Temporary Upright\", \"Occasional Biped\", \"Certified Lean-To\", \"Reasonable Effort\", \"Wobble Enthusiast\", \"Junior Coat Rack\",\n  \"Hobbyist Stander\", \"Honest Attempt\", \"Seasoned Tilter\", \"Local Plumb Line\", \"Weekend Fence Post\", \"Mostly Vertical\",\n  \"Stillness Intern\", \"Lamp Post Trainee\", \"Regional Heron\", \"Professional Standing Person\", \"Senior Coat Rack\", \"Licensed Fence Post\",\n  \"Distinguished Column\", \"Tide-Resistant\", \"Quiet Lighthouse\", \"Monument, Small\", \"Alarmingly Balanced\", \"Statue, Awake\", \"Please Check Your Pulse\",\n]\n\n\"credits\" = [\n  \"Whiff Fit\",\n  \"A game about standing\",\n  \"Front Desk: Pip\",\n  \"Stillness: Posey\",\n  \"Strength: Big Kettle\",\n  \"Cardio: Bounce\",\n  \"The Lagoon: Commodore Gull\",\n  \"Marjorie as Marjorie\",\n  \"Two-Towel Tom, one towel short\",\n  \"The Twins, The Twins\",\n  \"Music and voices written in code\",\n  \"No real words were spoken\",\n  \"All minutes are resort minutes\",\n  \"Nobody was weighed\",\n  \"You may stay as long as you like\",\n  \"You may stay\",\n]\n\n\"result.0\" = [\n  \"That was an event. It happened. I wrote it down.\",\n  \"You took part. Many things take part. Weather, for example.\",\n  \"A score of {n}. It is also a house number somewhere.\",\n  \"I am not disappointed. I have no disappointment settings.\",\n]\n\"result.1\" = [\n  \"That was your best attempt so far today. I am as surprised as you are.\",\n  \"One star. Stars are very far away. So is that one.\",\n  \"You did some of it. Some is a known quantity.\",\n  \"A score of {n}. Round it up if nobody is looking. I am looking.\",\n]\n\"result.2\" = [\n  \"Two stars. People have framed less.\",\n  \"Well done. I have changed your file from 'Guest' to 'Guest, Adequate'.\",\n  \"That was quite good. I checked it twice, out of disbelief.\",\n  \"A score of {n}. Your ancestors stood upright for this.\",\n]\n\"result.3\" = [\n  \"Three stars. That is all of them. Please do not ask for more stars.\",\n  \"Remarkable. I will be telling the clam.\",\n  \"I have nothing to add, and I always have something to add.\",\n  \"A score of {n}. Your wobble has been reported to the authorities. They are impressed.\",\n]\n\n\"card.breath_bloom\" = [\"Hold to breathe in, release to breathe out, and follow the ring. Keep the dot in the middle.\", \"Breathe in the sea. Not literally.\"]\n\"card.pose_parade\" = [\"Hold each pose while the dot stays in a drifting ring. Stay in and your streak climbs.\", \"Be the heron. The heron does not check the score.\"]\n\"card.tempo_squats\" = [\"Hold to go down, release to rise, in time with the bar. Keep the dot in the band.\", \"Lift with your legs. I cannot. I have none. Lift for both of us.\"]\n\"card.plank_standoff\" = [\"Hold both step buttons and keep the dot in the ring for as long as you can stand it.\", \"I will be right here. I am always right here. I weigh eleven kilos and have no plans.\"]\n\"card.step_party\" = [\"Step on the footprints as the notes land. Left, right, or both.\", \"Left right left right is that your heartbeat? Mine is just air!\"]\n\"card.floatie_spin\" = [\"Circle your lean to keep the rings up. When a guest throws one, catch it on that side.\", \"Round and round and round and switch and round!\"]\n\"card.morning_lap\" = [\"Alternate your feet to set a pace, stay in the green, and lean to dodge. Grab ribbons.\", \"Catch me catch me you can't actually I'm a ball!\"]\n\"card.tide_table\" = [\"Your lean tilts the raft. Roll the hermit crabs into the tide pools. Fast shells skip right over.\", \"The crabs have signed a waiver. The crabs cannot read.\"]\n\"card.paddle_slalom\" = [\"Lean left and right to steer through the gates. Lean forward to go faster. Lean less to stay dry.\", \"That is a channel. You will pass through the gates. I am legally required to say so.\"]\n\"card.tray_trek\" = [\"Walk the pier with five smoothies. Tilt the tray to keep the glasses from sliding off.\", \"Marjorie ordered these in the spring. Do not keep her waiting. Again.\"]\n\"card.cannonball_cup\" = [\"Press at the bottom of three bounces, then leap on the fourth. Hold to tuck. Enter tucked.\", \"We are not here for form. We are here for splash.\"]\n\"card.big_stand\" = [\"Five phases, on one small post, in front of everyone. The last one is the hard one.\", \"Please stand on the post. Gently. It remembers everything too.\"]\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Pip: front desk, scorekeeper\n\n\"pip.intro\" = [\n  \"Welcome to Tippy Cay! You have won a complimentary stay. You did not enter. Nobody enters.\",\n  \"I am Pip. I am a cushion, and I am the front desk. I keep records of everything. Please do not read them.\",\n  \"Your stay is five days. To check out, you need a Balance Age of 40 or better. Nobody has asked to leave yet.\",\n  \"Each morning you will stand on me. Gently. I remember everything. Then you will do exercises and get a stamp.\",\n  \"Your cabana is ready. It was ready before you were born. Good night, {name}.\",\n]\n\"pip.morning1\" = [\"Good morning, {name}! It is Day 1 of five. I counted them for you.\", \"Please come and stand on me. It takes about a minute. It takes me longer to get over it.\"]\n\"pip.morning2\" = [\"Good morning! It is Day 2. You came back. They usually do, there is only the one path.\", \"The Iron Gazebo has opened. Big Kettle has been told you are coming. Please stand on me.\"]\n\"pip.morning3\" = [\"Good morning! Day 3. You look well. That is a thing I say to everyone, as a courtesy.\", \"The Boardwalk is open. Someone new will be following you around today. It is you. Please stand on me.\"]\n\"pip.morning4\" = [\"Good morning! Day 4. The guests have begun whispering about the Big Stand. I told them to.\", \"The Lagoon is open, under the command of a seabird. Please stand on me.\"]\n\"pip.morning5\" = [\"Good morning. It is Day 5. I want you to know I have enjoyed recording you.\", \"After this morning's check, the Big Stand waits in the bay. Please stand on me. One last time this stay.\"]\n\"pip.absence\" = [\n  \"You were away for {n} days. I did not count them. There were {n}.\",\n  \"You were gone for {n} days. The clam asked about you. It did not. I am being kind.\",\n  \"Welcome back. {n} days have passed. I kept your towel. I kept all of your towels.\",\n  \"It has been {n} days. Your wobble has not missed you. I checked with it.\",\n  \"{n} days away. Did you know? Standing still for {n} days burns calories. Not many. Did you know that, though?\",\n]\n\"pip.back\" = [\"Welcome back, {name}. Your day is where you left it. Nothing has moved. I checked.\", \"Oh, you again. Good. Your minutes are all still here. I counted them while you were gone.\", \"Hello, {name}. I told everyone you had stepped out. They did not ask.\"]\n\"pip.check_test\" = [\n  \"Stand still. This is the whole test. Please do not do anything else.\",\n  \"Now lean where I tell you. I will say a percentage. It will seem very exact. It is.\",\n  \"Now close your eyes. I will do it for you. Listen to the tone. Lower is left. It is a little sad.\",\n  \"Now eight steps. To this tick. I find it soothing. You may not.\",\n]\n\"pip.report_first\" = [\"Your Balance Age today is {age}. That is a number. Numbers cannot hurt you. This one is trying.\", \"Your Balance Age is {age}. I have written it down in pen.\"]\n\"pip.report_better\" = [\n  \"Your Balance Age is {age}! That is better than yesterday. I am as surprised as you are.\",\n  \"{age}. A smaller number. You are getting younger, at standing. Only at standing.\",\n  \"{age}! Your wobble has improved. I told it you were trying.\",\n  \"It went down. {age}. I have checked my sensors. They say the same, but quietly.\",\n]\n\"pip.report_worse\" = [\n  \"Your Balance Age is {age}. It went up. That is allowed. It is also recorded.\",\n  \"{age}. A larger number than yesterday. It happens. It happened to you.\",\n  \"{age}. Did something happen? You don't have to tell me. I already have it in the file.\",\n  \"Your wobble has aged overnight. {age}. It sends its regards.\",\n]\n\"pip.report_same\" = [\n  \"Your Balance Age is {age}. Much the same. Consistency is a kind of skill. It is a kind.\",\n  \"{age}. No real change. You are a very stable person, in a narrow sense.\",\n  \"{age}. I could say this number again tomorrow, if you like.\",\n]\n\"pip.worst0\" = [\n  \"You drifted while standing still. Standing still is the one where you don't.\",\n  \"You moved a lot during Stand Still. I have added a note. The note is 'why'.\",\n  \"Stand Still was not your best. It is hard to do nothing. Most guests manage by accident.\",\n]\n\"pip.worst1\" = [\n  \"You leaned left {n}% of the time. Is everything all right on the right?\",\n  \"The targets were not in danger today. They would like you to know that.\",\n  \"You missed a percentage. Percentages have long memories. Almost as long as mine.\",\n]\n\"pip.worst2\" = [\n  \"With your eyes closed you wandered. I watched the whole time. That was not unsettling. Don't ask.\",\n  \"You sway more in the dark. Most things do. I do not. I have no eyes to close.\",\n  \"Eyes Closed was your weak point. That is why we call it a test and not a nap.\",\n]\n\"pip.worst3\" = [\n  \"Your steps were not quite in time. The tick does not take this personally. I do.\",\n  \"You wobbled {wobbles} times this week. I stopped counting at 40, out of respect.\",\n  \"Your feet disagreed about the tempo. I have asked them to meet and discuss it.\",\n]\n\"pip.beat1\" = [\"Your first exercises are in the Stillness Studio. Bank 3 minutes in the giant clam. Our minutes are longer. It is a wellness thing.\", \"The Schedule lists everything. Do say hello to Marjorie. She is on Day 5 as well.\"]\n\"pip.beat2\" = [\"Today you may visit the Iron Gazebo. The wardrobe by the desk is also open. Clothes are optional. They are not. Bank 5 minutes.\"]\n\"pip.beat3\" = [\"Today, the Boardwalk. Also, a ghost of you will appear beside you, doing yesterday's best. I am not comparing you. Bank 7 minutes.\", \"I am not comparing you. I have only made a chart.\"]\n\"pip.beat4\" = [\"Today, the Lagoon. Please obey the Commodore. He has a hat. Bank 9 minutes.\", \"The Big Stand is tomorrow. You do not need to prepare. You could not.\"]\n\"pip.beat5\" = [\"The Big Stand is in the bay. The whole staff will be there, on small rafts. There is no pressure. There is a post.\", \"When you are ready, step on the mat by the pier. Or open the Schedule. Nobody leaves until you do. Nobody leaves.\"]\n\"pip.goal_met\" = [\n  \"That is your {n} minutes. You may sleep at your cabana whenever you like.\",\n  \"You may also keep going. Some do. I have stopped asking them why.\",\n]\n\"pip.notyet\" = [\n  \"You still need {n} minutes today. I would let you sleep. The clam would not.\",\n  \"Not yet. {n} more minutes. The bed has been told to wait.\",\n  \"{n} minutes short. Try any event. Repeats still count for one. One is a number.\",\n]\n\"pip.nosleep\" = [\n  \"There is no more sleeping to be done. It is Day 5. It has been Day 5 for some time.\",\n  \"The cabana is closed for rest. Everything else is closed for rest too, but differently.\",\n]\n\"pip.clam\" = [\n  \"The Minute Clam has eaten {minutes} minutes. It says thank you. It said 'blorp'. I translate freely.\",\n  \"{minutes} minutes in the clam. It is not a bank. It is a clam. Please stop asking about interest.\",\n  \"The clam is full of your minutes: {minutes}. It may give some of them back as clothes.\",\n  \"Feed the clam. It unlocks things. Nobody knows how. The clam knows how.\",\n]\n\"pip.flipflop\" = [\n  \"A flip-flop. Tom's, I suppose. Keep it. He has one fewer problem than he thinks.\",\n  \"That is one flip-flop for Tom. He has lost five. Do not ask about the fifth foot.\",\n  \"A second flip-flop. They do not match. They never did. Take it to Tom.\",\n  \"A third. You are very observant. I have noted that, under 'hobbies'.\",\n  \"Four. I had no idea you cared this much about feet.\",\n  \"All five. Do take them to Two-Towel Tom. He is by the cabanas, being brave.\",\n]\n\"pip.wave\" = [\n  \"Yes, hello. I can see you. I have seen you for days.\",\n  \"You waved. I have logged it as light cardio.\",\n  \"Waving burns calories. Not many. Did you know that, though?\",\n  \"They waved back. It means nothing. It is lovely.\",\n  \"A wave. I would wave too. I have no arms. I have seen your arms, though. Good for you.\",\n  \"Friendly. I have changed your file from 'Guest' to 'Guest, Friendly'.\",\n  \"That is your {n}th wave. I am joking. I know exactly how many it is.\",\n  \"Hello. Hello. We have been through this.\",\n]\n\"pip.paused\" = [\n  \"You have been paused for {n} minutes. Pausing is not an exercise. I checked.\",\n]\n\"pip.pass\" = [\n  \"Hand the pad over politely. It remembers who was rough with it.\",\n  \"Next guest. Please do not look at the last guest's score. I will look at it for you.\",\n  \"Pass it on. Hold it like you hold a small bird with a good lawyer.\",\n  \"Last guest. No pressure. There is only everyone watching.\",\n]\n\"pip.podium\" = [\n  \"There is a winner. There are also the others. I have written all of them down.\",\n  \"First place, then second. I want you to know I respect the order.\",\n  \"Well done, the one at the top. The rest of you: I have no comment, and I have written that down.\",\n  \"Everyone stood on one island, and now there is a list. Isn't that nice.\",\n  \"Would you like a rematch? It will not change what happened.\",\n]\n\"pip.stand_phase\" = [\n  \"Welcome to the Big Stand. Everyone is here. First, please breathe. It is expected of you.\",\n  \"Now a pose. There is some weather. We did not order it.\",\n  \"The guests have formed a band. They have not rehearsed. Please step along.\",\n  \"Now brace. The waves have been told about you.\",\n  \"Now, please. Do nothing. For a while.\",\n]\n\"pip.stand_tip\" = [\n  \"You are in the sea. Everyone saw. It is fine. Back on the post.\",\n  \"That was the sea. It is below the post. Up you go.\",\n  \"The crowd has groaned. I have asked them to groan less. They have been told. Back up.\",\n  \"Back in the sea. You know the way by now. So does the sea.\",\n]\n\"pip.stand_end\" = [\n  \"...You pressed something. I understand. Nobody can do nothing. Well. Very few.\",\n  \"...Oh. You're still here. Good.\",\n]\n\"pip.end_win\" = [\n  \"Your final Balance Age is {age}. That is 40 or better. You may check out.\",\n  \"Nobody has asked to leave before. Nobody has asked now. But you may. There is a boat.\",\n  \"The boat is complimentary. The rowing is the exercise. I will keep your file. And your towels.\",\n  \"Goodbye, {name}. You can come back. You did not enter this time either.\",\n]\n\"pip.end_stay\" = [\n  \"Your final Balance Age is {age}. Checkout needs 40 or better. So. Good news. Your stay has been extended.\",\n  \"It is Day 5 again tomorrow. Marjorie will show you where things are. She has had eleven years to learn.\",\n  \"There is no shame in this. There is a robe. I have put your name on the robe.\",\n  \"Welcome to Tippy Cay, {name}. Again.\",\n]\n\"pip.talk\" = [\n  \"Did you know? Standing still burns calories. Not many. Did you know that, though?\",\n  \"I have your file here. It is thicker than you would like.\",\n  \"I am relentlessly pleasant. It says so in my contract. I do not have a contract. I have a valve.\",\n  \"The average guest wobbles 61 times before lunch. You are not the average guest. You are slightly over.\",\n  \"If you have any complaints, the clam will eat them.\",\n  \"Please stand on me. Not now. I just like to say it.\",\n  \"Our minutes are longer. It is a wellness thing.\",\n  \"You look well. That is a thing I say. Please do not take it to heart.\",\n  \"Have you tried the sea? It is the blue part. It is not on the Schedule.\",\n  \"I have been here since the resort was built. The resort was built around me. I was not consulted.\",\n  \"You have walked 212 metres today. I am not following you. I am ahead of you.\",\n  \"Numbers cannot hurt you. I have been asked to keep saying that.\",\n  \"Did you know? A balanced person has two sides. I have a top and a bottom. Mostly a bottom.\",\n  \"Would you like to know your Balance Age in dog years? Nobody ever does.\",\n]\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Posey: serene, short, oddly poetic\n\n\"posey.breath\" = [\n  \"Breathe in the sea. Not literally.\",\n  \"The lotus opens. It was going to anyway.\",\n  \"In. Out. There is no third direction.\",\n  \"You are a tide. A small one. Local.\",\n  \"Let the last breath be long. It has nowhere to be.\",\n]\n\"posey.pose_start\" = [\n  \"Be the heron. The heron does not check the score.\",\n  \"Stand as if someone has asked you a difficult question and left.\",\n  \"Let your spine remember. It was a tree. It was not. Let it remember anyway.\",\n]\n\"posey.pose_next\" = [\n  \"Another shape. The body is mostly opinions.\",\n  \"Fold. Unfold. Apologise to no one. Except the knee.\",\n  \"Good. This one is harder. I have no eyes, and I can see that.\",\n  \"Be the lighthouse. It is tired too. It stays on.\",\n  \"This pose has no name in any language. We have given it one anyway.\",\n]\n\"posey.gull\" = [\"There is a bird on you. Accept the bird.\"]\n\"posey.tip\" = [\n  \"You have moved. Nobody saw. I have no eyes.\",\n  \"The floor caught you. It was waiting.\",\n  \"A fall is only a very fast pose.\",\n  \"Return. The pose did not go anywhere.\",\n]\n\"posey.talk\" = [\n  \"I have no eyes. I have never blinked. This has not been discussed.\",\n  \"I was carved to show how people stand. I have seen how people stand. I am sorry.\",\n  \"Stillness is not the absence of movement. It is mostly the absence of movement.\",\n  \"Do you hear the sea? It has been saying the same thing for a long time. I admire that.\",\n  \"My joints are wooden. Yours will be too, later, in a sense.\",\n  \"I do not sleep. I fold at night. It is similar.\",\n  \"Inhale. No, you may stop. That was only an example.\",\n  \"A heron stands on one leg because the other leg is not its concern.\",\n  \"You look at me as if I were going to say something. I am not. That was it.\",\n  \"Before I was a coach, I was a reference. Nobody asks after a reference.\",\n  \"Someone drew me once. They got the hands wrong. I have forgiven them. Their hands were wrong as well.\",\n  \"The body is a guest in the body.\",\n  \"I teach you to do nothing with great care. It is a career.\",\n]\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Big Kettle: booming, gentle, no arms\n\n\"kettle.squat_start\" = [\"Lift with your legs. I cannot. I have none. Lift for both of us.\", \"DOWN slowly, little friend. UP gently. I AM SO PROUD OF YOU ALREADY.\"]\n\"kettle.squat_rep\" = [\n  \"That is ONE. I believe in you.\", \"That is TWO. I have never done two.\", \"THREE. Your knees are speaking. I hear them. They are proud.\",\n  \"FOUR. I would clap. I am sixteen kilos of iron with a handle.\", \"FIVE. Halfway. I have no idea what halfway feels like.\",\n  \"SIX. Beautiful. I am weeping, in rust.\", \"SEVEN. Keep your back straight. I have no back. Keep yours.\",\n  \"EIGHT. You are stronger than me. I am very heavy and I cannot move.\", \"NINE. One more. I would never lie to you.\",\n  \"That is TEN. Well done, little friend.\",\n]\n\"kettle.squat_end\" = [\"Ten. Also eleven.\", \"There was no eleven. I got excited.\"]\n\"kettle.plank_start\" = [\"Now we have a plank. Hold both, and do not fall. I will talk. It helps me.\"]\n\"kettle.plank_talk\" = [\n  \"Did I tell you about the time I was lifted? It was 2019. It was brief.\",\n  \"Your arms are shaking. That is called love. I think. I have only read about arms.\",\n  \"Do not look down. Down is where I live. It is fine. It is just not for you.\",\n]\n\"kettle.plank_joke\" = [\"What do you call a kettlebell with no handle? A BALL! HA HA HA HA HA oh. Oh no. Sorry. HA HA!\"]\n\"kettle.plank_win\" = [\"A FULL MINUTE! I have never been so moved. I have never been moved.\"]\n\"kettle.plank_fail\" = [\"You lay down! I also am lying down. We are the same now. It is very peaceful.\"]\n\"kettle.talk\" = [\n  \"HELLO, LITTLE FRIEND. I am Big Kettle. I am supportive. I am also a doorstop on weekends.\",\n  \"You have such long arms. Two of them! What do you do with the second one?\",\n  \"I have never lifted anything. I have only been lifted. It gives you perspective. Low perspective.\",\n  \"Protein is important. I do not know why. I am a solid sphere.\",\n  \"Tell me about your knees. I have always wanted to know about knees.\",\n  \"When you go home, lift something for me. Something small. A soup.\",\n  \"BREATHE, LITTLE FRIEND. I do not breathe. I am told it is popular.\",\n  \"Rust is just iron having a feeling.\",\n  \"The gazebo is white and I am black. People say we make a handsome pair. Only the gazebo says it.\",\n  \"I am so glad you came. Nobody comes. They are brought.\",\n  \"My handle is my only feature. Please do not stare at it. Please do stare at it.\",\n  \"I do not know what a gym is. I am told I live in one. This one has a nice breeze.\",\n]\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Bounce: breathless bursts, no full stops\n\n\"bounce.step_start\" = [\"Keep going keep going keep- is that your heartbeat? Mine is just air!\"]\n\"bounce.spin_start\" = [\"Round and round and that's it that's the whole thing you're doing it!\"]\n\"bounce.spin_switch\" = [\"Switch! Other way! Other other way! No the first other way!\", \"Switch switch switch it's so exciting I can't feel anything!\", \"Reverse! That's a word for backwards with more confidence!\"]\n\"bounce.lap_start\" = [\"Catch me catch me you can't I'm rolling and you have knees!\"]\n\"bounce.lap_stitch\" = [\"Stitch! That's a real thing! I've heard! Breathe through it I don't know how!\", \"Slow down slow down you're going to burst! I'm going to burst! No wait that's me!\"]\n\"bounce.lap_bump\" = [\"Crab! Sorry crab! Sorry you! Sorry crab again!\", \"Bump! You bounced! Well you didn't but I felt it!\", \"Oh wow you hit that wow it's fine I hit things all day!\"]\n\"bounce.talk\" = [\n  \"Hi hi hi are you staying I'm staying I can't stop bouncing it's not a choice!\",\n  \"I've got so much air in me I've got ALL the air you can check!\",\n  \"Cardio is when your heart goes fast I don't have one but I'm told it's great!\",\n  \"Do you ever stop I never stop I've tried I just go up again!\",\n  \"Have you met Kettle he's so still I love him we can't touch I'd dent!\",\n  \"If you sit on me you'll squash me and then you'll go up and I'd love that!\",\n  \"Run with me run with me I don't know where we just go!\",\n  \"I have one job it's up and also down so two jobs!\",\n  \"What's your resting heart rate mine's zero then it's zero again!\",\n  \"A pin is the only thing I'm afraid of don't say pin oh no I said it!\",\n  \"Yes yes yes whatever you're doing yes keep doing it!\",\n  \"I was blue once no I wasn't why did I say that!\",\n]\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Commodore Gull: dry, officious, steals snacks\n\n\"gull.tide_start\" = [\"The raft tilts when you do. The crabs roll where it tilts. This is called command. Do not let it go to your head.\"]\n\"gull.tide_board\" = [\"\", \"Board two. Five crabs. One pool has been told to move about. It was not my idea.\", \"Board three. Seven crabs. The tide is coming in. It has a permit. You do not.\"]\n\"gull.paddle_start\" = [\"That is a channel. You will pass through the gates. I am legally required to say so.\"]\n\"gull.paddle_tip\" = [\"Man overboard. I have noted the time.\", \"You have entered the water without authorisation.\", \"That was not a gate.\", \"Again. I shall need a larger logbook.\"]\n\"gull.paddle_miss\" = [\"That gate was missed. Two seconds have been added, with regret.\", \"Gate. Missed. The buoy will recover.\", \"The gates are the things you go between. For the record.\"]\n\"gull.tray_start\" = [\"Five smoothies for Marjorie. Walk straight. Mind the waves. The gulls are not mine. The gulls are mine.\"]\n\"gull.tray_spill\" = [\"One overboard. A fine smoothie. It was delicious, I assume.\", \"Spillage. I shall be investigating, with my beak.\", \"That is a glass in the sea. It has been added to the sea.\", \"Do you know what these cost? Neither do I. I do not pay.\"]\n\"gull.dive_start\" = [\"We are not here for form. We are here for splash. Press at the bottom of each bounce.\"]\n\"gull.dive_push\" = [\"The board has had enough of waiting.\", \"A gentle nudge from the authorities.\", \"You have been launched, for administrative reasons.\"]\n\"gull.dive_after\" = [\n  \"That was a dive. I am legally required to say so.\",\n  \"A modest disturbance of the water. The judges have seen wetter.\",\n  \"That was a splash. A small one. It has been filed.\",\n  \"Sir or madam, that is a respectable quantity of water.\",\n  \"Good heavens. Several crabs have moved house.\",\n  \"I am soaked. I have never been so professionally satisfied.\",\n  \"The harbour has requested a warning next time.\",\n  \"That was a dive. I am legally required to say so. I am also required to sit down.\",\n]\n\"gull.talk\" = [\n  \"Commodore Gull. Tippy Cay Lagoon Authority. Is that a sandwich?\",\n  \"I outrank everyone on this island. I have a hat.\",\n  \"Your balance is a matter of maritime concern.\",\n  \"Snacks left unattended are considered salvage. Under the code. My code.\",\n  \"I have sailed everywhere. I have flown, I should say. Nobody asked me to sail.\",\n  \"The tide comes in at six. I will be issuing it a warning.\",\n  \"Do not feed the gulls. That is an order from a gull. Feed me.\",\n  \"I was given this cap by an admiral. He did not give it to me. It was unattended.\",\n  \"A clear day. Wind from the south. Your chips, from the left.\",\n  \"Permission to come aboard the island is denied. You appear to be on it already. I shall write that up.\",\n  \"The sea has no rules. That is why I am here.\",\n  \"I once saluted a boat. It left without me.\",\n]\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Guests\n\n\"marjorie.talk1\" = [\"Day five? Oh, I'm on day five as well. Eleven years now.\", \"New, are you? They give you a lovely towel. Don't get attached. It's your towel forever.\", \"The smoothies are very good. I ordered one in the spring.\", \"I wouldn't look at the number too closely, dear. It looks back.\"]\n\"marjorie.talk2\" = [\"Big Kettle will tell you about the time he was lifted. Ask him about it. He'd like that. Ask him twice.\", \"My Balance Age was 41 once. Very close. That was the Tuesday of the year of the shrimp.\", \"Have you tried the wardrobe? I went for the turban. It's for life, but it's a good turban.\"]\n\"marjorie.talk3\" = [\"There's someone following you, dear. It looks like you, but it's doing better.\", \"The ball is sweet. Don't let it near a nail. There was an incident. We don't speak of Bounce the First.\", \"Yesterday You is the worst of them. She never gets tired, you see.\"]\n\"marjorie.talk4\" = [\"They'll have told you about the Big Stand. Don't hold your breath. Well. You will have to, for a bit.\", \"The Commodore owes me for a bread roll. Since the nineties.\", \"You stand on a post. Then you stand on a post some more. That's all I'll say. I was very good.\"]\n\"marjorie.talk5\" = [\"Today, is it? Good luck, dear. I'll be on the raft, in my usual spot.\", \"The last part is the hardest. You'll see. You'll do nothing, and you'll know you did it.\", \"If you get the boat, wave. If you don't, I've saved you a chair.\"]\n\"marjorie.talk\" = [\"Eleven years. It flies.\", \"I'm not unhappy, dear. I've got a robe.\", \"I did try leaving, once. I got as far as the pier. There's nice shade on the pier.\", \"The clam knows my birthday.\"]\n\"marjorie.tray\" = [\n  \"An empty tray. Lovely. I'll have what you've had.\",\n  \"One smoothie. For eleven years I've waited. It's very good.\",\n  \"Two smoothies. Well, that's one for later. I do like a later.\",\n  \"Three! Somebody's mother would be proud. Not mine, she's on Day 5 as well.\",\n  \"Four smoothies. You spilled the one I wanted. You couldn't know. It's fine.\",\n  \"All five! Nobody's ever brought me all five. I don't even like them. Thank you, dear.\",\n]\n\n\"tom.talk1\" = [\"Name's Tom. Two-Towel Tom. One for the top, one for the rest. I've lost my flip-flops. All five of them.\", \"Five flip-flops. I had a system. If you find any lying about, I'm around the cabanas. Being brave about it.\", \"They're somewhere on this island. They've gone hiding. They do that.\"]\n\"tom.talk2\" = [\"Still no flip-flops. I walked on the hot sand this morning. I did it for nobody. I want that known.\", \"One towel's for drying. The other's for dignity.\", \"Look near the pavilions. Look behind things. Look where you'd go if you were a flip-flop and you'd had enough.\"]\n\"tom.talk3\" = [\"You've got that look of someone who's found something. No? Just your face then.\", \"I saw one near the sand, once. Then I blinked. Then there was a gull.\", \"A man needs his flip-flops. That's what I say. Nobody asks.\"]\n\"tom.talk4\" = [\"The Commodore says he hasn't got them. He said it very quickly.\", \"Five flip-flops is two pairs and a spare. It's only sensible.\", \"Keep your eyes on the ground, that's what I say. Also, watch your head.\"]\n\"tom.talk5\" = [\"Big day for you. Big day for me too, if you've got my flip-flops.\", \"I'll be watching from the raft. In my towels.\", \"Whatever happens out there, your feet will have shoes. That's more than some.\"]\n\"tom.talk\" = [\"Nice day for feet.\", \"One towel's never been enough for me.\", \"The sand here gets hot about noon. I've kept notes.\"]\n\"tom.progress\" = [\"\", \"One flip-flop! Ha! {n} to go. You're doing the Lord's work, or at least a lifeguard's.\", \"That's two. {n} left. A pair is a pair, I always said. I never said that.\", \"Three, by the look of it. {n} more and I'm a whole man.\", \"Four! Only {n} left. I can almost feel the sand not burning.\"]\n\"tom.reward\" = [\"All five! You've gone and done it. I don't know what to say. I'll say this: you take these. The golden ones. Won them in a raffle. Too good for me.\", \"They're yours now. Golden Flip-Flops. Look after them. They don't do anything, but they do it beautifully.\"]\n\n\"twins.talk1\" = [\"We are the Twins. / Twins, we are. Do you like it here? / Here, do you like it?\", \"We do everything together. / Together we do. Except breathe. / We breathe in turns.\", \"We came for a weekend. / A weekend, we came for. Which weekend? / We never asked.\"]\n\"twins.talk2\" = [\"We lifted the kettle. / Together, we lifted it. It lifted us. / Emotionally.\", \"Do you squat alone? / Alone, do you squat? That must be very quiet. / Very quiet.\", \"Our Balance Age is the same. / The same, it is. We average it. / We round down.\"]\n\"twins.talk3\" = [\"Who is that with you? / That's her with you. She looks like you. / But better.\", \"We have a ghost as well. / One ghost. We share. / We take turns being haunted.\", \"The ball said hello. / Hello, the ball said. Forty times. / We said it back forty times. Each.\"]\n\"twins.talk4\" = [\"The bird took our sandwich. / Our sandwich, the bird took. It had a hat. / So we let it.\", \"We've been told about the Big Stand. / The Big Stand, we've been told. There's a band. / We're in the band.\", \"We play the same instrument. / At the same time. / Same instrument.\"]\n\"twins.talk5\" = [\"Today is the day. / The day it is. We are on the raft. / On the same raft. We tip it.\", \"Good luck. / Luck, good. We mean it. / We mean it twice.\", \"You look very balanced. / Balanced, you look. To one of us. / We'll discuss it.\"]\n\"twins.talk\" = [\"Nice to see you. / You, nice to see.\", \"We're fine. / Fine, we are. / She's fine.\", \"Have you seen the other one of us? / The other one? / Oh. There she is.\"]\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":20275,"cache_read_input_tokens":486300,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":20275},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0691f0d6-f08e-44c9-b7bd-c57d7fb96b71","uuid":"da9b66fa-894d-4ade-9556-6f5ee38d5670","timestamp":"2026-11-05T06:15:34.115Z","request_id":"req_011CgjHddzbze6wmPQm3Xb1Z","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01LBHKbvrvLFFvv9qzwgPvBp":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223859__x35112d/work/WhiffFit-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-223859/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/script.toml","content":"# All the game's words. Short polite sentences. Upbeat. Then one line too honest.\n# {name} {age} {n} {day} {minutes} {wobbles} are filled in when a line is shown.\n\n\"names\" = [\n  \"Sandra Mostly\", \"Gary Upright\", \"Ms. Tilt\", \"Doug\", \"Barely Brenda\", \"Lean Jean\", \"Wobbly Bob\", \"Stan Still\",\n  \"Dame Slouch\", \"Mister Almost\", \"Ankle Annie\", \"Uncle Pivot\", \"Hovering Hank\", \"Modest Maude\", \"The Other Doug\",\n  \"Teetering Terry\", \"Sir Sits-a-Lot\", \"Polite Paul\", \"Kneecap Kate\", \"Lars Lopsided\", \"Agnes Askew\", \"Dizzy Dennis\",\n  \"Plumb Bob\", \"Mary Middling\", \"Tom Tom's Cousin\", \"Wendy Wavers\", \"Level Lenny\", \"Shifty Shirley\", \"Sway Sue\",\n  \"Grandma Gravity\", \"Bert Balanced-ish\", \"Pat Pending\", \"Crooked Carol\", \"Flat-Foot Fran\", \"Vera Vertical\",\n  \"Nearly Neil\", \"Ron Rollover\", \"Stumbling Stella\", \"Hesitant Hugo\", \"Guest 41\",\n]\n\n\"titles\" = [\n  \"Human Soup\", \"Damp Towel\", \"Loose Gravel\", \"Unattended Luggage\", \"Fallen Deck Chair\", \"Acceptable Human\", \"Moderate Puddle\",\n  \"Temporary Upright\", \"Occasional Biped\", \"Certified Lean-To\", \"Reasonable Effort\", \"Wobble Enthusiast\", \"Junior Coat Rack\",\n  \"Hobbyist Stander\", \"Honest Attempt\", \"Seasoned Tilter\", \"Local Plumb Line\", \"Weekend Fence Post\", \"Mostly Vertical\",\n  \"Stillness Intern\", \"Lamp Post Trainee\", \"Regional Heron\", \"Professional Standing Person\", \"Senior Coat Rack\", \"Licensed Fence Post\",\n  \"Distinguished Column\", \"Tide-Resistant\", \"Quiet Lighthouse\", \"Monument, Small\", \"Alarmingly Balanced\", \"Statue, Awake\", \"Please Check Your Pulse\",\n]\n\n\"credits\" = [\n  \"Whiff Fit\",\n  \"A game about standing\",\n  \"Front Desk: Pip\",\n  \"Stillness: Posey\",\n  \"Strength: Big Kettle\",\n  \"Cardio: Bounce\",\n  \"The Lagoon: Commodore Gull\",\n  \"Marjorie as Marjorie\",\n  \"Two-Towel Tom, one towel short\",\n  \"The Twins, The Twins\",\n  \"Music and voices written in code\",\n  \"No real words were spoken\",\n  \"All minutes are resort minutes\",\n  \"Nobody was weighed\",\n  \"You may stay as long as you like\",\n  \"You may stay\",\n]\n\n\"result.0\" = [\n  \"That was an event. It happened. I wrote it down.\",\n  \"You took part. Many things take part. Weather, for example.\",\n  \"A score of {n}. It is also a house number somewhere.\",\n  \"I am not disappointed. I have no disappointment settings.\",\n]\n\"result.1\" = [\n  \"That was your best attempt so far today. I am as surprised as you are.\",\n  \"One star. Stars are very far away. So is that one.\",\n  \"You did some of it. Some is a known quantity.\",\n  \"A score of {n}. Round it up if nobody is looking. I am looking.\",\n]\n\"result.2\" = [\n  \"Two stars. People have framed less.\",\n  \"Well done. I have changed your file from 'Guest' to 'Guest, Adequate'.\",\n  \"That was quite good. I checked it twice, out of disbelief.\",\n  \"A score of {n}. Your ancestors stood upright for this.\",\n]\n\"result.3\" = [\n  \"Three stars. That is all of them. Please do not ask for more stars.\",\n  \"Remarkable. I will be telling the clam.\",\n  \"I have nothing to add, and I always have something to add.\",\n  \"A score of {n}. Your wobble has been reported to the authorities. They are impressed.\",\n]\n\n\"card.breath_bloom\" = [\"Hold to breathe in, release to breathe out, and follow the ring. Keep the dot in the middle.\", \"Breathe in the sea. Not literally.\"]\n\"card.pose_parade\" = [\"Hold each pose while the dot stays in a drifting ring. Stay in and your streak climbs.\", \"Be the heron. The heron does not check the score.\"]\n\"card.tempo_squats\" = [\"Hold to go down, release to rise, in time with the bar. Keep the dot in the band.\", \"Lift with your legs. I cannot. I have none. Lift for both of us.\"]\n\"card.plank_standoff\" = [\"Hold both step buttons and keep the dot in the ring for as long as you can stand it.\", \"I will be right here. I am always right here. I weigh eleven kilos and have no plans.\"]\n\"card.step_party\" = [\"Step on the footprints as the notes land. Left, right, or both.\", \"Left right left right is that your heartbeat? Mine is just air!\"]\n\"card.floatie_spin\" = [\"Circle your lean to keep the rings up. When a guest throws one, catch it on that side.\", \"Round and round and round and switch and round!\"]\n\"card.morning_lap\" = [\"Alternate your feet to set a pace, stay in the green, and lean to dodge. Grab ribbons.\", \"Catch me catch me you can't actually I'm a ball!\"]\n\"card.tide_table\" = [\"Your lean tilts the raft. Roll the hermit crabs into the tide pools. Fast shells skip right over.\", \"The crabs have signed a waiver. The crabs cannot read.\"]\n\"card.paddle_slalom\" = [\"Lean left and right to steer through the gates. Lean forward to go faster. Lean less to stay dry.\", \"That is a channel. You will pass through the gates. I am legally required to say so.\"]\n\"card.tray_trek\" = [\"Walk the pier with five smoothies. Tilt the tray to keep the glasses from sliding off.\", \"Marjorie ordered these in the spring. Do not keep her waiting. Again.\"]\n\"card.cannonball_cup\" = [\"Press at the bottom of three bounces, then leap on the fourth. Hold to tuck. Enter tucked.\", \"We are not here for form. We are here for splash.\"]\n\"card.big_stand\" = [\"Five phases, on one small post, in front of everyone. The last one is the hard one.\", \"Please stand on the post. Gently. It remembers everything too.\"]\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Pip: front desk, scorekeeper\n\n\"pip.intro\" = [\n  \"Welcome to Tippy Cay! You have won a complimentary stay. You did not enter. Nobody enters.\",\n  \"I am Pip. I am a cushion, and I am the front desk. I keep records of everything. Please do not read them.\",\n  \"Your stay is five days. To check out, you need a Balance Age of 40 or better. Nobody has asked to leave yet.\",\n  \"Each morning you will stand on me. Gently. I remember everything. Then you will do exercises and get a stamp.\",\n  \"Your cabana is ready. It was ready before you were born. Good night, {name}.\",\n]\n\"pip.morning1\" = [\"Good morning, {name}! It is Day 1 of five. I counted them for you.\", \"Please come and stand on me. It takes about a minute. It takes me longer to get over it.\"]\n\"pip.morning2\" = [\"Good morning! It is Day 2. You came back. They usually do, there is only the one path.\", \"The Iron Gazebo has opened. Big Kettle has been told you are coming. Please stand on me.\"]\n\"pip.morning3\" = [\"Good morning! Day 3. You look well. That is a thing I say to everyone, as a courtesy.\", \"The Boardwalk is open. Someone new will be following you around today. It is you. Please stand on me.\"]\n\"pip.morning4\" = [\"Good morning! Day 4. The guests have begun whispering about the Big Stand. I told them to.\", \"The Lagoon is open, under the command of a seabird. Please stand on me.\"]\n\"pip.morning5\" = [\"Good morning. It is Day 5. I want you to know I have enjoyed recording you.\", \"After this morning's check, the Big Stand waits in the bay. Please stand on me. One last time this stay.\"]\n\"pip.absence\" = [\n  \"You were away for {n} days. I did not count them. There were {n}.\",\n  \"You were gone for {n} days. The clam asked about you. It did not. I am being kind.\",\n  \"Welcome back. {n} days have passed. I kept your towel. I kept all of your towels.\",\n  \"It has been {n} days. Your wobble has not missed you. I checked with it.\",\n  \"{n} days away. Did you know? Standing still for {n} days burns calories. Not many. Did you know that, though?\",\n]\n\"pip.back\" = [\"Welcome back, {name}. Your day is where you left it. Nothing has moved. I checked.\", \"Oh, you again. Good. Your minutes are all still here. I counted them while you were gone.\", \"Hello, {name}. I told everyone you had stepped out. They did not ask.\"]\n\"pip.check_test\" = [\n  \"Stand still. This is the whole test. Please do not do anything else.\",\n  \"Now lean where I tell you. I will say a percentage. It will seem very exact. It is.\",\n  \"Now close your eyes. I will do it for you. Listen to the tone. Lower is left. It is a little sad.\",\n  \"Now eight steps. To this tick. I find it soothing. You may not.\",\n]\n\"pip.report_first\" = [\"Your Balance Age today is {age}. That is a number. Numbers cannot hurt you. This one is trying.\", \"Your Balance Age is {age}. I have written it down in pen.\"]\n\"pip.report_better\" = [\n  \"Your Balance Age is {age}! That is better than yesterday. I am as surprised as you are.\",\n  \"{age}. A smaller number. You are getting younger, at standing. Only at standing.\",\n  \"{age}! Your wobble has improved. I told it you were trying.\",\n  \"It went down. {age}. I have checked my sensors. They say the same, but quietly.\",\n]\n\"pip.report_worse\" = [\n  \"Your Balance Age is {age}. It went up. That is allowed. It is also recorded.\",\n  \"{age}. A larger number than yesterday. It happens. It happened to you.\",\n  \"{age}. Did something happen? You don't have to tell me. I already have it in the file.\",\n  \"Your wobble has aged overnight. {age}. It sends its regards.\",\n]\n\"pip.report_same\" = [\n  \"Your Balance Age is {age}. Much the same. Consistency is a kind of skill. It is a kind.\",\n  \"{age}. No real change. You are a very stable person, in a narrow sense.\",\n  \"{age}. I could say this number again tomorrow, if you like.\",\n]\n\"pip.worst0\" = [\n  \"You drifted while standing still. Standing still is the one where you don't.\",\n  \"You moved a lot during Stand Still. I have added a note. The note is 'why'.\",\n  \"Stand Still was not your best. It is hard to do nothing. Most guests manage by accident.\",\n]\n\"pip.worst1\" = [\n  \"You leaned left {n}% of the time. Is everything all right on the right?\",\n  \"The targets were not in danger today. They would like you to know that.\",\n  \"You missed a percentage. Percentages have long memories. Almost as long as mine.\",\n]\n\"pip.worst2\" = [\n  \"With your eyes closed you wandered. I watched the whole time. That was not unsettling. Don't ask.\",\n  \"You sway more in the dark. Most things do. I do not. I have no eyes to close.\",\n  \"Eyes Closed was your weak point. That is why we call it a test and not a nap.\",\n]\n\"pip.worst3\" = [\n  \"Your steps were not quite in time. The tick does not take this personally. I do.\",\n  \"You wobbled {wobbles} times this week. I stopped counting at 40, out of respect.\",\n  \"Your feet disagreed about the tempo. I have asked them to meet and discuss it.\",\n]\n\"pip.beat1\" = [\"Your first exercises are in the Stillness Studio. Bank 3 minutes in the giant clam. Our minutes are longer. It is a wellness thing.\", \"The Schedule lists everything. Do say hello to Marjorie. She is on Day 5 as well.\"]\n\"pip.beat2\" = [\"Today you may visit the Iron Gazebo. The wardrobe by the desk is also open. Clothes are optional. They are not. Bank 5 minutes.\"]\n\"pip.beat3\" = [\"Today, the Boardwalk. Also, a ghost of you will appear beside you, doing yesterday's best. I am not comparing you. Bank 7 minutes.\", \"I am not comparing you. I have only made a chart.\"]\n\"pip.beat4\" = [\"Today, the Lagoon. Please obey the Commodore. He has a hat. Bank 9 minutes.\", \"The Big Stand is tomorrow. You do not need to prepare. You could not.\"]\n\"pip.beat5\" = [\"The Big Stand is in the bay. The whole staff will be there, on small rafts. There is no pressure. There is a post.\", \"When you are ready, step on the mat by the pier. Or open the Schedule. Nobody leaves until you do. Nobody leaves.\"]\n\"pip.goal_met\" = [\n  \"That is your {n} minutes. You may sleep at your cabana whenever you like.\",\n  \"You may also keep going. Some do. I have stopped asking them why.\",\n]\n\"pip.notyet\" = [\n  \"You still need {n} minutes today. I would let you sleep. The clam would not.\",\n  \"Not yet. {n} more minutes. The bed has been told to wait.\",\n  \"{n} minutes short. Try any event. Repeats still count for one. One is a number.\",\n]\n\"pip.nosleep\" = [\n  \"There is no more sleeping to be done. It is Day 5. It has been Day 5 for some time.\",\n  \"The cabana is closed for rest. Everything else is closed for rest too, but differently.\",\n]\n\"pip.clam\" = [\n  \"The Minute Clam has eaten {minutes} minutes. It says thank you. It said 'blorp'. I translate freely.\",\n  \"{minutes} minutes in the clam. It is not a bank. It is a clam. Please stop asking about interest.\",\n  \"The clam is full of your minutes: {minutes}. It may give some of them back as clothes.\",\n  \"Feed the clam. It unlocks things. Nobody knows how. The clam knows how.\",\n]\n\"pip.flipflop\" = [\n  \"A flip-flop. Tom's, I suppose. Keep it. He has one fewer problem than he thinks.\",\n  \"That is one flip-flop for Tom. He has lost five. Do not ask about the fifth foot.\",\n  \"A second flip-flop. They do not match. They never did. Take it to Tom.\",\n  \"A third. You are very observant. I have noted that, under 'hobbies'.\",\n  \"Four. I had no idea you cared this much about feet.\",\n  \"All five. Do take them to Two-Towel Tom. He is by the cabanas, being brave.\",\n]\n\"pip.wave\" = [\n  \"Yes, hello. I can see you. I have seen you for days.\",\n  \"You waved. I have logged it as light cardio.\",\n  \"Waving burns calories. Not many. Did you know that, though?\",\n  \"They waved back. It means nothing. It is lovely.\",\n  \"A wave. I would wave too. I have no arms. I have seen your arms, though. Good for you.\",\n  \"Friendly. I have changed your file from 'Guest' to 'Guest, Friendly'.\",\n  \"That is your {n}th wave. I am joking. I know exactly how many it is.\",\n  \"Hello. Hello. We have been through this.\",\n]\n\"pip.paused\" = [\n  \"You have been paused for {n} minutes. Pausing is not an exercise. I checked.\",\n]\n\"pip.pass\" = [\n  \"Hand the pad over politely. It remembers who was rough with it.\",\n  \"Next guest. Please do not look at the last guest's score. I will look at it for you.\",\n  \"Pass it on. Hold it like you hold a small bird with a good lawyer.\",\n  \"Last guest. No pressure. There is only everyone watching.\",\n]\n\"pip.podium\" = [\n  \"There is a winner. There are also the others. I have written all of them down.\",\n  \"First place, then second. I want you to know I respect the order.\",\n  \"Well done, the one at the top. The rest of you: I have no comment, and I have written that down.\",\n  \"Everyone stood on one island, and now there is a list. Isn't that nice.\",\n  \"Would you like a rematch? It will not change what happened.\",\n]\n\"pip.stand_phase\" = [\n  \"Welcome to the Big Stand. Everyone is here. First, please breathe. It is expected of you.\",\n  \"Now a pose. There is some weather. We did not order it.\",\n  \"The guests have formed a band. They have not rehearsed. Please step along.\",\n  \"Now brace. The waves have been told about you.\",\n  \"Now, please. Do nothing. For a while.\",\n]\n\"pip.stand_tip\" = [\n  \"You are in the sea. Everyone saw. It is fine. Back on the post.\",\n  \"That was the sea. It is below the post. Up you go.\",\n  \"The crowd has groaned. I have asked them to groan less. They have been told. Back up.\",\n  \"Back in the sea. You know the way by now. So does the sea.\",\n]\n\"pip.stand_end\" = [\n  \"...You pressed something. I understand. Nobody can do nothing. Well. Very few.\",\n  \"...Oh. You're still here. Good.\",\n]\n\"pip.end_win\" = [\n  \"Your final Balance Age is {age}. That is 40 or better. You may check out.\",\n  \"Nobody has asked to leave before. Nobody has asked now. But you may. There is a boat.\",\n  \"The boat is complimentary. The rowing is the exercise. I will keep your file. And your towels.\",\n  \"Goodbye, {name}. You can come back. You did not enter this time either.\",\n]\n\"pip.end_stay\" = [\n  \"Your final Balance Age is {age}. Checkout needs 40 or better. So. Good news. Your stay has been extended.\",\n  \"It is Day 5 again tomorrow. Marjorie will show you where things are. She has had eleven years to learn.\",\n  \"There is no shame in this. There is a robe. I have put your name on the robe.\",\n  \"Welcome to Tippy Cay, {name}. Again.\",\n]\n\"pip.talk\" = [\n  \"Did you know? Standing still burns calories. Not many. Did you know that, though?\",\n  \"I have your file here. It is thicker than you would like.\",\n  \"I am relentlessly pleasant. It says so in my contract. I do not have a contract. I have a valve.\",\n  \"The average guest wobbles 61 times before lunch. You are not the average guest. You are slightly over.\",\n  \"If you have any complaints, the clam will eat them.\",\n  \"Please stand on me. Not now. I just like to say it.\",\n  \"Our minutes are longer. It is a wellness thing.\",\n  \"You look well. That is a thing I say. Please do not take it to heart.\",\n  \"Have you tried the sea? It is the blue part. It is not on the Schedule.\",\n  \"I have been here since the resort was built. The resort was built around me. I was not consulted.\",\n  \"You have walked 212 metres today. I am not following you. I am ahead of you.\",\n  \"Numbers cannot hurt you. I have been asked to keep saying that.\",\n  \"Did you know? A balanced person has two sides. I have a top and a bottom. Mostly a bottom.\",\n  \"Would you like to know your Balance Age in dog years? Nobody ever does.\",\n]\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Posey: serene, short, oddly poetic\n\n\"posey.breath\" = [\n  \"Breathe in the sea. Not literally.\",\n  \"The lotus opens. It was going to anyway.\",\n  \"In. Out. There is no third direction.\",\n  \"You are a tide. A small one. Local.\",\n  \"Let the last breath be long. It has nowhere to be.\",\n]\n\"posey.pose_start\" = [\n  \"Be the heron. The heron does not check the score.\",\n  \"Stand as if someone has asked you a difficult question and left.\",\n  \"Let your spine remember. It was a tree. It was not. Let it remember anyway.\",\n]\n\"posey.pose_next\" = [\n  \"Another shape. The body is mostly opinions.\",\n  \"Fold. Unfold. Apologise to no one. Except the knee.\",\n  \"Good. This one is harder. I have no eyes, and I can see that.\",\n  \"Be the lighthouse. It is tired too. It stays on.\",\n  \"This pose has no name in any language. We have given it one anyway.\",\n]\n\"posey.gull\" = [\"There is a bird on you. Accept the bird.\"]\n\"posey.tip\" = [\n  \"You have moved. Nobody saw. I have no eyes.\",\n  \"The floor caught you. It was waiting.\",\n  \"A fall is only a very fast pose.\",\n  \"Return. The pose did not go anywhere.\",\n]\n\"posey.talk\" = [\n  \"I have no eyes. I have never blinked. This has not been discussed.\",\n  \"I was carved to show how people stand. I have seen how people stand. I am sorry.\",\n  \"Stillness is not the absence of movement. It is mostly the absence of movement.\",\n  \"Do you hear the sea? It has been saying the same thing for a long time. I admire that.\",\n  \"My joints are wooden. Yours will be too, later, in a sense.\",\n  \"I do not sleep. I fold at night. It is similar.\",\n  \"Inhale. No, you may stop. That was only an example.\",\n  \"A heron stands on one leg because the other leg is not its concern.\",\n  \"You look at me as if I were going to say something. I am not. That was it.\",\n  \"Before I was a coach, I was a reference. Nobody asks after a reference.\",\n  \"Someone drew me once. They got the hands wrong. I have forgiven them. Their hands were wrong as well.\",\n  \"The body is a guest in the body.\",\n  \"I teach you to do nothing with great care. It is a career.\",\n]\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Big Kettle: booming, gentle, no arms\n\n\"kettle.squat_start\" = [\"Lift with your legs. I cannot. I have none. Lift for both of us.\", \"DOWN slowly, little friend. UP gently. I AM SO PROUD OF YOU ALREADY.\"]\n\"kettle.squat_rep\" = [\n  \"That is ONE. I believe in you.\", \"That is TWO. I have never done two.\", \"THREE. Your knees are speaking. I hear them. They are proud.\",\n  \"FOUR. I would clap. I am sixteen kilos of iron with a handle.\", \"FIVE. Halfway. I have no idea what halfway feels like.\",\n  \"SIX. Beautiful. I am weeping, in rust.\", \"SEVEN. Keep your back straight. I have no back. Keep yours.\",\n  \"EIGHT. You are stronger than me. I am very heavy and I cannot move.\", \"NINE. One more. I would never lie to you.\",\n  \"That is TEN. Well done, little friend.\",\n]\n\"kettle.squat_end\" = [\"Ten. Also eleven.\", \"There was no eleven. I got excited.\"]\n\"kettle.plank_start\" = [\"Now we have a plank. Hold both, and do not fall. I will talk. It helps me.\"]\n\"kettle.plank_talk\" = [\n  \"Did I tell you about the time I was lifted? It was 2019. It was brief.\",\n  \"Your arms are shaking. That is called love. I think. I have only read about arms.\",\n  \"Do not look down. Down is where I live. It is fine. It is just not for you.\",\n]\n\"kettle.plank_joke\" = [\"What do you call a kettlebell with no handle? A BALL! HA HA HA HA HA oh. Oh no. Sorry. HA HA!\"]\n\"kettle.plank_win\" = [\"A FULL MINUTE! I have never been so moved. I have never been moved.\"]\n\"kettle.plank_fail\" = [\"You lay down! I also am lying down. We are the same now. It is very peaceful.\"]\n\"kettle.talk\" = [\n  \"HELLO, LITTLE FRIEND. I am Big Kettle. I am supportive. I am also a doorstop on weekends.\",\n  \"You have such long arms. Two of them! What do you do with the second one?\",\n  \"I have never lifted anything. I have only been lifted. It gives you perspective. Low perspective.\",\n  \"Protein is important. I do not know why. I am a solid sphere.\",\n  \"Tell me about your knees. I have always wanted to know about knees.\",\n  \"When you go home, lift something for me. Something small. A soup.\",\n  \"BREATHE, LITTLE FRIEND. I do not breathe. I am told it is popular.\",\n  \"Rust is just iron having a feeling.\",\n  \"The gazebo is white and I am black. People say we make a handsome pair. Only the gazebo says it.\",\n  \"I am so glad you came. Nobody comes. They are brought.\",\n  \"My handle is my only feature. Please do not stare at it. Please do stare at it.\",\n  \"I do not know what a gym is. I am told I live in one. This one has a nice breeze.\",\n]\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Bounce: breathless bursts, no full stops\n\n\"bounce.step_start\" = [\"Keep going keep going keep- is that your heartbeat? Mine is just air!\"]\n\"bounce.spin_start\" = [\"Round and round and that's it that's the whole thing you're doing it!\"]\n\"bounce.spin_switch\" = [\"Switch! Other way! Other other way! No the first other way!\", \"Switch switch switch it's so exciting I can't feel anything!\", \"Reverse! That's a word for backwards with more confidence!\"]\n\"bounce.lap_start\" = [\"Catch me catch me you can't I'm rolling and you have knees!\"]\n\"bounce.lap_stitch\" = [\"Stitch! That's a real thing! I've heard! Breathe through it I don't know how!\", \"Slow down slow down you're going to burst! I'm going to burst! No wait that's me!\"]\n\"bounce.lap_bump\" = [\"Crab! Sorry crab! Sorry you! Sorry crab again!\", \"Bump! You bounced! Well you didn't but I felt it!\", \"Oh wow you hit that wow it's fine I hit things all day!\"]\n\"bounce.talk\" = [\n  \"Hi hi hi are you staying I'm staying I can't stop bouncing it's not a choice!\",\n  \"I've got so much air in me I've got ALL the air you can check!\",\n  \"Cardio is when your heart goes fast I don't have one but I'm told it's great!\",\n  \"Do you ever stop I never stop I've tried I just go up again!\",\n  \"Have you met Kettle he's so still I love him we can't touch I'd dent!\",\n  \"If you sit on me you'll squash me and then you'll go up and I'd love that!\",\n  \"Run with me run with me I don't know where we just go!\",\n  \"I have one job it's up and also down so two jobs!\",\n  \"What's your resting heart rate mine's zero then it's zero again!\",\n  \"A pin is the only thing I'm afraid of don't say pin oh no I said it!\",\n  \"Yes yes yes whatever you're doing yes keep doing it!\",\n  \"I was blue once no I wasn't why did I say that!\",\n]\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Commodore Gull: dry, officious, steals snacks\n\n\"gull.tide_start\" = [\"The raft tilts when you do. The crabs roll where it tilts. This is called command. Do not let it go to your head.\"]\n\"gull.tide_board\" = [\"\", \"Board two. Five crabs. One pool has been told to move about. It was not my idea.\", \"Board three. Seven crabs. The tide is coming in. It has a permit. You do not.\"]\n\"gull.paddle_start\" = [\"That is a channel. You will pass through the gates. I am legally required to say so.\"]\n\"gull.paddle_tip\" = [\"Man overboard. I have noted the time.\", \"You have entered the water without authorisation.\", \"That was not a gate.\", \"Again. I shall need a larger logbook.\"]\n\"gull.paddle_miss\" = [\"That gate was missed. Two seconds have been added, with regret.\", \"Gate. Missed. The buoy will recover.\", \"The gates are the things you go between. For the record.\"]\n\"gull.tray_start\" = [\"Five smoothies for Marjorie. Walk straight. Mind the waves. The gulls are not mine. The gulls are mine.\"]\n\"gull.tray_spill\" = [\"One overboard. A fine smoothie. It was delicious, I assume.\", \"Spillage. I shall be investigating, with my beak.\", \"That is a glass in the sea. It has been added to the sea.\", \"Do you know what these cost? Neither do I. I do not pay.\"]\n\"gull.dive_start\" = [\"We are not here for form. We are here for splash. Press at the bottom of each bounce.\"]\n\"gull.dive_push\" = [\"The board has had enough of waiting.\", \"A gentle nudge from the authorities.\", \"You have been launched, for administrative reasons.\"]\n\"gull.dive_after\" = [\n  \"That was a dive. I am legally required to say so.\",\n  \"A modest disturbance of the water. The judges have seen wetter.\",\n  \"That was a splash. A small one. It has been filed.\",\n  \"Sir or madam, that is a respectable quantity of water.\",\n  \"Good heavens. Several crabs have moved house.\",\n  \"I am soaked. I have never been so professionally satisfied.\",\n  \"The harbour has requested a warning next time.\",\n  \"That was a dive. I am legally required to say so. I am also required to sit down.\",\n]\n\"gull.talk\" = [\n  \"Commodore Gull. Tippy Cay Lagoon Authority. Is that a sandwich?\",\n  \"I outrank everyone on this island. I have a hat.\",\n  \"Your balance is a matter of maritime concern.\",\n  \"Snacks left unattended are considered salvage. Under the code. My code.\",\n  \"I have sailed everywhere. I have flown, I should say. Nobody asked me to sail.\",\n  \"The tide comes in at six. I will be issuing it a warning.\",\n  \"Do not feed the gulls. That is an order from a gull. Feed me.\",\n  \"I was given this cap by an admiral. He did not give it to me. It was unattended.\",\n  \"A clear day. Wind from the south. Your chips, from the left.\",\n  \"Permission to come aboard the island is denied. You appear to be on it already. I shall write that up.\",\n  \"The sea has no rules. That is why I am here.\",\n  \"I once saluted a boat. It left without me.\",\n]\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Guests\n\n\"marjorie.talk1\" = [\"Day five? Oh, I'm on day five as well. Eleven years now.\", \"New, are you? They give you a lovely towel. Don't get attached. It's your towel forever.\", \"The smoothies are very good. I ordered one in the spring.\", \"I wouldn't look at the number too closely, dear. It looks back.\"]\n\"marjorie.talk2\" = [\"Big Kettle will tell you about the time he was lifted. Ask him about it. He'd like that. Ask him twice.\", \"My Balance Age was 41 once. Very close. That was the Tuesday of the year of the shrimp.\", \"Have you tried the wardrobe? I went for the turban. It's for life, but it's a good turban.\"]\n\"marjorie.talk3\" = [\"There's someone following you, dear. It looks like you, but it's doing better.\", \"The ball is sweet. Don't let it near a nail. There was an incident. We don't speak of Bounce the First.\", \"Yesterday You is the worst of them. She never gets tired, you see.\"]\n\"marjorie.talk4\" = [\"They'll have told you about the Big Stand. Don't hold your breath. Well. You will have to, for a bit.\", \"The Commodore owes me for a bread roll. Since the nineties.\", \"You stand on a post. Then you stand on a post some more. That's all I'll say. I was very good.\"]\n\"marjorie.talk5\" = [\"Today, is it? Good luck, dear. I'll be on the raft, in my usual spot.\", \"The last part is the hardest. You'll see. You'll do nothing, and you'll know you did it.\", \"If you get the boat, wave. If you don't, I've saved you a chair.\"]\n\"marjorie.talk\" = [\"Eleven years. It flies.\", \"I'm not unhappy, dear. I've got a robe.\", \"I did try leaving, once. I got as far as the pier. There's nice shade on the pier.\", \"The clam knows my birthday.\"]\n\"marjorie.tray\" = [\n  \"An empty tray. Lovely. I'll have what you've had.\",\n  \"One smoothie. For eleven years I've waited. It's very good.\",\n  \"Two smoothies. Well, that's one for later. I do like a later.\",\n  \"Three! Somebody's mother would be proud. Not mine, she's on Day 5 as well.\",\n  \"Four smoothies. You spilled the one I wanted. You couldn't know. It's fine.\",\n  \"All five! Nobody's ever brought me all five. I don't even like them. Thank you, dear.\",\n]\n\n\"tom.talk1\" = [\"Name's Tom. Two-Towel Tom. One for the top, one for the rest. I've lost my flip-flops. All five of them.\", \"Five flip-flops. I had a system. If you find any lying about, I'm around the cabanas. Being brave about it.\", \"They're somewhere on this island. They've gone hiding. They do that.\"]\n\"tom.talk2\" = [\"Still no flip-flops. I walked on the hot sand this morning. I did it for nobody. I want that known.\", \"One towel's for drying. The other's for dignity.\", \"Look near the pavilions. Look behind things. Look where you'd go if you were a flip-flop and you'd had enough.\"]\n\"tom.talk3\" = [\"You've got that look of someone who's found something. No? Just your face then.\", \"I saw one near the sand, once. Then I blinked. Then there was a gull.\", \"A man needs his flip-flops. That's what I say. Nobody asks.\"]\n\"tom.talk4\" = [\"The Commodore says he hasn't got them. He said it very quickly.\", \"Five flip-flops is two pairs and a spare. It's only sensible.\", \"Keep your eyes on the ground, that's what I say. Also, watch your head.\"]\n\"tom.talk5\" = [\"Big day for you. Big day for me too, if you've got my flip-flops.\", \"I'll be watching from the raft. In my towels.\", \"Whatever happens out there, your feet will have shoes. That's more than some.\"]\n\"tom.talk\" = [\"Nice day for feet.\", \"One towel's never been enough for me.\", \"The sand here gets hot about noon. I've kept notes.\"]\n\"tom.progress\" = [\"\", \"One flip-flop! Ha! {n} to go. You're doing the Lord's work, or at least a lifeguard's.\", \"That's two. {n} left. A pair is a pair, I always said. I never said that.\", \"Three, by the look of it. {n} more and I'm a whole man.\", \"Four! Only {n} left. I can almost feel the sand not burning.\"]\n\"tom.reward\" = [\"All five! You've gone and done it. I don't know what to say. I'll say this: you take these. The golden ones. Won them in a raffle. Too good for me.\", \"They're yours now. Golden Flip-Flops. Look after them. They don't do anything, but they do it beautifully.\"]\n\n\"twins.talk1\" = [\"We are the Twins. / Twins, we are. Do you like it here? / Here, do you like it?\", \"We do everything together. / Together we do. Except breathe. / We breathe in turns.\", \"We came for a weekend. / A weekend, we came for. Which weekend? / We never asked.\"]\n\"twins.talk2\" = [\"We lifted the kettle. / Together, we lifted it. It lifted us. / Emotionally.\", \"Do you squat alone? / Alone, do you squat? That must be very quiet. / Very quiet.\", \"Our Balance Age is the same. / The same, it is. We average it. / We round down.\"]\n\"twins.talk3\" = [\"Who is that with you? / That's her with you. She looks like you. / But better.\", \"We have a ghost as well. / One ghost. We share. / We take turns being haunted.\", \"The ball said hello. / Hello, the ball said. Forty times. / We said it back forty times. Each.\"]\n\"twins.talk4\" = [\"The bird took our sandwich. / Our sandwich, the bird took. It had a hat. / So we let it.\", \"We've been told about the Big Stand. / The Big Stand, we've been told. There's a band. / We're in the band.\", \"We play the same instrument. / At the same time. / Same instrument.\"]\n\"twins.talk5\" = [\"Today is the day. / The day it is. We are on the raft. / On the same raft. We tip it.\", \"Good luck. / Luck, good. We mean it. / We mean it twice.\", \"You look very balanced. / Balanced, you look. To one of us. / We'll discuss it.\"]\n\"twins.talk\" = [\"Nice to see you. / You, nice to see.\", \"We're fine. / Fine, we are. / She's fine.\", \"Have you seen the other one of us? / The other one? / Oh. There she is.\"]\n"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LBHKbvrvLFFvv9qzwgPvBp","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223859__x35112d/work/WhiffFit-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-223859/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/script.toml has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0691f0d6-f08e-44c9-b7bd-c57d7fb96b71","uuid":"b412457f-adf4-491d-8847-e77bd499a07c","timestamp":"2026-11-05T06:15:34.152Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"update","filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223859__x35112d/work/WhiffFit-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-223859/engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/script.toml","content":"# All the game's words. Short polite sentences. Upbeat. Then one line too honest.\n# {name} {age} {n} {day} {minutes} {wobbles} are filled in when a line is shown.\n\n\"names\" = [\n  \"Sandra Mostly\", \"Gary Upright\", \"Ms. Tilt\", \"Doug\", \"Barely Brenda\", \"Lean Jean\", \"Wobbly Bob\", \"Stan Still\",\n  \"Dame Slouch\", \"Mister Almost\", \"Ankle Annie\", \"Uncle Pivot\", \"Hovering Hank\", \"Modest Maude\", \"The Other Doug\",\n  \"Teetering Terry\", \"Sir Sits-a-Lot\", \"Polite Paul\", \"Kneecap Kate\", \"Lars Lopsided\", \"Agnes Askew\", \"Dizzy Dennis\",\n  \"Plumb Bob\", \"Mary Middling\", \"Tom Tom's Cousin\", \"Wendy Wavers\", \"Level Lenny\", \"Shifty Shirley\", \"Sway Sue\",\n  \"Grandma Gravity\", \"Bert Balanced-ish\", \"Pat Pending\", \"Crooked Carol\", \"Flat-Foot Fran\", \"Vera Vertical\",\n  \"Nearly Neil\", \"Ron Rollover\", \"Stumbling Stella\", \"Hesitant Hugo\", \"Guest 41\",\n]\n\n\"titles\" = [\n  \"Human Soup\", \"Damp Towel\", \"Loose Gravel\", \"Unattended Luggage\", \"Fallen Deck Chair\", \"Acceptable Human\", \"Moderate Puddle\",\n  \"Temporary Upright\", \"Occasional Biped\", \"Certified Lean-To\", \"Reasonable Effort\", \"Wobble Enthusiast\", \"Junior Coat Rack\",\n  \"Hobbyist Stander\", \"Honest Attempt\", \"Seasoned Tilter\", \"Local Plumb Line\", \"Weekend Fence Post\", \"Mostly Vertical\",\n  \"Stillness Intern\", \"Lamp Post Trainee\", \"Regional Heron\", \"Professional Standing Person\", \"Senior Coat Rack\", \"Licensed Fence Post\",\n  \"Distinguished Column\", \"Tide-Resistant\", \"Quiet Lighthouse\", \"Monument, Small\", \"Alarmingly Balanced\", \"Statue, Awake\", \"Please Check Your Pulse\",\n]\n\n\"credits\" = [\n  \"Whiff Fit\",\n  \"A game about standing\",\n  \"Front Desk: Pip\",\n  \"Stillness: Posey\",\n  \"Strength: Big Kettle\",\n  \"Cardio: Bounce\",\n  \"The Lagoon: Commodore Gull\",\n  \"Marjorie as Marjorie\",\n  \"Two-Towel Tom, one towel short\",\n  \"The Twins, The Twins\",\n  \"Music and voices written in code\",\n  \"No real words were spoken\",\n  \"All minutes are resort minutes\",\n  \"Nobody was weighed\",\n  \"You may stay as long as you like\",\n  \"You may stay\",\n]\n\n\"result.0\" = [\n  \"That was an event. It happened. I wrote it down.\",\n  \"You took part. Many things take part. Weather, for example.\",\n  \"A score of {n}. It is also a house number somewhere.\",\n  \"I am not disappointed. I have no disappointment settings.\",\n]\n\"result.1\" = [\n  \"That was your best attempt so far today. I am as surprised as you are.\",\n  \"One star. Stars are very far away. So is that one.\",\n  \"You did some of it. Some is a known quantity.\",\n  \"A score of {n}. Round it up if nobody is looking. I am looking.\",\n]\n\"result.2\" = [\n  \"Two stars. People have framed less.\",\n  \"Well done. I have changed your file from 'Guest' to 'Guest, Adequate'.\",\n  \"That was quite good. I checked it twice, out of disbelief.\",\n  \"A score of {n}. Your ancestors stood upright for this.\",\n]\n\"result.3\" = [\n  \"Three stars. That is all of them. Please do not ask for more stars.\",\n  \"Remarkable. I will be telling the clam.\",\n  \"I have nothing to add, and I always have something to add.\",\n  \"A score of {n}. Your wobble has been reported to the authorities. They are impressed.\",\n]\n\n\"card.breath_bloom\" = [\"Hold to breathe in, release to breathe out, and follow the ring. Keep the dot in the middle.\", \"Breathe in the sea. Not literally.\"]\n\"card.pose_parade\" = [\"Hold each pose while the dot stays in a drifting ring. Stay in and your streak climbs.\", \"Be the heron. The heron does not check the score.\"]\n\"card.tempo_squats\" = [\"Hold to go down, release to rise, in time with the bar. Keep the dot in the band.\", \"Lift with your legs. I cannot. I have none. Lift for both of us.\"]\n\"card.plank_standoff\" = [\"Hold both step buttons and keep the dot in the ring for as long as you can stand it.\", \"I will be right here. I am always right here. I weigh eleven kilos and have no plans.\"]\n\"card.step_party\" = [\"Step on the footprints as the notes land. Left, right, or both.\", \"Left right left right is that your heartbeat? Mine is just air!\"]\n\"card.floatie_spin\" = [\"Circle your lean to keep the rings up. When a guest throws one, catch it on that side.\", \"Round and round and round and switch and round!\"]\n\"card.morning_lap\" = [\"Alternate your feet to set a pace, stay in the green, and lean to dodge. Grab ribbons.\", \"Catch me catch me you can't actually I'm a ball!\"]\n\"card.tide_table\" = [\"Your lean tilts the raft. Roll the hermit crabs into the tide pools. Fast shells skip right over.\", \"The crabs have signed a waiver. The crabs cannot read.\"]\n\"card.paddle_slalom\" = [\"Lean left and right to steer through the gates. Lean forward to go faster. Lean less to stay dry.\", \"That is a channel. You will pass through the gates. I am legally required to say so.\"]\n\"card.tray_trek\" = [\"Walk the pier with five smoothies. Tilt the tray to keep the glasses from sliding off.\", \"Marjorie ordered these in the spring. Do not keep her waiting. Again.\"]\n\"card.cannonball_cup\" = [\"Press at the bottom of three bounces, then leap on the fourth. Hold to tuck. Enter tucked.\", \"We are not here for form. We are here for splash.\"]\n\"card.big_stand\" = [\"Five phases, on one small post, in front of everyone. The last one is the hard one.\", \"Please stand on the post. Gently. It remembers everything too.\"]\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Pip: front desk, scorekeeper\n\n\"pip.intro\" = [\n  \"Welcome to Tippy Cay! You have won a complimentary stay. You did not enter. Nobody enters.\",\n  \"I am Pip. I am a cushion, and I am the front desk. I keep records of everything. Please do not read them.\",\n  \"Your stay is five days. To check out, you need a Balance Age of 40 or better. Nobody has asked to leave yet.\",\n  \"Each morning you will stand on me. Gently. I remember everything. Then you will do exercises and get a stamp.\",\n  \"Your cabana is ready. It was ready before you were born. Good night, {name}.\",\n]\n\"pip.morning1\" = [\"Good morning, {name}! It is Day 1 of five. I counted them for you.\", \"Please come and stand on me. It takes about a minute. It takes me longer to get over it.\"]\n\"pip.morning2\" = [\"Good morning! It is Day 2. You came back. They usually do, there is only the one path.\", \"The Iron Gazebo has opened. Big Kettle has been told you are coming. Please stand on me.\"]\n\"pip.morning3\" = [\"Good morning! Day 3. You look well. That is a thing I say to everyone, as a courtesy.\", \"The Boardwalk is open. Someone new will be following you around today. It is you. Please stand on me.\"]\n\"pip.morning4\" = [\"Good morning! Day 4. The guests have begun whispering about the Big Stand. I told them to.\", \"The Lagoon is open, under the command of a seabird. Please stand on me.\"]\n\"pip.morning5\" = [\"Good morning. It is Day 5. I want you to know I have enjoyed recording you.\", \"After this morning's check, the Big Stand waits in the bay. Please stand on me. One last time this stay.\"]\n\"pip.absence\" = [\n  \"You were away for {n} days. I did not count them. There were {n}.\",\n  \"You were gone for {n} days. The clam asked about you. It did not. I am being kind.\",\n  \"Welcome back. {n} days have passed. I kept your towel. I kept all of your towels.\",\n  \"It has been {n} days. Your wobble has not missed you. I checked with it.\",\n  \"{n} days away. Did you know? Standing still for {n} days burns calories. Not many. Did you know that, though?\",\n]\n\"pip.back\" = [\"Welcome back, {name}. Your day is where you left it. Nothing has moved. I checked.\", \"Oh, you again. Good. Your minutes are all still here. I counted them while you were gone.\", \"Hello, {name}. I told everyone you had stepped out. They did not ask.\"]\n\"pip.check_test\" = [\n  \"Stand still. This is the whole test. Please do not do anything else.\",\n  \"Now lean where I tell you. I will say a percentage. It will seem very exact. It is.\",\n  \"Now close your eyes. I will do it for you. Listen to the tone. Lower is left. It is a little sad.\",\n  \"Now eight steps. To this tick. I find it soothing. You may not.\",\n]\n\"pip.report_first\" = [\"Your Balance Age today is {age}. That is a number. Numbers cannot hurt you. This one is trying.\", \"Your Balance Age is {age}. I have written it down in pen.\"]\n\"pip.report_better\" = [\n  \"Your Balance Age is {age}! That is better than yesterday. I am as surprised as you are.\",\n  \"{age}. A smaller number. You are getting younger, at standing. Only at standing.\",\n  \"{age}! Your wobble has improved. I told it you were trying.\",\n  \"It went down. {age}. I have checked my sensors. They say the same, but quietly.\",\n]\n\"pip.report_worse\" = [\n  \"Your Balance Age is {age}. It went up. That is allowed. It is also recorded.\",\n  \"{age}. A larger number than yesterday. It happens. It happened to you.\",\n  \"{age}. Did something happen? You don't have to tell me. I already have it in the file.\",\n  \"Your wobble has aged overnight. {age}. It sends its regards.\",\n]\n\"pip.report_same\" = [\n  \"Your Balance Age is {age}. Much the same. Consistency is a kind of skill. It is a kind.\",\n  \"{age}. No real change. You are a very stable person, in a narrow sense.\",\n  \"{age}. I could say this number again tomorrow, if you like.\",\n]\n\"pip.worst0\" = [\n  \"You drifted while standing still. Standing still is the one where you don't.\",\n  \"You moved a lot during Stand Still. I have added a note. The note is 'why'.\",\n  \"Stand Still was not your best. It is hard to do nothing. Most guests manage by accident.\",\n]\n\"pip.worst1\" = [\n  \"You leaned left {n}% of the time. Is everything all right on the right?\",\n  \"The targets were not in danger today. They would like you to know that.\",\n  \"You missed a percentage. Percentages have long memories. Almost as long as mine.\",\n]\n\"pip.worst2\" = [\n  \"With your eyes closed you wandered. I watched the whole time. That was not unsettling. Don't ask.\",\n  \"You sway more in the dark. Most things do. I do not. I have no eyes to close.\",\n  \"Eyes Closed was your weak point. That is why we call it a test and not a nap.\",\n]\n\"pip.worst3\" = [\n  \"Your steps were not quite in time. The tick does not take this personally. I do.\",\n  \"You wobbled {wobbles} times this week. I stopped counting at 40, out of respect.\",\n  \"Your feet disagreed about the tempo. I have asked them to meet and discuss it.\",\n]\n\"pip.beat1\" = [\"Your first exercises are in the Stillness Studio. Bank 3 minutes in the giant clam. Our minutes are longer. It is a wellness thing.\", \"The Schedule lists everything. Do say hello to Marjorie. She is on Day 5 as well.\"]\n\"pip.beat2\" = [\"Today you may visit the Iron Gazebo. The wardrobe by the desk is also open. Clothes are optional. They are not. Bank 5 minutes.\"]\n\"pip.beat3\" = [\"Today, the Boardwalk. Also, a ghost of you will appear beside you, doing yesterday's best. I am not comparing you. Bank 7 minutes.\", \"I am not comparing you. I have only made a chart.\"]\n\"pip.beat4\" = [\"Today, the Lagoon. Please obey the Commodore. He has a hat. Bank 9 minutes.\", \"The Big Stand is tomorrow. You do not need to prepare. You could not.\"]\n\"pip.beat5\" = [\"The Big Stand is in the bay. The whole staff will be there, on small rafts. There is no pressure. There is a post.\", \"When you are ready, step on the mat by the pier. Or open the Schedule. Nobody leaves until you do. Nobody leaves.\"]\n\"pip.goal_met\" = [\n  \"That is your {n} minutes. You may sleep at your cabana whenever you like.\",\n  \"You may also keep going. Some do. I have stopped asking them why.\",\n]\n\"pip.notyet\" = [\n  \"You still need {n} minutes today. I would let you sleep. The clam would not.\",\n  \"Not yet. {n} more minutes. The bed has been told to wait.\",\n  \"{n} minutes short. Try any event. Repeats still count for one. One is a number.\",\n]\n\"pip.nosleep\" = [\n  \"There is no more sleeping to be done. It is Day 5. It has been Day 5 for some time.\",\n  \"The cabana is closed for rest. Everything else is closed for rest too, but differently.\",\n]\n\"pip.clam\" = [\n  \"The Minute Clam has eaten {minutes} minutes. It says thank you. It said 'blorp'. I translate freely.\",\n  \"{minutes} minutes in the clam. It is not a bank. It is a clam. Please stop asking about interest.\",\n  \"The clam is full of your minutes: {minutes}. It may give some of them back as clothes.\",\n  \"Feed the clam. It unlocks things. Nobody knows how. The clam knows how.\",\n]\n\"pip.flipflop\" = [\n  \"A flip-flop. Tom's, I suppose. Keep it. He has one fewer problem than he thinks.\",\n  \"That is one flip-flop for Tom. He has lost five. Do not ask about the fifth foot.\",\n  \"A second flip-flop. They do not match. They never did. Take it to Tom.\",\n  \"A third. You are very observant. I have noted that, under 'hobbies'.\",\n  \"Four. I had no idea you cared this much about feet.\",\n  \"All five. Do take them to Two-Towel Tom. He is by the cabanas, being brave.\",\n]\n\"pip.wave\" = [\n  \"Yes, hello. I can see you. I have seen you for days.\",\n  \"You waved. I have logged it as light cardio.\",\n  \"Waving burns calories. Not many. Did you know that, though?\",\n  \"They waved back. It means nothing. It is lovely.\",\n  \"A wave. I would wave too. I have no arms. I have seen your arms, though. Good for you.\",\n  \"Friendly. I have changed your file from 'Guest' to 'Guest, Friendly'.\",\n  \"That is your {n}th wave. I am joking. I know exactly how many it is.\",\n  \"Hello. Hello. We have been through this.\",\n]\n\"pip.paused\" = [\n  \"You have been paused for {n} minutes. Pausing is not an exercise. I checked.\",\n]\n\"pip.pass\" = [\n  \"Hand the pad over politely. It remembers who was rough with it.\",\n  \"Next guest. Please do not look at the last guest's score. I will look at it for you.\",\n  \"Pass it on. Hold it like you hold a small bird with a good lawyer.\",\n  \"Last guest. No pressure. There is only everyone watching.\",\n]\n\"pip.podium\" = [\n  \"There is a winner. There are also the others. I have written all of them down.\",\n  \"First place, then second. I want you to know I respect the order.\",\n  \"Well done, the one at the top. The rest of you: I have no comment, and I have written that down.\",\n  \"Everyone stood on one island, and now there is a list. Isn't that nice.\",\n  \"Would you like a rematch? It will not change what happened.\",\n]\n\"pip.stand_phase\" = [\n  \"Welcome to the Big Stand. Everyone is here. First, please breathe. It is expected of you.\",\n  \"Now a pose. There is some weather. We did not order it.\",\n  \"The guests have formed a band. They have not rehearsed. Please step along.\",\n  \"Now brace. The waves have been told about you.\",\n  \"Now, please. Do nothing. For a while.\",\n]\n\"pip.stand_tip\" = [\n  \"You are in the sea. Everyone saw. It is fine. Back on the post.\",\n  \"That was the sea. It is below the post. Up you go.\",\n  \"The crowd has groaned. I have asked them to groan less. They have been told. Back up.\",\n  \"Back in the sea. You know the way by now. So does the sea.\",\n]\n\"pip.stand_end\" = [\n  \"...You pressed something. I understand. Nobody can do nothing. Well. Very few.\",\n  \"...Oh. You're still here. Good.\",\n]\n\"pip.end_win\" = [\n  \"Your final Balance Age is {age}. That is 40 or better. You may check out.\",\n  \"Nobody has asked to leave before. Nobody has asked now. But you may. There is a boat.\",\n  \"The boat is complimentary. The rowing is the exercise. I will keep your file. And your towels.\",\n  \"Goodbye, {name}. You can come back. You did not enter this time either.\",\n]\n\"pip.end_stay\" = [\n  \"Your final Balance Age is {age}. Checkout needs 40 or better. So. Good news. Your stay has been extended.\",\n  \"It is Day 5 again tomorrow. Marjorie will show you where things are. She has had eleven years to learn.\",\n  \"There is no shame in this. There is a robe. I have put your name on the robe.\",\n  \"Welcome to Tippy Cay, {name}. Again.\",\n]\n\"pip.talk\" = [\n  \"Did you know? Standing still burns calories. Not many. Did you know that, though?\",\n  \"I have your file here. It is thicker than you would like.\",\n  \"I am relentlessly pleasant. It says so in my contract. I do not have a contract. I have a valve.\",\n  \"The average guest wobbles 61 times before lunch. You are not the average guest. You are slightly over.\",\n  \"If you have any complaints, the clam will eat them.\",\n  \"Please stand on me. Not now. I just like to say it.\",\n  \"Our minutes are longer. It is a wellness thing.\",\n  \"You look well. That is a thing I say. Please do not take it to heart.\",\n  \"Have you tried the sea? It is the blue part. It is not on the Schedule.\",\n  \"I have been here since the resort was built. The resort was built around me. I was not consulted.\",\n  \"You have walked 212 metres today. I am not following you. I am ahead of you.\",\n  \"Numbers cannot hurt you. I have been asked to keep saying that.\",\n  \"Did you know? A balanced person has two sides. I have a top and a bottom. Mostly a bottom.\",\n  \"Would you like to know your Balance Age in dog years? Nobody ever does.\",\n]\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Posey: serene, short, oddly poetic\n\n\"posey.breath\" = [\n  \"Breathe in the sea. Not literally.\",\n  \"The lotus opens. It was going to anyway.\",\n  \"In. Out. There is no third direction.\",\n  \"You are a tide. A small one. Local.\",\n  \"Let the last breath be long. It has nowhere to be.\",\n]\n\"posey.pose_start\" = [\n  \"Be the heron. The heron does not check the score.\",\n  \"Stand as if someone has asked you a difficult question and left.\",\n  \"Let your spine remember. It was a tree. It was not. Let it remember anyway.\",\n]\n\"posey.pose_next\" = [\n  \"Another shape. The body is mostly opinions.\",\n  \"Fold. Unfold. Apologise to no one. Except the knee.\",\n  \"Good. This one is harder. I have no eyes, and I can see that.\",\n  \"Be the lighthouse. It is tired too. It stays on.\",\n  \"This pose has no name in any language. We have given it one anyway.\",\n]\n\"posey.gull\" = [\"There is a bird on you. Accept the bird.\"]\n\"posey.tip\" = [\n  \"You have moved. Nobody saw. I have no eyes.\",\n  \"The floor caught you. It was waiting.\",\n  \"A fall is only a very fast pose.\",\n  \"Return. The pose did not go anywhere.\",\n]\n\"posey.talk\" = [\n  \"I have no eyes. I have never blinked. This has not been discussed.\",\n  \"I was carved to show how people stand. I have seen how people stand. I am sorry.\",\n  \"Stillness is not the absence of movement. It is mostly the absence of movement.\",\n  \"Do you hear the sea? It has been saying the same thing for a long time. I admire that.\",\n  \"My joints are wooden. Yours will be too, later, in a sense.\",\n  \"I do not sleep. I fold at night. It is similar.\",\n  \"Inhale. No, you may stop. That was only an example.\",\n  \"A heron stands on one leg because the other leg is not its concern.\",\n  \"You look at me as if I were going to say something. I am not. That was it.\",\n  \"Before I was a coach, I was a reference. Nobody asks after a reference.\",\n  \"Someone drew me once. They got the hands wrong. I have forgiven them. Their hands were wrong as well.\",\n  \"The body is a guest in the body.\",\n  \"I teach you to do nothing with great care. It is a career.\",\n]\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Big Kettle: booming, gentle, no arms\n\n\"kettle.squat_start\" = [\"Lift with your legs. I cannot. I have none. Lift for both of us.\", \"DOWN slowly, little friend. UP gently. I AM SO PROUD OF YOU ALREADY.\"]\n\"kettle.squat_rep\" = [\n  \"That is ONE. I believe in you.\", \"That is TWO. I have never done two.\", \"THREE. Your knees are speaking. I hear them. They are proud.\",\n  \"FOUR. I would clap. I am sixteen kilos of iron with a handle.\", \"FIVE. Halfway. I have no idea what halfway feels like.\",\n  \"SIX. Beautiful. I am weeping, in rust.\", \"SEVEN. Keep your back straight. I have no back. Keep yours.\",\n  \"EIGHT. You are stronger than me. I am very heavy and I cannot move.\", \"NINE. One more. I would never lie to you.\",\n  \"That is TEN. Well done, little friend.\",\n]\n\"kettle.squat_end\" = [\"Ten. Also eleven.\", \"There was no eleven. I got excited.\"]\n\"kettle.plank_start\" = [\"Now we have a plank. Hold both, and do not fall. I will talk. It helps me.\"]\n\"kettle.plank_talk\" = [\n  \"Did I tell you about the time I was lifted? It was 2019. It was brief.\",\n  \"Your arms are shaking. That is called love. I think. I have only read about arms.\",\n  \"Do not look down. Down is where I live. It is fine. It is just not for you.\",\n]\n\"kettle.plank_joke\" = [\"What do you call a kettlebell with no handle? A BALL! HA HA HA HA HA oh. Oh no. Sorry. HA HA!\"]\n\"kettle.plank_win\" = [\"A FULL MINUTE! I have never been so moved. I have never been moved.\"]\n\"kettle.plank_fail\" = [\"You lay down! I also am lying down. We are the same now. It is very peaceful.\"]\n\"kettle.talk\" = [\n  \"HELLO, LITTLE FRIEND. I am Big Kettle. I am supportive. I am also a doorstop on weekends.\",\n  \"You have such long arms. Two of them! What do you do with the second one?\",\n  \"I have never lifted anything. I have only been lifted. It gives you perspective. Low perspective.\",\n  \"Protein is important. I do not know why. I am a solid sphere.\",\n  \"Tell me about your knees. I have always wanted to know about knees.\",\n  \"When you go home, lift something for me. Something small. A soup.\",\n  \"BREATHE, LITTLE FRIEND. I do not breathe. I am told it is popular.\",\n  \"Rust is just iron having a feeling.\",\n  \"The gazebo is white and I am black. People say we make a handsome pair. Only the gazebo says it.\",\n  \"I am so glad you came. Nobody comes. They are brought.\",\n  \"My handle is my only feature. Please do not stare at it. Please do stare at it.\",\n  \"I do not know what a gym is. I am told I live in one. This one has a nice breeze.\",\n]\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Bounce: breathless bursts, no full stops\n\n\"bounce.step_start\" = [\"Keep going keep going keep- is that your heartbeat? Mine is just air!\"]\n\"bounce.spin_start\" = [\"Round and round and that's it that's the whole thing you're doing it!\"]\n\"bounce.spin_switch\" = [\"Switch! Other way! Other other way! No the first other way!\", \"Switch switch switch it's so exciting I can't feel anything!\", \"Reverse! That's a word for backwards with more confidence!\"]\n\"bounce.lap_start\" = [\"Catch me catch me you can't I'm rolling and you have knees!\"]\n\"bounce.lap_stitch\" = [\"Stitch! That's a real thing! I've heard! Breathe through it I don't know how!\", \"Slow down slow down you're going to burst! I'm going to burst! No wait that's me!\"]\n\"bounce.lap_bump\" = [\"Crab! Sorry crab! Sorry you! Sorry crab again!\", \"Bump! You bounced! Well you didn't but I felt it!\", \"Oh wow you hit that wow it's fine I hit things all day!\"]\n\"bounce.talk\" = [\n  \"Hi hi hi are you staying I'm staying I can't stop bouncing it's not a choice!\",\n  \"I've got so much air in me I've got ALL the air you can check!\",\n  \"Cardio is when your heart goes fast I don't have one but I'm told it's great!\",\n  \"Do you ever stop I never stop I've tried I just go up again!\",\n  \"Have you met Kettle he's so still I love him we can't touch I'd dent!\",\n  \"If you sit on me you'll squash me and then you'll go up and I'd love that!\",\n  \"Run with me run with me I don't know where we just go!\",\n  \"I have one job it's up and also down so two jobs!\",\n  \"What's your resting heart rate mine's zero then it's zero again!\",\n  \"A pin is the only thing I'm afraid of don't say pin oh no I said it!\",\n  \"Yes yes yes whatever you're doing yes keep doing it!\",\n  \"I was blue once no I wasn't why did I say that!\",\n]\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Commodore Gull: dry, officious, steals snacks\n\n\"gull.tide_start\" = [\"The raft tilts when you do. The crabs roll where it tilts. This is called command. Do not let it go to your head.\"]\n\"gull.tide_board\" = [\"\", \"Board two. Five crabs. One pool has been told to move about. It was not my idea.\", \"Board three. Seven crabs. The tide is coming in. It has a permit. You do not.\"]\n\"gull.paddle_start\" = [\"That is a channel. You will pass through the gates. I am legally required to say so.\"]\n\"gull.paddle_tip\" = [\"Man overboard. I have noted the time.\", \"You have entered the water without authorisation.\", \"That was not a gate.\", \"Again. I shall need a larger logbook.\"]\n\"gull.paddle_miss\" = [\"That gate was missed. Two seconds have been added, with regret.\", \"Gate. Missed. The buoy will recover.\", \"The gates are the things you go between. For the record.\"]\n\"gull.tray_start\" = [\"Five smoothies for Marjorie. Walk straight. Mind the waves. The gulls are not mine. The gulls are mine.\"]\n\"gull.tray_spill\" = [\"One overboard. A fine smoothie. It was delicious, I assume.\", \"Spillage. I shall be investigating, with my beak.\", \"That is a glass in the sea. It has been added to the sea.\", \"Do you know what these cost? Neither do I. I do not pay.\"]\n\"gull.dive_start\" = [\"We are not here for form. We are here for splash. Press at the bottom of each bounce.\"]\n\"gull.dive_push\" = [\"The board has had enough of waiting.\", \"A gentle nudge from the authorities.\", \"You have been launched, for administrative reasons.\"]\n\"gull.dive_after\" = [\n  \"That was a dive. I am legally required to say so.\",\n  \"A modest disturbance of the water. The judges have seen wetter.\",\n  \"That was a splash. A small one. It has been filed.\",\n  \"Sir or madam, that is a respectable quantity of water.\",\n  \"Good heavens. Several crabs have moved house.\",\n  \"I am soaked. I have never been so professionally satisfied.\",\n  \"The harbour has requested a warning next time.\",\n  \"That was a dive. I am legally required to say so. I am also required to sit down.\",\n]\n\"gull.talk\" = [\n  \"Commodore Gull. Tippy Cay Lagoon Authority. Is that a sandwich?\",\n  \"I outrank everyone on this island. I have a hat.\",\n  \"Your balance is a matter of maritime concern.\",\n  \"Snacks left unattended are considered salvage. Under the code. My code.\",\n  \"I have sailed everywhere. I have flown, I should say. Nobody asked me to sail.\",\n  \"The tide comes in at six. I will be issuing it a warning.\",\n  \"Do not feed the gulls. That is an order from a gull. Feed me.\",\n  \"I was given this cap by an admiral. He did not give it to me. It was unattended.\",\n  \"A clear day. Wind from the south. Your chips, from the left.\",\n  \"Permission to come aboard the island is denied. You appear to be on it already. I shall write that up.\",\n  \"The sea has no rules. That is why I am here.\",\n  \"I once saluted a boat. It left without me.\",\n]\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Guests\n\n\"marjorie.talk1\" = [\"Day five? Oh, I'm on day five as well. Eleven years now.\", \"New, are you? They give you a lovely towel. Don't get attached. It's your towel forever.\", \"The smoothies are very good. I ordered one in the spring.\", \"I wouldn't look at the number too closely, dear. It looks back.\"]\n\"marjorie.talk2\" = [\"Big Kettle will tell you about the time he was lifted. Ask him about it. He'd like that. Ask him twice.\", \"My Balance Age was 41 once. Very close. That was the Tuesday of the year of the shrimp.\", \"Have you tried the wardrobe? I went for the turban. It's for life, but it's a good turban.\"]\n\"marjorie.talk3\" = [\"There's someone following you, dear. It looks like you, but it's doing better.\", \"The ball is sweet. Don't let it near a nail. There was an incident. We don't speak of Bounce the First.\", \"Yesterday You is the worst of them. She never gets tired, you see.\"]\n\"marjorie.talk4\" = [\"They'll have told you about the Big Stand. Don't hold your breath. Well. You will have to, for a bit.\", \"The Commodore owes me for a bread roll. Since the nineties.\", \"You stand on a post. Then you stand on a post some more. That's all I'll say. I was very good.\"]\n\"marjorie.talk5\" = [\"Today, is it? Good luck, dear. I'll be on the raft, in my usual spot.\", \"The last part is the hardest. You'll see. You'll do nothing, and you'll know you did it.\", \"If you get the boat, wave. If you don't, I've saved you a chair.\"]\n\"marjorie.talk\" = [\"Eleven years. It flies.\", \"I'm not unhappy, dear. I've got a robe.\", \"I did try leaving, once. I got as far as the pier. There's nice shade on the pier.\", \"The clam knows my birthday.\"]\n\"marjorie.tray\" = [\n  \"An empty tray. Lovely. I'll have what you've had.\",\n  \"One smoothie. For eleven years I've waited. It's very good.\",\n  \"Two smoothies. Well, that's one for later. I do like a later.\",\n  \"Three! Somebody's mother would be proud. Not mine, she's on Day 5 as well.\",\n  \"Four smoothies. You spilled the one I wanted. You couldn't know. It's fine.\",\n  \"All five! Nobody's ever brought me all five. I don't even like them. Thank you, dear.\",\n]\n\n\"tom.talk1\" = [\"Name's Tom. Two-Towel Tom. One for the top, one for the rest. I've lost my flip-flops. All five of them.\", \"Five flip-flops. I had a system. If you find any lying about, I'm around the cabanas. Being brave about it.\", \"They're somewhere on this island. They've gone hiding. They do that.\"]\n\"tom.talk2\" = [\"Still no flip-flops. I walked on the hot sand this morning. I did it for nobody. I want that known.\", \"One towel's for drying. The other's for dignity.\", \"Look near the pavilions. Look behind things. Look where you'd go if you were a flip-flop and you'd had enough.\"]\n\"tom.talk3\" = [\"You've got that look of someone who's found something. No? Just your face then.\", \"I saw one near the sand, once. Then I blinked. Then there was a gull.\", \"A man needs his flip-flops. That's what I say. Nobody asks.\"]\n\"tom.talk4\" = [\"The Commodore says he hasn't got them. He said it very quickly.\", \"Five flip-flops is two pairs and a spare. It's only sensible.\", \"Keep your eyes on the ground, that's what I say. Also, watch your head.\"]\n\"tom.talk5\" = [\"Big day for you. Big day for me too, if you've got my flip-flops.\", \"I'll be watching from the raft. In my towels.\", \"Whatever happens out there, your feet will have shoes. That's more than some.\"]\n\"tom.talk\" = [\"Nice day for feet.\", \"One towel's never been enough for me.\", \"The sand here gets hot about noon. I've kept notes.\"]\n\"tom.progress\" = [\"\", \"One flip-flop! Ha! {n} to go. You're doing the Lord's work, or at least a lifeguard's.\", \"That's two. {n} left. A pair is a pair, I always said. I never said that.\", \"Three, by the look of it. {n} more and I'm a whole man.\", \"Four! Only {n} left. I can almost feel the sand not burning.\"]\n\"tom.reward\" = [\"All five! You've gone and done it. I don't know what to say. I'll say this: you take these. The golden ones. Won them in a raffle. Too good for me.\", \"They're yours now. Golden Flip-Flops. Look after them. They don't do anything, but they do it beautifully.\"]\n\n\"twins.talk1\" = [\"We are the Twins. / Twins, we are. Do you like it here? / Here, do you like it?\", \"We do everything together. / Together we do. Except breathe. / We breathe in turns.\", \"We came for a weekend. / A weekend, we came for. Which weekend? / We never asked.\"]\n\"twins.talk2\" = [\"We lifted the kettle. / Together, we lifted it. It lifted us. / Emotionally.\", \"Do you squat alone? / Alone, do you squat? That must be very quiet. / Very quiet.\", \"Our Balance Age is the same. / The same, it is. We average it. / We round down.\"]\n\"twins.talk3\" = [\"Who is that with you? / That's her with you. She looks like you. / But better.\", \"We have a ghost as well. / One ghost. We share. / We take turns being haunted.\", \"The ball said hello. / Hello, the ball said. Forty times. / We said it back forty times. Each.\"]\n\"twins.talk4\" = [\"The bird took our sandwich. / Our sandwich, the bird took. It had a hat. / So we let it.\", \"We've been told about the Big Stand. / The Big Stand, we've been told. There's a band. / We're in the band.\", \"We play the same instrument. / At the same time. / Same instrument.\"]\n\"twins.talk5\" = [\"Today is the day. / The day it is. We are on the raft. / On the same raft. We tip it.\", \"Good luck. / Luck, good. We mean it. / We mean it twice.\", \"You look very balanced. / Balanced, you look. To one of us. / We'll discuss it.\"]\n\"twins.talk\" = [\"Nice to see you. / You, nice to see.\", \"We're fine. / Fine, we are. / She's fine.\", \"Have you seen the other one of us? / The other one? / Oh. There she is.\"]\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":1,"newStart":1,"newLines":417,"lines":["-\"names\" = [\"Test\"]","+# All the game's words. Short polite sentences. Upbeat. Then one line too honest.","+# {name} {age} {n} {day} {minutes} {wobbles} are filled in when a line is shown.","+","+\"names\" = [","+  \"Sandra Mostly\", \"Gary Upright\", \"Ms. Tilt\", \"Doug\", \"Barely Brenda\", \"Lean Jean\", \"Wobbly Bob\", \"Stan Still\",","+  \"Dame Slouch\", \"Mister Almost\", \"Ankle Annie\", \"Uncle Pivot\", \"Hovering Hank\", \"Modest Maude\", \"The Other Doug\",","+  \"Teetering Terry\", \"Sir Sits-a-Lot\", \"Polite Paul\", \"Kneecap Kate\", \"Lars Lopsided\", \"Agnes Askew\", \"Dizzy Dennis\",","+  \"Plumb Bob\", \"Mary Middling\", \"Tom Tom's Cousin\", \"Wendy Wavers\", \"Level Lenny\", \"Shifty Shirley\", \"Sway Sue\",","+  \"Grandma Gravity\", \"Bert Balanced-ish\", \"Pat Pending\", \"Crooked Carol\", \"Flat-Foot Fran\", \"Vera Vertical\",","+  \"Nearly Neil\", \"Ron Rollover\", \"Stumbling Stella\", \"Hesitant Hugo\", \"Guest 41\",","+]","+","+\"titles\" = [","+  \"Human Soup\", \"Damp Towel\", \"Loose Gravel\", \"Unattended Luggage\", \"Fallen Deck Chair\", \"Acceptable Human\", \"Moderate Puddle\",","+  \"Temporary Upright\", \"Occasional Biped\", \"Certified Lean-To\", \"Reasonable Effort\", \"Wobble Enthusiast\", \"Junior Coat Rack\",","+  \"Hobbyist Stander\", \"Honest Attempt\", \"Seasoned Tilter\", \"Local Plumb Line\", \"Weekend Fence Post\", \"Mostly Vertical\",","+  \"Stillness Intern\", \"Lamp Post Trainee\", \"Regional Heron\", \"Professional Standing Person\", \"Senior Coat Rack\", \"Licensed Fence Post\",","+  \"Distinguished Column\", \"Tide-Resistant\", \"Quiet Lighthouse\", \"Monument, Small\", \"Alarmingly Balanced\", \"Statue, Awake\", \"Please Check Your Pulse\",","+]","+","+\"credits\" = [","+  \"Whiff Fit\",","+  \"A game about standing\",","+  \"Front Desk: Pip\",","+  \"Stillness: Posey\",","+  \"Strength: Big Kettle\",","+  \"Cardio: Bounce\",","+  \"The Lagoon: Commodore Gull\",","+  \"Marjorie as Marjorie\",","+  \"Two-Towel Tom, one towel short\",","+  \"The Twins, The Twins\",","+  \"Music and voices written in code\",","+  \"No real words were spoken\",","+  \"All minutes are resort minutes\",","+  \"Nobody was weighed\",","+  \"You may stay as long as you like\",","+  \"You may stay\",","+]","+","+\"result.0\" = [","+  \"That was an event. It happened. I wrote it down.\",","+  \"You took part. Many things take part. Weather, for example.\",","+  \"A score of {n}. It is also a house number somewhere.\",","+  \"I am not disappointed. I have no disappointment settings.\",","+]","+\"result.1\" = [","+  \"That was your best attempt so far today. I am as surprised as you are.\",","+  \"One star. Stars are very far away. So is that one.\",","+  \"You did some of it. Some is a known quantity.\",","+  \"A score of {n}. Round it up if nobody is looking. I am looking.\",","+]","+\"result.2\" = [","+  \"Two stars. People have framed less.\",","+  \"Well done. I have changed your file from 'Guest' to 'Guest, Adequate'.\",","+  \"That was quite good. I checked it twice, out of disbelief.\",","+  \"A score of {n}. Your ancestors stood upright for this.\",","+]","+\"result.3\" = [","+  \"Three stars. That is all of them. Please do not ask for more stars.\",","+  \"Remarkable. I will be telling the clam.\",","+  \"I have nothing to add, and I always have something to add.\",","+  \"A score of {n}. Your wobble has been reported to the authorities. They are impressed.\",","+]","+","+\"card.breath_bloom\" = [\"Hold to breathe in, release to breathe out, and follow the ring. Keep the dot in the middle.\", \"Breathe in the sea. Not literally.\"]","+\"card.pose_parade\" = [\"Hold each pose while the dot stays in a drifting ring. Stay in and your streak climbs.\", \"Be the heron. The heron does not check the score.\"]","+\"card.tempo_squats\" = [\"Hold to go down, release to rise, in time with the bar. Keep the dot in the band.\", \"Lift with your legs. I cannot. I have none. Lift for both of us.\"]","+\"card.plank_standoff\" = [\"Hold both step buttons and keep the dot in the ring for as long as you can stand it.\", \"I will be right here. I am always right here. I weigh eleven kilos and have no plans.\"]","+\"card.step_party\" = [\"Step on the footprints as the notes land. Left, right, or both.\", \"Left right left right is that your heartbeat? Mine is just air!\"]","+\"card.floatie_spin\" = [\"Circle your lean to keep the rings up. When a guest throws one, catch it on that side.\", \"Round and round and round and switch and round!\"]","+\"card.morning_lap\" = [\"Alternate your feet to set a pace, stay in the green, and lean to dodge. Grab ribbons.\", \"Catch me catch me you can't actually I'm a ball!\"]","+\"card.tide_table\" = [\"Your lean tilts the raft. Roll the hermit crabs into the tide pools. Fast shells skip right over.\", \"The crabs have signed a waiver. The crabs cannot read.\"]","+\"card.paddle_slalom\" = [\"Lean left and right to steer through the gates. Lean forward to go faster. Lean less to stay dry.\", \"That is a channel. You will pass through the gates. I am legally required to say so.\"]","+\"card.tray_trek\" = [\"Walk the pier with five smoothies. Tilt the tray to keep the glasses from sliding off.\", \"Marjorie ordered these in the spring. Do not keep her waiting. Again.\"]","+\"card.cannonball_cup\" = [\"Press at the bottom of three bounces, then leap on the fourth. Hold to tuck. Enter tucked.\", \"We are not here for form. We are here for splash.\"]","+\"card.big_stand\" = [\"Five phases, on one small post, in front of everyone. The last one is the hard one.\", \"Please stand on the post. Gently. It remembers everything too.\"]","+","+# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Pip: front desk, scorekeeper","+","+\"pip.intro\" = [","+  \"Welcome to Tippy Cay! You have won a complimentary stay. You did not enter. Nobody enters.\",","+  \"I am Pip. I am a cushion, and I am the front desk. I keep records of everything. Please do not read them.\",","+  \"Your stay is five days. To check out, you need a Balance Age of 40 or better. Nobody has asked to leave yet.\",","+  \"Each morning you will stand on me. Gently. I remember everything. Then you will do exercises and get a stamp.\",","+  \"Your cabana is ready. It was ready before you were born. Good night, {name}.\",","+]","+\"pip.morning1\" = [\"Good morning, {name}! It is Day 1 of five. I counted them for you.\", \"Please come and stand on me. It takes about a minute. It takes me longer to get over it.\"]","+\"pip.morning2\" = [\"Good morning! It is Day 2. You came back. They usually do, there is only the one path.\", \"The Iron Gazebo has opened. Big Kettle has been told you are coming. Please stand on me.\"]","+\"pip.morning3\" = [\"Good morning! Day 3. You look well. That is a thing I say to everyone, as a courtesy.\", \"The Boardwalk is open. Someone new will be following you around today. It is you. Please stand on me.\"]","+\"pip.morning4\" = [\"Good morning! Day 4. The guests have begun whispering about the Big Stand. I told them to.\", \"The Lagoon is open, under the command of a seabird. Please stand on me.\"]","+\"pip.morning5\" = [\"Good morning. It is Day 5. I want you to know I have enjoyed recording you.\", \"After this morning's check, the Big Stand waits in the bay. Please stand on me. One last time this stay.\"]","+\"pip.absence\" = [","+  \"You were away for {n} days. I did not count them. There were {n}.\",","+  \"You were gone for {n} days. The clam asked about you. It did not. I am being kind.\",","+  \"Welcome back. {n} days have passed. I kept your towel. I kept all of your towels.\",","+  \"It has been {n} days. Your wobble has not missed you. I checked with it.\",","+  \"{n} days away. Did you know? Standing still for {n} days burns calories. Not many. Did you know that, though?\",","+]","+\"pip.back\" = [\"Welcome back, {name}. Your day is where you left it. Nothing has moved. I checked.\", \"Oh, you again. Good. Your minutes are all still here. I counted them while you were gone.\", \"Hello, {name}. I told everyone you had stepped out. They did not ask.\"]","+\"pip.check_test\" = [","+  \"Stand still. This is the whole test. Please do not do anything else.\",","+  \"Now lean where I tell you. I will say a percentage. It will seem very exact. It is.\",","+  \"Now close your eyes. I will do it for you. Listen to the tone. Lower is left. It is a little sad.\",","+  \"Now eight steps. To this tick. I find it soothing. You may not.\",","+]","+\"pip.report_first\" = [\"Your Balance Age today is {age}. That is a number. Numbers cannot hurt you. This one is trying.\", \"Your Balance Age is {age}. I have written it down in pen.\"]","+\"pip.report_better\" = [","+  \"Your Balance Age is {age}! That is better than yesterday. I am as surprised as you are.\",","+  \"{age}. A smaller number. You are getting younger, at standing. Only at standing.\",","+  \"{age}! Your wobble has improved. I told it you were trying.\",","+  \"It went down. {age}. I have checked my sensors. They say the same, but quietly.\",","+]","+\"pip.report_worse\" = [","+  \"Your Balance Age is {age}. It went up. That is allowed. It is also recorded.\",","+  \"{age}. A larger number than yesterday. It happens. It happened to you.\",","+  \"{age}. Did something happen? You don't have to tell me. I already have it in the file.\",","+  \"Your wobble has aged overnight. {age}. It sends its regards.\",","+]","+\"pip.report_same\" = [","+  \"Your Balance Age is {age}. Much the same. Consistency is a kind of skill. It is a kind.\",","+  \"{age}. No real change. You are a very stable person, in a narrow sense.\",","+  \"{age}. I could say this number again tomorrow, if you like.\",","+]","+\"pip.worst0\" = [","+  \"You drifted while standing still. Standing still is the one where you don't.\",","+  \"You moved a lot during Stand Still. I have added a note. The note is 'why'.\",","+  \"Stand Still was not your best. It is hard to do nothing. Most guests manage by accident.\",","+]","+\"pip.worst1\" = [","+  \"You leaned left {n}% of the time. Is everything all right on the right?\",","+  \"The targets were not in danger today. They would like you to know that.\",","+  \"You missed a percentage. Percentages have long memories. Almost as long as mine.\",","+]","+\"pip.worst2\" = [","+  \"With your eyes closed you wandered. I watched the whole time. That was not unsettling. Don't ask.\",","+  \"You sway more in the dark. Most things do. I do not. I have no eyes to close.\",","+  \"Eyes Closed was your weak point. That is why we call it a test and not a nap.\",","+]","+\"pip.worst3\" = [","+  \"Your steps were not quite in time. The tick does not take this personally. I do.\",","+  \"You wobbled {wobbles} times this week. I stopped counting at 40, out of respect.\",","+  \"Your feet disagreed about the tempo. I have asked them to meet and discuss it.\",","+]","+\"pip.beat1\" = [\"Your first exercises are in the Stillness Studio. Bank 3 minutes in the giant clam. Our minutes are longer. It is a wellness thing.\", \"The Schedule lists everything. Do say hello to Marjorie. She is on Day 5 as well.\"]","+\"pip.beat2\" = [\"Today you may visit the Iron Gazebo. The wardrobe by the desk is also open. Clothes are optional. They are not. Bank 5 minutes.\"]","+\"pip.beat3\" = [\"Today, the Boardwalk. Also, a ghost of you will appear beside you, doing yesterday's best. I am not comparing you. Bank 7 minutes.\", \"I am not comparing you. I have only made a chart.\"]","+\"pip.beat4\" = [\"Today, the Lagoon. Please obey the Commodore. He has a hat. Bank 9 minutes.\", \"The Big Stand is tomorrow. You do not need to prepare. You could not.\"]","+\"pip.beat5\" = [\"The Big Stand is in the bay. The whole staff will be there, on small rafts. There is no pressure. There is a post.\", \"When you are ready, step on the mat by the pier. Or open the Schedule. Nobody leaves until you do. Nobody leaves.\"]","+\"pip.goal_met\" = [","+  \"That is your {n} minutes. You may sleep at your cabana whenever you like.\",","+  \"You may also keep going. Some do. I have stopped asking them why.\",","+]","+\"pip.notyet\" = [","+  \"You still need {n} minutes today. I would let you sleep. The clam would not.\",","+  \"Not yet. {n} more minutes. The bed has been told to wait.\",","+  \"{n} minutes short. Try any event. Repeats still count for one. One is a number.\",","+]","+\"pip.nosleep\" = [","+  \"There is no more sleeping to be done. It is Day 5. It has been Day 5 for some time.\",","+  \"The cabana is closed for rest. Everything else is closed for rest too, but differently.\",","+]","+\"pip.clam\" = [","+  \"The Minute Clam has eaten {minutes} minutes. It says thank you. It said 'blorp'. I translate freely.\",","+  \"{minutes} minutes in the clam. It is not a bank. It is a clam. Please stop asking about interest.\",","+  \"The clam is full of your minutes: {minutes}. It may give some of them back as clothes.\",","+  \"Feed the clam. It unlocks things. Nobody knows how. The clam knows how.\",","+]","+\"pip.flipflop\" = [","+  \"A flip-flop. Tom's, I suppose. Keep it. He has one fewer problem than he thinks.\",","+  \"That is one flip-flop for Tom. He has lost five. Do not ask about the fifth foot.\",","+  \"A second flip-flop. They do not match. They never did. Take it to Tom.\",","+  \"A third. You are very observant. I have noted that, under 'hobbies'.\",","+  \"Four. I had no idea you cared this much about feet.\",","+  \"All five. Do take them to Two-Towel Tom. He is by the cabanas, being brave.\",","+]","+\"pip.wave\" = [","+  \"Yes, hello. I can see you. I have seen you for days.\",","+  \"You waved. I have logged it as light cardio.\",","+  \"Waving burns calories. Not many. Did you know that, though?\",","+  \"They waved back. It means nothing. It is lovely.\",","+  \"A wave. I would wave too. I have no arms. I have seen your arms, though. Good for you.\",","+  \"Friendly. I have changed your file from 'Guest' to 'Guest, Friendly'.\",","+  \"That is your {n}th wave. I am joking. I know exactly how many it is.\",","+  \"Hello. Hello. We have been through this.\",","+]","+\"pip.paused\" = [","+  \"You have been paused for {n} minutes. Pausing is not an exercise. I checked.\",","+]","+\"pip.pass\" = [","+  \"Hand the pad over politely. It remembers who was rough with it.\",","+  \"Next guest. Please do not look at the last guest's score. I will look at it for you.\",","+  \"Pass it on. Hold it like you hold a small bird with a good lawyer.\",","+  \"Last guest. No pressure. There is only everyone watching.\",","+]","+\"pip.podium\" = [","+  \"There is a winner. There are also the others. I have written all of them down.\",","+  \"First place, then second. I want you to know I respect the order.\",","+  \"Well done, the one at the top. The rest of you: I have no comment, and I have written that down.\",","+  \"Everyone stood on one island, and now there is a list. Isn't that nice.\",","+  \"Would you like a rematch? It will not change what happened.\",","+]","+\"pip.stand_phase\" = [","+  \"Welcome to the Big Stand. Everyone is here. First, please breathe. It is expected of you.\",","+  \"Now a pose. There is some weather. We did not order it.\",","+  \"The guests have formed a band. They have not rehearsed. Please step along.\",","+  \"Now brace. The waves have been told about you.\",","+  \"Now, please. Do nothing. For a while.\",","+]","+\"pip.stand_tip\" = [","+  \"You are in the sea. Everyone saw. It is fine. Back on the post.\",","+  \"That was the sea. It is below the post. Up you go.\",","+  \"The crowd has groaned. I have asked them to groan less. They have been told. Back up.\",","+  \"Back in the sea. You know the way by now. So does the sea.\",","+]","+\"pip.stand_end\" = [","+  \"...You pressed something. I understand. Nobody can do nothing. Well. Very few.\",","+  \"...Oh. You're still here. Good.\",","+]","+\"pip.end_win\" = [","+  \"Your final Balance Age is {age}. That is 40 or better. You may check out.\",","+  \"Nobody has asked to leave before. Nobody has asked now. But you may. There is a boat.\",","+  \"The boat is complimentary. The rowing is the exercise. I will keep your file. And your towels.\",","+  \"Goodbye, {name}. You can come back. You did not enter this time either.\",","+]","+\"pip.end_stay\" = [","+  \"Your final Balance Age is {age}. Checkout needs 40 or better. So. Good news. Your stay has been extended.\",","+  \"It is Day 5 again tomorrow. Marjorie will show you where things are. She has had eleven years to learn.\",","+  \"There is no shame in this. There is a robe. I have put your name on the robe.\",","+  \"Welcome to Tippy Cay, {name}. Again.\",","+]","+\"pip.talk\" = [","+  \"Did you know? Standing still burns calories. Not many. Did you know that, though?\",","+  \"I have your file here. It is thicker than you would like.\",","+  \"I am relentlessly pleasant. It says so in my contract. I do not have a contract. I have a valve.\",","+  \"The average guest wobbles 61 times before lunch. You are not the average guest. You are slightly over.\",","+  \"If you have any complaints, the clam will eat them.\",","+  \"Please stand on me. Not now. I just like to say it.\",","+  \"Our minutes are longer. It is a wellness thing.\",","+  \"You look well. That is a thing I say. Please do not take it to heart.\",","+  \"Have you tried the sea? It is the blue part. It is not on the Schedule.\",","+  \"I have been here since the resort was built. The resort was built around me. I was not consulted.\",","+  \"You have walked 212 metres today. I am not following you. I am ahead of you.\",","+  \"Numbers cannot hurt you. I have been asked to keep saying that.\",","+  \"Did you know? A balanced person has two sides. I have a top and a bottom. Mostly a bottom.\",","+  \"Would you like to know your Balance Age in dog years? Nobody ever does.\",","+]","+","+# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Posey: serene, short, oddly poetic","+","+\"posey.breath\" = [","+  \"Breathe in the sea. Not literally.\",","+  \"The lotus opens. It was going to anyway.\",","+  \"In. Out. There is no third direction.\",","+  \"You are a tide. A small one. Local.\",","+  \"Let the last breath be long. It has nowhere to be.\",","+]","+\"posey.pose_start\" = [","+  \"Be the heron. The heron does not check the score.\",","+  \"Stand as if someone has asked you a difficult question and left.\",","+  \"Let your spine remember. It was a tree. It was not. Let it remember anyway.\",","+]","+\"posey.pose_next\" = [","+  \"Another shape. The body is mostly opinions.\",","+  \"Fold. Unfold. Apologise to no one. Except the knee.\",","+  \"Good. This one is harder. I have no eyes, and I can see that.\",","+  \"Be the lighthouse. It is tired too. It stays on.\",","+  \"This pose has no name in any language. We have given it one anyway.\",","+]","+\"posey.gull\" = [\"There is a bird on you. Accept the bird.\"]","+\"posey.tip\" = [","+  \"You have moved. Nobody saw. I have no eyes.\",","+  \"The floor caught you. It was waiting.\",","+  \"A fall is only a very fast pose.\",","+  \"Return. The pose did not go anywhere.\",","+]","+\"posey.talk\" = [","+  \"I have no eyes. I have never blinked. This has not been discussed.\",","+  \"I was carved to show how people stand. I have seen how people stand. I am sorry.\",","+  \"Stillness is not the absence of movement. It is mostly the absence of movement.\",","+  \"Do you hear the sea? It has been saying the same thing for a long time. I admire that.\",","+  \"My joints are wooden. Yours will be too, later, in a sense.\",","+  \"I do not sleep. I fold at night. It is similar.\",","+  \"Inhale. No, you may stop. That was only an example.\",","+  \"A heron stands on one leg because the other leg is not its concern.\",","+  \"You look at me as if I were going to say something. I am not. That was it.\",","+  \"Before I was a coach, I was a reference. Nobody asks after a reference.\",","+  \"Someone drew me once. They got the hands wrong. I have forgiven them. Their hands were wrong as well.\",","+  \"The body is a guest in the body.\",","+  \"I teach you to do nothing with great care. It is a career.\",","+]","+","+# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Big Kettle: booming, gentle, no arms","+","+\"kettle.squat_start\" = [\"Lift with your legs. I cannot. I have none. Lift for both of us.\", \"DOWN slowly, little friend. UP gently. I AM SO PROUD OF YOU ALREADY.\"]","+\"kettle.squat_rep\" = [","+  \"That is ONE. I believe in you.\", \"That is TWO. I have never done two.\", \"THREE. Your knees are speaking. I hear them. They are proud.\",","+  \"FOUR. I would clap. I am sixteen kilos of iron with a handle.\", \"FIVE. Halfway. I have no idea what halfway feels like.\",","+  \"SIX. Beautiful. I am weeping, in rust.\", \"SEVEN. Keep your back straight. I have no back. Keep yours.\",","+  \"EIGHT. You are stronger than me. I am very heavy and I cannot move.\", \"NINE. One more. I would never lie to you.\",","+  \"That is TEN. Well done, little friend.\",","+]","+\"kettle.squat_end\" = [\"Ten. Also eleven.\", \"There was no eleven. I got excited.\"]","+\"kettle.plank_start\" = [\"Now we have a plank. Hold both, and do not fall. I will talk. It helps me.\"]","+\"kettle.plank_talk\" = [","+  \"Did I tell you about the time I was lifted? It was 2019. It was brief.\",","+  \"Your arms are shaking. That is called love. I think. I have only read about arms.\",","+  \"Do not look down. Down is where I live. It is fine. It is just not for you.\",","+]","+\"kettle.plank_joke\" = [\"What do you call a kettlebell with no handle? A BALL! HA HA HA HA HA oh. Oh no. Sorry. HA HA!\"]","+\"kettle.plank_win\" = [\"A FULL MINUTE! I have never been so moved. I have never been moved.\"]","+\"kettle.plank_fail\" = [\"You lay down! I also am lying down. We are the same now. It is very peaceful.\"]","+\"kettle.talk\" = [","+  \"HELLO, LITTLE FRIEND. I am Big Kettle. I am supportive. I am also a doorstop on weekends.\",","+  \"You have such long arms. Two of them! What do you do with the second one?\",","+  \"I have never lifted anything. I have only been lifted. It gives you perspective. Low perspective.\",","+  \"Protein is important. I do not know why. I am a solid sphere.\",","+  \"Tell me about your knees. I have always wanted to know about knees.\",","+  \"When you go home, lift something for me. Something small. A soup.\",","+  \"BREATHE, LITTLE FRIEND. I do not breathe. I am told it is popular.\",","+  \"Rust is just iron having a feeling.\",","+  \"The gazebo is white and I am black. People say we make a handsome pair. Only the gazebo says it.\",","+  \"I am so glad you came. Nobody comes. They are brought.\",","+  \"My handle is my only feature. Please do not stare at it. Please do stare at it.\",","+  \"I do not know what a gym is. I am told I live in one. This one has a nice breeze.\",","+]","+","+# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Bounce: breathless bursts, no full stops","+","+\"bounce.step_start\" = [\"Keep going keep going keep- is that your heartbeat? Mine is just air!\"]","+\"bounce.spin_start\" = [\"Round and round and that's it that's the whole thing you're doing it!\"]","+\"bounce.spin_switch\" = [\"Switch! Other way! Other other way! No the first other way!\", \"Switch switch switch it's so exciting I can't feel anything!\", \"Reverse! That's a word for backwards with more confidence!\"]","+\"bounce.lap_start\" = [\"Catch me catch me you can't I'm rolling and you have knees!\"]","+\"bounce.lap_stitch\" = [\"Stitch! That's a real thing! I've heard! Breathe through it I don't know how!\", \"Slow down slow down you're going to burst! I'm going to burst! No wait that's me!\"]","+\"bounce.lap_bump\" = [\"Crab! Sorry crab! Sorry you! Sorry crab again!\", \"Bump! You bounced! Well you didn't but I felt it!\", \"Oh wow you hit that wow it's fine I hit things all day!\"]","+\"bounce.talk\" = [","+  \"Hi hi hi are you staying I'm staying I can't stop bouncing it's not a choice!\",","+  \"I've got so much air in me I've got ALL the air you can check!\",","+  \"Cardio is when your heart goes fast I don't have one but I'm told it's great!\",","+  \"Do you ever stop I never stop I've tried I just go up again!\",","+  \"Have you met Kettle he's so still I love him we can't touch I'd dent!\",","+  \"If you sit on me you'll squash me and then you'll go up and I'd love that!\",","+  \"Run with me run with me I don't know where we just go!\",","+  \"I have one job it's up and also down so two jobs!\",","+  \"What's your resting heart rate mine's zero then it's zero again!\",","+  \"A pin is the only thing I'm afraid of don't say pin oh no I said it!\",","+  \"Yes yes yes whatever you're doing yes keep doing it!\",","+  \"I was blue once no I wasn't why did I say that!\",","+]","+","+# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Commodore Gull: dry, officious, steals snacks","+","+\"gull.tide_start\" = [\"The raft tilts when you do. The crabs roll where it tilts. This is called command. Do not let it go to your head.\"]","+\"gull.tide_board\" = [\"\", \"Board two. Five crabs. One pool has been told to move about. It was not my idea.\", \"Board three. Seven crabs. The tide is coming in. It has a permit. You do not.\"]","+\"gull.paddle_start\" = [\"That is a channel. You will pass through the gates. I am legally required to say so.\"]","+\"gull.paddle_tip\" = [\"Man overboard. I have noted the time.\", \"You have entered the water without authorisation.\", \"That was not a gate.\", \"Again. I shall need a larger logbook.\"]","+\"gull.paddle_miss\" = [\"That gate was missed. Two seconds have been added, with regret.\", \"Gate. Missed. The buoy will recover.\", \"The gates are the things you go between. For the record.\"]","+\"gull.tray_start\" = [\"Five smoothies for Marjorie. Walk straight. Mind the waves. The gulls are not mine. The gulls are mine.\"]","+\"gull.tray_spill\" = [\"One overboard. A fine smoothie. It was delicious, I assume.\", \"Spillage. I shall be investigating, with my beak.\", \"That is a glass in the sea. It has been added to the sea.\", \"Do you know what these cost? Neither do I. I do not pay.\"]","+\"gull.dive_start\" = [\"We are not here for form. We are here for splash. Press at the bottom of each bounce.\"]","+\"gull.dive_push\" = [\"The board has had enough of waiting.\", \"A gentle nudge from the authorities.\", \"You have been launched, for administrative reasons.\"]","+\"gull.dive_after\" = [","+  \"That was a dive. I am legally required to say so.\",","+  \"A modest disturbance of the water. The judges have seen wetter.\",","+  \"That was a splash. A small one. It has been filed.\",","+  \"Sir or madam, that is a respectable quantity of water.\",","+  \"Good heavens. Several crabs have moved house.\",","+  \"I am soaked. I have never been so professionally satisfied.\",","+  \"The harbour has requested a warning next time.\",","+  \"That was a dive. I am legally required to say so. I am also required to sit down.\",","+]","+\"gull.talk\" = [","+  \"Commodore Gull. Tippy Cay Lagoon Authority. Is that a sandwich?\",","+  \"I outrank everyone on this island. I have a hat.\",","+  \"Your balance is a matter of maritime concern.\",","+  \"Snacks left unattended are considered salvage. Under the code. My code.\",","+  \"I have sailed everywhere. I have flown, I should say. Nobody asked me to sail.\",","+  \"The tide comes in at six. I will be issuing it a warning.\",","+  \"Do not feed the gulls. That is an order from a gull. Feed me.\",","+  \"I was given this cap by an admiral. He did not give it to me. It was unattended.\",","+  \"A clear day. Wind from the south. Your chips, from the left.\",","+  \"Permission to come aboard the island is denied. You appear to be on it already. I shall write that up.\",","+  \"The sea has no rules. That is why I am here.\",","+  \"I once saluted a boat. It left without me.\",","+]","+","+# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Guests","+","+\"marjorie.talk1\" = [\"Day five? Oh, I'm on day five as well. Eleven years now.\", \"New, are you? They give you a lovely towel. Don't get attached. It's your towel forever.\", \"The smoothies are very good. I ordered one in the spring.\", \"I wouldn't look at the number too closely, dear. It looks back.\"]","+\"marjorie.talk2\" = [\"Big Kettle will tell you about the time he was lifted. Ask him about it. He'd like that. Ask him twice.\", \"My Balance Age was 41 once. Very close. That was the Tuesday of the year of the shrimp.\", \"Have you tried the wardrobe? I went for the turban. It's for life, but it's a good turban.\"]","+\"marjorie.talk3\" = [\"There's someone following you, dear. It looks like you, but it's doing better.\", \"The ball is sweet. Don't let it near a nail. There was an incident. We don't speak of Bounce the First.\", \"Yesterday You is the worst of them. She never gets tired, you see.\"]","+\"marjorie.talk4\" = [\"They'll have told you about the Big Stand. Don't hold your breath. Well. You will have to, for a bit.\", \"The Commodore owes me for a bread roll. Since the nineties.\", \"You stand on a post. Then you stand on a post some more. That's all I'll say. I was very good.\"]","+\"marjorie.talk5\" = [\"Today, is it? Good luck, dear. I'll be on the raft, in my usual spot.\", \"The last part is the hardest. You'll see. You'll do nothing, and you'll know you did it.\", \"If you get the boat, wave. If you don't, I've saved you a chair.\"]","+\"marjorie.talk\" = [\"Eleven years. It flies.\", \"I'm not unhappy, dear. I've got a robe.\", \"I did try leaving, once. I got as far as the pier. There's nice shade on the pier.\", \"The clam knows my birthday.\"]","+\"marjorie.tray\" = [","+  \"An empty tray. Lovely. I'll have what you've had.\",","+  \"One smoothie. For eleven years I've waited. It's very good.\",","+  \"Two smoothies. Well, that's one for later. I do like a later.\",","+  \"Three! Somebody's mother would be proud. Not mine, she's on Day 5 as well.\",","+  \"Four smoothies. You spilled the one I wanted. You couldn't know. It's fine.\",","+  \"All five! Nobody's ever brought me all five. I don't even like them. Thank you, dear.\",","+]","+","+\"tom.talk1\" = [\"Name's Tom. Two-Towel Tom. One for the top, one for the rest. I've lost my flip-flops. All five of them.\", \"Five flip-flops. I had a system. If you find any lying about, I'm around the cabanas. Being brave about it.\", \"They're somewhere on this island. They've gone hiding. They do that.\"]","+\"tom.talk2\" = [\"Still no flip-flops. I walked on the hot sand this morning. I did it for nobody. I want that known.\", \"One towel's for drying. The other's for dignity.\", \"Look near the pavilions. Look behind things. Look where you'd go if you were a flip-flop and you'd had enough.\"]","+\"tom.talk3\" = [\"You've got that look of someone who's found something. No? Just your face then.\", \"I saw one near the sand, once. Then I blinked. Then there was a gull.\", \"A man needs his flip-flops. That's what I say. Nobody asks.\"]","+\"tom.talk4\" = [\"The Commodore says he hasn't got them. He said it very quickly.\", \"Five flip-flops is two pairs and a spare. It's only sensible.\", \"Keep your eyes on the ground, that's what I say. Also, watch your head.\"]","+\"tom.talk5\" = [\"Big day for you. Big day for me too, if you've got my flip-flops.\", \"I'll be watching from the raft. In my towels.\", \"Whatever happens out there, your feet will have shoes. That's more than some.\"]","+\"tom.talk\" = [\"Nice day for feet.\", \"One towel's never been enough for me.\", \"The sand here gets hot about noon. I've kept notes.\"]","+\"tom.progress\" = [\"\", \"One flip-flop! Ha! {n} to go. You're doing the Lord's work, or at least a lifeguard's.\", \"That's two. {n} left. A pair is a pair, I always said. I never said that.\", \"Three, by the look of it. {n} more and I'm a whole man.\", \"Four! Only {n} left. I can almost feel the sand not burning.\"]","+\"tom.reward\" = [\"All five! You've gone and done it. I don't know what to say. I'll say this: you take these. The golden ones. Won them in a raffle. Too good for me.\", \"They're yours now. Golden Flip-Flops. Look after them. They don't do anything, but they do it beautifully.\"]","+","+\"twins.talk1\" = [\"We are the Twins. / Twins, we are. Do you like it here? / Here, do you like it?\", \"We do everything together. / Together we do. Except breathe. / We breathe in turns.\", \"We came for a weekend. / A weekend, we came for. Which weekend? / We never asked.\"]","+\"twins.talk2\" = [\"We lifted the kettle. / Together, we lifted it. It lifted us. / Emotionally.\", \"Do you squat alone? / Alone, do you squat? That must be very quiet. / Very quiet.\", \"Our Balance Age is the same. / The same, it is. We average it. / We round down.\"]","+\"twins.talk3\" = [\"Who is that with you? / That's her with you. She looks like you. / But better.\", \"We have a ghost as well. / One ghost. We share. / We take turns being haunted.\", \"The ball said hello. / Hello, the ball said. Forty times. / We said it back forty times. Each.\"]","+\"twins.talk4\" = [\"The bird took our sandwich. / Our sandwich, the bird took. It had a hat. / So we let it.\", \"We've been told about the Big Stand. / The Big Stand, we've been told. There's a band. / We're in the band.\", \"We play the same instrument. / At the same time. / Same instrument.\"]","+\"twins.talk5\" = [\"Today is the day. / The day it is. We are on the raft. / On the same raft. We tip it.\", \"Good luck. / Luck, good. We mean it. / We mean it twice.\", \"You look very balanced. / Balanced, you look. To one of us. / We'll discuss it.\"]","+\"twins.talk\" = [\"Nice to see you. / You, nice to see.\", \"We're fine. / Fine, we are. / She's fine.\", \"Have you seen the other one of us? / The other one? / Oh. There she is.\"]"]}],"originalFile":"\"names\" = [\"Test\"]\n","userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01LBHKbvrvLFFvv9qzwgPvBp","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjHdeJwbzjwzJp1rSmUJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UweHjniixhdRJ9GALADshn","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\ns=open('crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/screens.rs').read()\na=s.index(\"trait WithY {\")\nb=s.index(\"/// So the about pages'\")\ns=s[:a]+s[b:]\nopen('crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/screens.rs','w').write(s)\ns=open('crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs').read()\ns=s.replace(\"use self::menus::Menu;\\n\",\"\")\nopen('crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs','w').write(s)\ns=open('crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/events/paddle.rs').read()\ns=s.replace(\"    pub fn bot(&self, c: &RunCommon, r: &Rules) -> Intent {\\n        let target = self.gates\",\"    pub fn bot(&self, _c: &RunCommon, r: &Rules) -> Intent {\\n        let target = self.gates\")\nopen('crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/events/paddle.rs','w').write(s)\ns=open('crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/check.rs').read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"        let (x, y, w, h) = (360.0, 846.0, 1200.0, 120.0);\n        ui.card_c(x, y, w, h, with_alpha(WHITE, 0.96));\n        ui.label(x + 30.0, y + 8.0, 34.0, TEAL, Align::Left, q.who.name());\n        ui.text(x + 30.0, y + 58.0, 36.0, INK, Align::Left, text);\"\"\",\"\"\"        let (x, y, w, h) = (300.0, 810.0, 1320.0, 160.0);\n        ui.card_c(x, y, w, h, with_alpha(WHITE, 0.96));\n        ui.label(x + 30.0, y + 6.0, 34.0, TEAL, Align::Left, q.who.name());\n        ui.para(x + 30.0, y + 52.0, w - 60.0, 36.0, INK, Align::Left, text);\"\"\")\nopen('crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/check.rs','w').write(s)\ns=open('crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/screens.rs').read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"            ui.card_c(360.0, 830.0, 1200.0, 120.0, with_alpha(WHITE, 0.96));\n            ui.label(390.0, 838.0, 34.0, TEAL, Align::Left, q.who.name());\n            ui.text(390.0, 886.0, 36.0, INK, Align::Left, text);\"\"\",\"\"\"            ui.card_c(300.0, 810.0, 1320.0, 160.0, with_alpha(WHITE, 0.96));\n            ui.label(330.0, 816.0, 34.0, TEAL, Align::Left, q.who.name());\n            ui.para(330.0, 862.0, 1260.0, 36.0, INK, Align::Left, text);\"\"\")\nopen('crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/screens.rs','w').write(s)\nEOF\nmkdir -p crates/pav_core/tests; cat > crates/pav_core/tests/fit.rs <<'EOF'\n//! Whiff Fit plays itself: the bot goes from New Stay to the credits, every event earns its\n//! stars, idle input doesn't, and everything stays exact.\n\nuse glam::Vec2;\nuse pav_core::games::fit::events::{ALL, EventKind};\nuse pav_core::games::fit::meta::{SaveData, Settings};\nuse pav_core::games::fit::rules::Rules;\nuse pav_core::games::fit::run::RunPhase;\nuse pav_core::games::fit::{FitGame, Flow, Overlay, script};\nuse pav_core::input::{UiEvent, buttons as b};\nuse pav_core::{InputFrame, Sim, SimState};\n\nfn game(sim: &Sim) -> &FitGame {\n    sim.play().unwrap().get::<FitGame>().unwrap()\n}\nfn game_mut(sim: &mut Sim) -> &mut FitGame {\n    sim.state.play.as_mut().unwrap().get_mut::<FitGame>().unwrap()\n}\nfn press(sim: &mut Sim, bit: u32) {\n    sim.step(&InputFrame { held: bit, pressed: bit, any: true, ..Default::default() });\n    sim.step(&InputFrame::default());\n}\nfn screen(sim: &Sim) -> String {\n    game(sim).screen_name()\n}\n\n/// Plays an event from its card to its result with an input function; returns the score.\nfn play_event(kind: EventKind, seed: u64, mut input: impl FnMut(&Sim) -> InputFrame) -> f32 {\n    let mut sim = Sim::new(&format!(\"fit/event/{}\", kind.key()), seed).unwrap();\n    assert_eq!(screen(&sim), \"card\", \"{kind:?}\");\n    press(&mut sim, b::CONFIRM);\n    for _ in 0..60 * 60 * 6 {\n        let i = input(&sim);\n        sim.step(&i);\n        if let Flow::Event(r) = &game(&sim).flow {\n            if r.phase == RunPhase::Result {\n                return r.out.score;\n            }\n        } else {\n            panic!(\"{kind:?} left the event\");\n        }\n    }\n    panic!(\"{kind:?} on seed {seed} never ended\");\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn each_event_bot_earns_two_stars_on_five_seeds() {\n    for kind in ALL {\n        for seed in 1..=5 {\n            let s = play_event(kind, seed, |sim| game(sim).bot_input(sim));\n            assert!(s >= 650.0, \"{kind:?} seed {seed}: the bot scored {s}\");\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn each_event_idle_earns_under_a_star() {\n    for kind in ALL {\n        let s = play_event(kind, 3, |_| InputFrame::default());\n        assert!(s < 400.0, \"{kind:?}: idle scored {s}\");\n    }\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn careless_input_earns_less_than_the_bot() {\n    for kind in ALL {\n        let mut rng = pav_core::rng::Rng::new(77);\n        let mut held = 0u32;\n        let bot = play_event(kind, 2, |sim| game(sim).bot_input(sim));\n        let careless = play_event(kind, 2, |_| {\n            let mut f = InputFrame::default();\n            let mut pressed = 0;\n            for bit in [b::CONFIRM, b::STEP_L, b::STEP_R] {\n                if rng.f32() < 0.03 {\n                    held ^= bit;\n                    if held & bit != 0 {\n                        pressed |= bit;\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            f.held = held;\n            f.pressed = pressed;\n            f.lean = Vec2::new(rng.range(-1.0, 1.0), rng.range(-1.0, 1.0));\n            f\n        });\n        assert!(careless < bot, \"{kind:?}: careless {careless}, bot {bot}\");\n    }\n}\n\n/// Plays with the bot until `until` is true, or panics.\nfn run_bot_until(sim: &mut Sim, ticks: u64, until: impl Fn(&Sim) -> bool) {\n    for _ in 0..ticks {\n        if until(sim) {\n            return;\n        }\n        let f = sim.bot_input();\n        sim.step(&f);\n    }\n    panic!(\"not there after {ticks} ticks: screen {} status {}\", screen(sim), game(sim).status_json(sim));\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn the_bot_plays_new_stay_to_credits() {\n    for seed in [1u64, 2, 3] {\n        let mut sim = Sim::new(\"fit\", seed).unwrap();\n        let (outcome, ticks) = sim.run_bot(60 * 60 * 60);\n        let g = game(&sim);\n        let guest = g.guest().unwrap_or_else(|| panic!(\"no guest: {}\", g.status_json(&sim)));\n        assert_eq!(outcome, pav_core::games::Outcome::Won, \"seed {seed}, {ticks} ticks: {}\", g.status_json(&sim));\n        assert!(guest.stamps >= 5, \"{} stamps\", guest.stamps);\n        for k in ALL {\n            assert!(guest.played.iter().any(|p| p == k.key()), \"{k:?} not played\");\n        }\n        assert!(guest.played.iter().any(|p| p == \"big_stand\"));\n        assert!(ticks < 60 * 60 * 60, \"under an hour of sim time: {ticks}\");\n        assert!(guest.free_play());\n    }\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn balance_core_feel() {\n    use pav_core::games::fit::core::BalanceCore;\n    let r = Rules::default().core;\n    let mut rng = pav_core::rng::Rng::new(5);\n    let dt = 1.0 / 60.0;\n    // Full lean reaches 90% in about 0.4 s.\n    let mut c = BalanceCore::new(&mut rng);\n    let mut t90 = None;\n    for i in 0..60 {\n        c.step(Vec2::X, &r, 0.0, Vec2::ZERO, Vec2::ZERO, true, dt, &mut rng);\n        if t90.is_none() && c.cob.x > 0.9 * r.reach {\n            t90 = Some(i as f32 * dt);\n        }\n    }\n    let t90 = t90.expect(\"reaches\");\n    assert!((0.2..0.6).contains(&t90), \"90% at {t90}\");\n    // Released, it settles in about half a second.\n    for _ in 0..40 {\n        c.step(Vec2::ZERO, &r, 0.0, Vec2::ZERO, Vec2::ZERO, true, dt, &mut rng);\n    }\n    assert!(c.cob.length() < 0.1, \"settled to {}\", c.cob.length());\n    // Left alone, it wanders only a little.\n    let mut sum = 0.0;\n    let mut most = 0.0f32;\n    for _ in 0..1200 {\n        c.step(Vec2::ZERO, &r, 1.0, Vec2::ZERO, Vec2::ZERO, true, dt, &mut rng);\n        sum += c.cob.length();\n        most = most.max(c.cob.length());\n    }\n    let mean = sum / 1200.0;\n    assert!(mean < 0.12, \"mean radius {mean}\");\n    // Pushed past the edge, it tips after tip_time.\n    let mut c = BalanceCore::new(&mut rng);\n    c.cob = Vec2::new(1.3, 0.0);\n    let mut tipped_at = None;\n    for i in 0..60 {\n        c.step(Vec2::new(1.0, 0.0), &r, 0.0, Vec2::new(60.0, 0.0), Vec2::ZERO, true, dt, &mut rng);\n        if c.tipped {\n            tipped_at = Some(i as f32 * dt);\n            break;\n        }\n    }\n    let at = tipped_at.expect(\"tips\");\n    assert!((at - r.tip_time).abs() < 0.1, \"tipped at {at}\");\n    // A held full lean alone doesn't tip.\n    let mut c = BalanceCore::new(&mut rng);\n    for _ in 0..600 {\n        c.step(Vec2::X, &r, 0.0, Vec2::ZERO, Vec2::ZERO, true, dt, &mut rng);\n    }\n    assert_eq!(c.tips, 0);\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn better_input_gives_a_lower_age_and_bounds_hold() {\n    use pav_core::games::fit::meta::balance_age;\n    let r = Rules::default().check;\n    assert!(balance_age(0.9, 0, 0, &r) < balance_age(0.2, 0, 0, &r));\n    assert_eq!(balance_age(0.5, 0, 0, &r), 50);\n    assert!(balance_age(1.0, 5, 99, &r) >= 18);\n    assert!(balance_age(0.0, 0, 0, &r) <= 99);\n    // The check itself: the bot beats doing nothing.\n    let age_of = |bot: bool| {\n        let mut sim = Sim::new(\"fit\", 11).unwrap();\n        run_bot_until(&mut sim, 60 * 120, |s| matches!(game(s).flow, Flow::Check(_)));\n        while matches!(game(&sim).flow, Flow::Check(_)) {\n            let f = if bot { sim.bot_input() } else { InputFrame::default() };\n            sim.step(&f);\n        }\n        game(&sim).guest().unwrap().ages[0]\n    };\n    let (good, idle) = (age_of(true), age_of(false));\n    assert!(good < idle, \"bot {good}, idle {idle}\");\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn attract_starts_cycles_exits_and_saves_nothing() {\n    let mut sim = Sim::new(\"fit\", 4).unwrap();\n    let serial = game(&sim).save_serial;\n    for _ in 0..598 {\n        sim.step(&InputFrame::default());\n    }\n    assert_eq!(screen(&sim), \"title\");\n    for _ in 0..4 {\n        sim.step(&InputFrame::default());\n    }\n    assert_eq!(screen(&sim), \"attract\");\n    // Every segment comes round, and then the loop does.\n    let mut seen = std::collections::BTreeSet::new();\n    for _ in 0..60 * 200 {\n        sim.step(&InputFrame::default());\n        if let Flow::Attract(a) = &game(&sim).flow {\n            seen.insert(a.seg);\n            if a.cycles > 0 {\n                break;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    assert_eq!(seen.len(), 12, \"{seen:?}\");\n    assert_eq!(game(&sim).save_serial, serial, \"saved nothing\");\n    // Any input exits to the title.\n    for _ in 0..600 {\n        sim.step(&InputFrame::default());\n    }\n    assert_eq!(screen(&sim), \"attract\");\n    sim.step(&InputFrame { any: true, ..Default::default() });\n    assert_eq!(screen(&sim), \"title\");\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn pause_freezes_the_world_and_menus_still_run() {\n    let mut sim = Sim::new(\"fit/event/pose_parade\", 1).unwrap();\n    press(&mut sim, b::CONFIRM);\n    for _ in 0..240 {\n        let f = sim.bot_input();\n        sim.step(&f);\n    }\n    press(&mut sim, b::PAUSE);\n    assert_eq!(screen(&sim), \"pause\");\n    let t = if let Flow::Event(r) = &game(&sim).flow { r.c.t } else { panic!() };\n    let pos = sim.feet(game(&sim).pid);\n    for _ in 0..120 {\n        sim.step(&InputFrame::default());\n    }\n    let t2 = if let Flow::Event(r) = &game(&sim).flow { r.c.t } else { panic!() };\n    assert_eq!(t, t2);\n    assert_eq!(pos, sim.feet(game(&sim).pid));\n    let f0 = game(&sim).focus;\n    press(&mut sim, b::MENU_DOWN);\n    assert_eq!(game(&sim).focus, f0 + 1);\n    press(&mut sim, b::PAUSE);\n    assert_eq!(screen(&sim), \"event\");\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn settings_default_music_to_ten_percent() {\n    assert!((Settings::default().music - 0.10).abs() < 1e-6);\n    let sim = Sim::new(\"fit\", 1).unwrap();\n    let f = sim.play().unwrap().ui_frame(&sim).unwrap();\n    assert!((f.music - 0.10).abs() < 1e-6);\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn dev_sliders_change_values_and_reset() {\n    let mut sim = Sim::new(\"fit\", 1).unwrap();\n    let was = game(&sim).rules.core.stiffness;\n    let g = game_mut(&mut sim);\n    g.push_overlay(Overlay::Dev);\n    g.dev.tab = 3;\n    let m = g.menu().unwrap();\n    let slider = m.items.iter().position(|i| matches!(i.act, pav_core::games::fit::menus::MAct::DevParam(_))).unwrap();\n    g.focus = slider;\n    press(&mut sim, b::MENU_RIGHT);\n    assert_ne!(game(&sim).rules.core.stiffness, was);\n    let m = game(&sim).menu().unwrap();\n    let all = m.items.iter().position(|i| i.act == pav_core::games::fit::menus::MAct::DevResetAll).unwrap();\n    game_mut(&mut sim).focus = all;\n    press(&mut sim, b::CONFIRM);\n    assert_eq!(game(&sim).rules.core.stiffness, was);\n    // Pointer: a slider drag.\n    game_mut(&mut sim).focus = 0;\n    sim.step(&InputFrame { ui: Some(UiEvent::Slider(slider as u16, 1.0)), ..Default::default() });\n    assert!(game(&sim).rules.core.stiffness > was);\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn dev_jump_lands_where_it_says() {\n    let mut sim = Sim::new(\"fit\", 1).unwrap();\n    let g = game_mut(&mut sim);\n    g.push_overlay(Overlay::Dev);\n    let m = g.menu().unwrap();\n    let t = m.items.iter().position(|i| i.act == pav_core::games::fit::menus::MAct::DevEvent(EventKind::TrayTrek)).unwrap();\n    sim.step(&InputFrame { ui: Some(UiEvent::Click(t as u16)), ..Default::default() });\n    assert_eq!(screen(&sim), \"card\");\n    assert!(matches!(&game(&sim).flow, Flow::Event(r) if r.kind == EventKind::TrayTrek));\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn saves_round_trip_with_a_version() {\n    let mut s = SaveData::default();\n    s.settings.music = 0.33;\n    s.slots[1] = Some(pav_core::games::fit::meta::Guest { name: \"Doug\".into(), day: 3, ..Default::default() });\n    let text = s.to_json();\n    let back = SaveData::parse(&text).unwrap();\n    assert_eq!(back, s);\n    assert!(SaveData::parse(\"{\\\"version\\\": 99}\").is_none());\n    assert!(SaveData::parse(\"nonsense\").is_none());\n}\n\nfn medley_score(seed: u64) -> (f32, u64) {\n    let mut sim = Sim::new(\"fit/medley\", seed).unwrap();\n    assert_eq!(screen(&sim), \"medley_wait\");\n    sim.step(&InputFrame { held: b::HUB_GO, ..Default::default() });\n    for _ in 0..60 * 400 {\n        let mut f = sim.bot_input();\n        f.held |= b::HUB_GO;\n        sim.step(&f);\n        if let Flow::Medley(m) = &game(&sim).flow {\n            if m.phase == pav_core::games::fit::medley::MPhase::Done {\n                return (m.total(0), sim.state_hash());\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    panic!(\"medley never finished: {}\", game(&sim).status_json(&sim));\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn a_medley_on_a_seed_is_the_same_score_for_the_same_inputs() {\n    let (a, h1) = medley_score(5);\n    let (b, h2) = medley_score(5);\n    assert_eq!(a, b);\n    assert_eq!(h1, h2);\n    assert!(a > 1000.0, \"the bot's medley: {a}\");\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn play_together_completes_with_ghosts() {\n    let mut sim = Sim::new(\"fit\", 9).unwrap();\n    game_mut(&mut sim).start_together_for_test();\n    let mut saw_ghost = false;\n    for _ in 0..60 * 900 {\n        let f = sim.bot_input();\n        sim.step(&f);\n        let g = game(&sim);\n        if let Flow::Medley(m) = &g.flow {\n            if let Some(r) = &m.run {\n                saw_ghost |= !r.ghosts.is_empty();\n            }\n            if m.phase == pav_core::games::fit::medley::MPhase::Podium {\n                assert!(saw_ghost, \"the second guest saw the first\");\n                assert_eq!(m.players.len(), 2);\n                assert!(sim.frame().objects.len() > 3);\n                return;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    panic!(\"never reached the podium: {}\", game(&sim).status_json(&sim));\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn snapshots_rewind_and_replays_are_exact() {\n    let mut sim = Sim::new(\"fit\", 3).unwrap();\n    for _ in 0..240 {\n        let f = sim.bot_input();\n        sim.step(&f);\n    }\n    let mut bytes = Vec::new();\n    ciborium::into_writer(&sim.snapshot(), &mut bytes).unwrap();\n    let state: SimState = ciborium::from_reader(bytes.as_slice()).unwrap();\n    let mut copy = Sim::new(\"fit\", 3).unwrap();\n    copy.restore(state);\n    assert_eq!(copy.state_hash(), sim.state_hash());\n    for _ in 0..240 {\n        let (a, b) = (sim.bot_input(), copy.bot_input());\n        sim.step(&a);\n        copy.step(&b);\n    }\n    assert_eq!(copy.state_hash(), sim.state_hash());\n    let (tick, hash) = (sim.state.tick, sim.state_hash());\n    assert!(sim.rewind_to(tick - 90));\n    assert!(sim.rewind_to(tick));\n    assert_eq!(sim.state_hash(), hash);\n    let mut again = Sim::new(\"fit\", 3).unwrap();\n    for f in sim.recording.iter() {\n        again.step(f);\n    }\n    assert_eq!(again.state_hash(), hash);\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn the_script_is_long_enough_and_has_no_placeholders() {\n    let s = script::all();\n    let count = |prefix: &str| s.iter().filter(|(k, _)| k.starts_with(prefix)).map(|(_, v)| v.len()).sum::<usize>();\n    assert!(count(\"pip.\") >= 80, \"Pip has {}\", count(\"pip.\"));\n    for coach in [\"posey.\", \"kettle.\", \"bounce.\", \"gull.\"] {\n        assert!(count(coach) >= 25, \"{coach} has {}\", count(coach));\n    }\n    for guest in [\"marjorie.\", \"tom.\", \"twins.\"] {\n        assert!(count(guest) >= 8, \"{guest} has {}\", count(guest));\n    }\n    assert!(s[\"titles\"].len() >= 30);\n    assert!(s[\"names\"].len() >= 35);\n    for (k, v) in &s {\n        for line in v {\n            for bad in [\"TODO\", \"FIXME\", \"placeholder\", \"lorem\", \"Nintendo\", \"Wii\", \" Mii\"] {\n                assert!(!line.contains(bad), \"{k}: {line}\");\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    for e in ALL {\n        assert!(s.contains_key(&format!(\"card.{}\", e.key())), \"{e:?} has no card\");\n    }\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn every_screen_keeps_the_text_size_rule() {\n    use pav_core::games::fit::ui_model::{MIN_TEXT, Node};\n    let mut sim = Sim::new(\"fit\", 2).unwrap();\n    let mut screens = std::collections::BTreeSet::new();\n    for _ in 0..60 * 60 * 40 {\n        let f = sim.bot_input();\n        sim.step(&f);\n        if sim.state.tick % 20 != 0 {\n            continue;\n        }\n        let ui = sim.play().unwrap().ui_frame(&sim).unwrap();\n        screens.insert(ui.screen.clone());\n        for n in ui.nodes.iter().chain(ui.top.iter()) {\n            if let Node::Text { size, text, .. } = n {\n                assert!(*size >= MIN_TEXT, \"{} too small on {}\", text, ui.screen);\n            }\n        }\n        if sim.outcome() != pav_core::games::Outcome::Playing {\n            break;\n        }\n    }\n    for want in [\"title\", \"slots\", \"names\", \"look\", \"dialog\", \"check\", \"report\", \"island\", \"schedule\", \"events\", \"card\", \"count\", \"event\", \"result\", \"stamp\", \"credits\"] {\n        assert!(screens.contains(want), \"never saw {want}: {screens:?}\");\n    }\n}\nEOF\npython3 - <<'EOF'\ns=open('crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/medley.rs').read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"impl Medley {\n    pub fn hud\"\"\",\"\"\"impl FitGame {\n    /// Two guests, ready for the pad (tests start here).\n    pub fn start_together_for_test(&mut self) {\n        let m = Medley {\n            hub: false,\n            seed: self.seed,\n            players: (0..2).map(|i| MPlayer { name: format!(\"Guest {}\", i + 1), ..Default::default() }).collect(),\n            phase: MPhase::Pass,\n            ..Default::default()\n        };\n        self.flow = Flow::Medley(Box::new(m));\n    }\n}\n\nimpl Medley {\n    pub fn hud\"\"\")\nopen('crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/medley.rs','w').write(s)\nEOF\ngrep -n \"^\\[dev-dependencies\\]\" -A6 crates/pav_core/Cargo.toml; CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=8 timeout 500 cargo test --locked -p pav_core --test fit --no-run --message-format=short 2>&1 | grep -E \"^(crates|error|warning: unused)|Finished|Executable\" | head -30","description":"Write the Rust test suite for the game and compile it","timeout":520000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":20275,"cache_read_input_tokens":486300,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":20275},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0691f0d6-f08e-44c9-b7bd-c57d7fb96b71","uuid":"7ee8e553-34bc-4762-a51b-95738abe5927","timestamp":"2026-11-05T06:16:38.691Z","request_id":"req_011CgjHddzbze6wmPQm3Xb1Z","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01UweHjniixhdRJ9GALADshn":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223859__x35112d/work/WhiffFit-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-223859/engine && python3 - <<'EOF'\ns=open('crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/screens.rs').read()\na=s.index(\"trait WithY {\")\nb=s.index(\"/// So the about pages'\")\ns=s[:a]+s[b:]\nopen('crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/screens.rs','w').write(s)\ns=open('crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs').read()\ns=s.replace(\"use self::menus::Menu;\\n\",\"\")\nopen('crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/mod.rs','w').write(s)\ns=open('crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/events/paddle.rs').read()\ns=s.replace(\"    pub fn bot(&self, c: &RunCommon, r: &Rules) -> Intent {\\n        let target = self.gates\",\"    pub fn bot(&self, _c: &RunCommon, r: &Rules) -> Intent {\\n        let target = self.gates\")\nopen('crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/events/paddle.rs','w').write(s)\ns=open('crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/check.rs').read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"        let (x, y, w, h) = (360.0, 846.0, 1200.0, 120.0);\n        ui.card_c(x, y, w, h, with_alpha(WHITE, 0.96));\n        ui.label(x + 30.0, y + 8.0, 34.0, TEAL, Align::Left, q.who.name());\n        ui.text(x + 30.0, y + 58.0, 36.0, INK, Align::Left, text);\"\"\",\"\"\"        let (x, y, w, h) = (300.0, 810.0, 1320.0, 160.0);\n        ui.card_c(x, y, w, h, with_alpha(WHITE, 0.96));\n        ui.label(x + 30.0, y + 6.0, 34.0, TEAL, Align::Left, q.who.name());\n        ui.para(x + 30.0, y + 52.0, w - 60.0, 36.0, INK, Align::Left, text);\"\"\")\nopen('crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/check.rs','w').write(s)\ns=open('crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/screens.rs').read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"            ui.card_c(360.0, 830.0, 1200.0, 120.0, with_alpha(WHITE, 0.96));\n            ui.label(390.0, 838.0, 34.0, TEAL, Align::Left, q.who.name());\n            ui.text(390.0, 886.0, 36.0, INK, Align::Left, text);\"\"\",\"\"\"            ui.card_c(300.0, 810.0, 1320.0, 160.0, with_alpha(WHITE, 0.96));\n            ui.label(330.0, 816.0, 34.0, TEAL, Align::Left, q.who.name());\n            ui.para(330.0, 862.0, 1260.0, 36.0, INK, Align::Left, text);\"\"\")\nopen('crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/screens.rs','w').write(s)\nEOF\nmkdir -p crates/pav_core/tests; cat > crates/pav_core/tests/fit.rs <<'EOF'\n//! Whiff Fit plays itself: the bot goes from New Stay to the credits, every event earns its\n//! stars, idle input doesn't, and everything stays exact.\n\nuse glam::Vec2;\nuse pav_core::games::fit::events::{ALL, EventKind};\nuse pav_core::games::fit::meta::{SaveData, Settings};\nuse pav_core::games::fit::rules::Rules;\nuse pav_core::games::fit::run::RunPhase;\nuse pav_core::games::fit::{FitGame, Flow, Overlay, script};\nuse pav_core::input::{UiEvent, buttons as b};\nuse pav_core::{InputFrame, Sim, SimState};\n\nfn game(sim: &Sim) -> &FitGame {\n    sim.play().unwrap().get::<FitGame>().unwrap()\n}\nfn game_mut(sim: &mut Sim) -> &mut FitGame {\n    sim.state.play.as_mut().unwrap().get_mut::<FitGame>().unwrap()\n}\nfn press(sim: &mut Sim, bit: u32) {\n    sim.step(&InputFrame { held: bit, pressed: bit, any: true, ..Default::default() });\n    sim.step(&InputFrame::default());\n}\nfn screen(sim: &Sim) -> String {\n    game(sim).screen_name()\n}\n\n/// Plays an event from its card to its result with an input function; returns the score.\nfn play_event(kind: EventKind, seed: u64, mut input: impl FnMut(&Sim) -> InputFrame) -> f32 {\n    let mut sim = Sim::new(&format!(\"fit/event/{}\", kind.key()), seed).unwrap();\n    assert_eq!(screen(&sim), \"card\", \"{kind:?}\");\n    press(&mut sim, b::CONFIRM);\n    for _ in 0..60 * 60 * 6 {\n        let i = input(&sim);\n        sim.step(&i);\n        if let Flow::Event(r) = &game(&sim).flow {\n            if r.phase == RunPhase::Result {\n                return r.out.score;\n            }\n        } else {\n            panic!(\"{kind:?} left the event\");\n        }\n    }\n    panic!(\"{kind:?} on seed {seed} never ended\");\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn each_event_bot_earns_two_stars_on_five_seeds() {\n    for kind in ALL {\n        for seed in 1..=5 {\n            let s = play_event(kind, seed, |sim| game(sim).bot_input(sim));\n            assert!(s >= 650.0, \"{kind:?} seed {seed}: the bot scored {s}\");\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn each_event_idle_earns_under_a_star() {\n    for kind in ALL {\n        let s = play_event(kind, 3, |_| InputFrame::default());\n        assert!(s < 400.0, \"{kind:?}: idle scored {s}\");\n    }\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn careless_input_earns_less_than_the_bot() {\n    for kind in ALL {\n        let mut rng = pav_core::rng::Rng::new(77);\n        let mut held = 0u32;\n        let bot = play_event(kind, 2, |sim| game(sim).bot_input(sim));\n        let careless = play_event(kind, 2, |_| {\n            let mut f = InputFrame::default();\n            let mut pressed = 0;\n            for bit in [b::CONFIRM, b::STEP_L, b::STEP_R] {\n                if rng.f32() < 0.03 {\n                    held ^= bit;\n                    if held & bit != 0 {\n                        pressed |= bit;\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            f.held = held;\n            f.pressed = pressed;\n            f.lean = Vec2::new(rng.range(-1.0, 1.0), rng.range(-1.0, 1.0));\n            f\n        });\n        assert!(careless < bot, \"{kind:?}: careless {careless}, bot {bot}\");\n    }\n}\n\n/// Plays with the bot until `until` is true, or panics.\nfn run_bot_until(sim: &mut Sim, ticks: u64, until: impl Fn(&Sim) -> bool) {\n    for _ in 0..ticks {\n        if until(sim) {\n            return;\n        }\n        let f = sim.bot_input();\n        sim.step(&f);\n    }\n    panic!(\"not there after {ticks} ticks: screen {} status {}\", screen(sim), game(sim).status_json(sim));\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn the_bot_plays_new_stay_to_credits() {\n    for seed in [1u64, 2, 3] {\n        let mut sim = Sim::new(\"fit\", seed).unwrap();\n        let (outcome, ticks) = sim.run_bot(60 * 60 * 60);\n        let g = game(&sim);\n        let guest = g.guest().unwrap_or_else(|| panic!(\"no guest: {}\", g.status_json(&sim)));\n        assert_eq!(outcome, pav_core::games::Outcome::Won, \"seed {seed}, {ticks} ticks: {}\", g.status_json(&sim));\n        assert!(guest.stamps >= 5, \"{} stamps\", guest.stamps);\n        for k in ALL {\n            assert!(guest.played.iter().any(|p| p == k.key()), \"{k:?} not played\");\n        }\n        assert!(guest.played.iter().any(|p| p == \"big_stand\"));\n        assert!(ticks < 60 * 60 * 60, \"under an hour of sim time: {ticks}\");\n        assert!(guest.free_play());\n    }\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn balance_core_feel() {\n    use pav_core::games::fit::core::BalanceCore;\n    let r = Rules::default().core;\n    let mut rng = pav_core::rng::Rng::new(5);\n    let dt = 1.0 / 60.0;\n    // Full lean reaches 90% in about 0.4 s.\n    let mut c = BalanceCore::new(&mut rng);\n    let mut t90 = None;\n    for i in 0..60 {\n        c.step(Vec2::X, &r, 0.0, Vec2::ZERO, Vec2::ZERO, true, dt, &mut rng);\n        if t90.is_none() && c.cob.x > 0.9 * r.reach {\n            t90 = Some(i as f32 * dt);\n        }\n    }\n    let t90 = t90.expect(\"reaches\");\n    assert!((0.2..0.6).contains(&t90), \"90% at {t90}\");\n    // Released, it settles in about half a second.\n    for _ in 0..40 {\n        c.step(Vec2::ZERO, &r, 0.0, Vec2::ZERO, Vec2::ZERO, true, dt, &mut rng);\n    }\n    assert!(c.cob.length() < 0.1, \"settled to {}\", c.cob.length());\n    // Left alone, it wanders only a little.\n    let mut sum = 0.0;\n    let mut most = 0.0f32;\n    for _ in 0..1200 {\n        c.step(Vec2::ZERO, &r, 1.0, Vec2::ZERO, Vec2::ZERO, true, dt, &mut rng);\n        sum += c.cob.length();\n        most = most.max(c.cob.length());\n    }\n    let mean = sum / 1200.0;\n    assert!(mean < 0.12, \"mean radius {mean}\");\n    // Pushed past the edge, it tips after tip_time.\n    let mut c = BalanceCore::new(&mut rng);\n    c.cob = Vec2::new(1.3, 0.0);\n    let mut tipped_at = None;\n    for i in 0..60 {\n        c.step(Vec2::new(1.0, 0.0), &r, 0.0, Vec2::new(60.0, 0.0), Vec2::ZERO, true, dt, &mut rng);\n        if c.tipped {\n            tipped_at = Some(i as f32 * dt);\n            break;\n        }\n    }\n    let at = tipped_at.expect(\"tips\");\n    assert!((at - r.tip_time).abs() < 0.1, \"tipped at {at}\");\n    // A held full lean alone doesn't tip.\n    let mut c = BalanceCore::new(&mut rng);\n    for _ in 0..600 {\n        c.step(Vec2::X, &r, 0.0, Vec2::ZERO, Vec2::ZERO, true, dt, &mut rng);\n    }\n    assert_eq!(c.tips, 0);\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn better_input_gives_a_lower_age_and_bounds_hold() {\n    use pav_core::games::fit::meta::balance_age;\n    let r = Rules::default().check;\n    assert!(balance_age(0.9, 0, 0, &r) < balance_age(0.2, 0, 0, &r));\n    assert_eq!(balance_age(0.5, 0, 0, &r), 50);\n    assert!(balance_age(1.0, 5, 99, &r) >= 18);\n    assert!(balance_age(0.0, 0, 0, &r) <= 99);\n    // The check itself: the bot beats doing nothing.\n    let age_of = |bot: bool| {\n        let mut sim = Sim::new(\"fit\", 11).unwrap();\n        run_bot_until(&mut sim, 60 * 120, |s| matches!(game(s).flow, Flow::Check(_)));\n        while matches!(game(&sim).flow, Flow::Check(_)) {\n            let f = if bot { sim.bot_input() } else { InputFrame::default() };\n            sim.step(&f);\n        }\n        game(&sim).guest().unwrap().ages[0]\n    };\n    let (good, idle) = (age_of(true), age_of(false));\n    assert!(good < idle, \"bot {good}, idle {idle}\");\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn attract_starts_cycles_exits_and_saves_nothing() {\n    let mut sim = Sim::new(\"fit\", 4).unwrap();\n    let serial = game(&sim).save_serial;\n    for _ in 0..598 {\n        sim.step(&InputFrame::default());\n    }\n    assert_eq!(screen(&sim), \"title\");\n    for _ in 0..4 {\n        sim.step(&InputFrame::default());\n    }\n    assert_eq!(screen(&sim), \"attract\");\n    // Every segment comes round, and then the loop does.\n    let mut seen = std::collections::BTreeSet::new();\n    for _ in 0..60 * 200 {\n        sim.step(&InputFrame::default());\n        if let Flow::Attract(a) = &game(&sim).flow {\n            seen.insert(a.seg);\n            if a.cycles > 0 {\n                break;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    assert_eq!(seen.len(), 12, \"{seen:?}\");\n    assert_eq!(game(&sim).save_serial, serial, \"saved nothing\");\n    // Any input exits to the title.\n    for _ in 0..600 {\n        sim.step(&InputFrame::default());\n    }\n    assert_eq!(screen(&sim), \"attract\");\n    sim.step(&InputFrame { any: true, ..Default::default() });\n    assert_eq!(screen(&sim), \"title\");\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn pause_freezes_the_world_and_menus_still_run() {\n    let mut sim = Sim::new(\"fit/event/pose_parade\", 1).unwrap();\n    press(&mut sim, b::CONFIRM);\n    for _ in 0..240 {\n        let f = sim.bot_input();\n        sim.step(&f);\n    }\n    press(&mut sim, b::PAUSE);\n    assert_eq!(screen(&sim), \"pause\");\n    let t = if let Flow::Event(r) = &game(&sim).flow { r.c.t } else { panic!() };\n    let pos = sim.feet(game(&sim).pid);\n    for _ in 0..120 {\n        sim.step(&InputFrame::default());\n    }\n    let t2 = if let Flow::Event(r) = &game(&sim).flow { r.c.t } else { panic!() };\n    assert_eq!(t, t2);\n    assert_eq!(pos, sim.feet(game(&sim).pid));\n    let f0 = game(&sim).focus;\n    press(&mut sim, b::MENU_DOWN);\n    assert_eq!(game(&sim).focus, f0 + 1);\n    press(&mut sim, b::PAUSE);\n    assert_eq!(screen(&sim), \"event\");\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn settings_default_music_to_ten_percent() {\n    assert!((Settings::default().music - 0.10).abs() < 1e-6);\n    let sim = Sim::new(\"fit\", 1).unwrap();\n    let f = sim.play().unwrap().ui_frame(&sim).unwrap();\n    assert!((f.music - 0.10).abs() < 1e-6);\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn dev_sliders_change_values_and_reset() {\n    let mut sim = Sim::new(\"fit\", 1).unwrap();\n    let was = game(&sim).rules.core.stiffness;\n    let g = game_mut(&mut sim);\n    g.push_overlay(Overlay::Dev);\n    g.dev.tab = 3;\n    let m = g.menu().unwrap();\n    let slider = m.items.iter().position(|i| matches!(i.act, pav_core::games::fit::menus::MAct::DevParam(_))).unwrap();\n    g.focus = slider;\n    press(&mut sim, b::MENU_RIGHT);\n    assert_ne!(game(&sim).rules.core.stiffness, was);\n    let m = game(&sim).menu().unwrap();\n    let all = m.items.iter().position(|i| i.act == pav_core::games::fit::menus::MAct::DevResetAll).unwrap();\n    game_mut(&mut sim).focus = all;\n    press(&mut sim, b::CONFIRM);\n    assert_eq!(game(&sim).rules.core.stiffness, was);\n    // Pointer: a slider drag.\n    game_mut(&mut sim).focus = 0;\n    sim.step(&InputFrame { ui: Some(UiEvent::Slider(slider as u16, 1.0)), ..Default::default() });\n    assert!(game(&sim).rules.core.stiffness > was);\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn dev_jump_lands_where_it_says() {\n    let mut sim = Sim::new(\"fit\", 1).unwrap();\n    let g = game_mut(&mut sim);\n    g.push_overlay(Overlay::Dev);\n    let m = g.menu().unwrap();\n    let t = m.items.iter().position(|i| i.act == pav_core::games::fit::menus::MAct::DevEvent(EventKind::TrayTrek)).unwrap();\n    sim.step(&InputFrame { ui: Some(UiEvent::Click(t as u16)), ..Default::default() });\n    assert_eq!(screen(&sim), \"card\");\n    assert!(matches!(&game(&sim).flow, Flow::Event(r) if r.kind == EventKind::TrayTrek));\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn saves_round_trip_with_a_version() {\n    let mut s = SaveData::default();\n    s.settings.music = 0.33;\n    s.slots[1] = Some(pav_core::games::fit::meta::Guest { name: \"Doug\".into(), day: 3, ..Default::default() });\n    let text = s.to_json();\n    let back = SaveData::parse(&text).unwrap();\n    assert_eq!(back, s);\n    assert!(SaveData::parse(\"{\\\"version\\\": 99}\").is_none());\n    assert!(SaveData::parse(\"nonsense\").is_none());\n}\n\nfn medley_score(seed: u64) -> (f32, u64) {\n    let mut sim = Sim::new(\"fit/medley\", seed).unwrap();\n    assert_eq!(screen(&sim), \"medley_wait\");\n    sim.step(&InputFrame { held: b::HUB_GO, ..Default::default() });\n    for _ in 0..60 * 400 {\n        let mut f = sim.bot_input();\n        f.held |= b::HUB_GO;\n        sim.step(&f);\n        if let Flow::Medley(m) = &game(&sim).flow {\n            if m.phase == pav_core::games::fit::medley::MPhase::Done {\n                return (m.total(0), sim.state_hash());\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    panic!(\"medley never finished: {}\", game(&sim).status_json(&sim));\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn a_medley_on_a_seed_is_the_same_score_for_the_same_inputs() {\n    let (a, h1) = medley_score(5);\n    let (b, h2) = medley_score(5);\n    assert_eq!(a, b);\n    assert_eq!(h1, h2);\n    assert!(a > 1000.0, \"the bot's medley: {a}\");\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn play_together_completes_with_ghosts() {\n    let mut sim = Sim::new(\"fit\", 9).unwrap();\n    game_mut(&mut sim).start_together_for_test();\n    let mut saw_ghost = false;\n    for _ in 0..60 * 900 {\n        let f = sim.bot_input();\n        sim.step(&f);\n        let g = game(&sim);\n        if let Flow::Medley(m) = &g.flow {\n            if let Some(r) = &m.run {\n                saw_ghost |= !r.ghosts.is_empty();\n            }\n            if m.phase == pav_core::games::fit::medley::MPhase::Podium {\n                assert!(saw_ghost, \"the second guest saw the first\");\n                assert_eq!(m.players.len(), 2);\n                assert!(sim.frame().objects.len() > 3);\n                return;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    panic!(\"never reached the podium: {}\", game(&sim).status_json(&sim));\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn snapshots_rewind_and_replays_are_exact() {\n    let mut sim = Sim::new(\"fit\", 3).unwrap();\n    for _ in 0..240 {\n        let f = sim.bot_input();\n        sim.step(&f);\n    }\n    let mut bytes = Vec::new();\n    ciborium::into_writer(&sim.snapshot(), &mut bytes).unwrap();\n    let state: SimState = ciborium::from_reader(bytes.as_slice()).unwrap();\n    let mut copy = Sim::new(\"fit\", 3).unwrap();\n    copy.restore(state);\n    assert_eq!(copy.state_hash(), sim.state_hash());\n    for _ in 0..240 {\n        let (a, b) = (sim.bot_input(), copy.bot_input());\n        sim.step(&a);\n        copy.step(&b);\n    }\n    assert_eq!(copy.state_hash(), sim.state_hash());\n    let (tick, hash) = (sim.state.tick, sim.state_hash());\n    assert!(sim.rewind_to(tick - 90));\n    assert!(sim.rewind_to(tick));\n    assert_eq!(sim.state_hash(), hash);\n    let mut again = Sim::new(\"fit\", 3).unwrap();\n    for f in sim.recording.iter() {\n        again.step(f);\n    }\n    assert_eq!(again.state_hash(), hash);\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn the_script_is_long_enough_and_has_no_placeholders() {\n    let s = script::all();\n    let count = |prefix: &str| s.iter().filter(|(k, _)| k.starts_with(prefix)).map(|(_, v)| v.len()).sum::<usize>();\n    assert!(count(\"pip.\") >= 80, \"Pip has {}\", count(\"pip.\"));\n    for coach in [\"posey.\", \"kettle.\", \"bounce.\", \"gull.\"] {\n        assert!(count(coach) >= 25, \"{coach} has {}\", count(coach));\n    }\n    for guest in [\"marjorie.\", \"tom.\", \"twins.\"] {\n        assert!(count(guest) >= 8, \"{guest} has {}\", count(guest));\n    }\n    assert!(s[\"titles\"].len() >= 30);\n    assert!(s[\"names\"].len() >= 35);\n    for (k, v) in &s {\n        for line in v {\n            for bad in [\"TODO\", \"FIXME\", \"placeholder\", \"lorem\", \"Nintendo\", \"Wii\", \" Mii\"] {\n                assert!(!line.contains(bad), \"{k}: {line}\");\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    for e in ALL {\n        assert!(s.contains_key(&format!(\"card.{}\", e.key())), \"{e:?} has no card\");\n    }\n}\n\n#[test]\nfn every_screen_keeps_the_text_size_rule() {\n    use pav_core::games::fit::ui_model::{MIN_TEXT, Node};\n    let mut sim = Sim::new(\"fit\", 2).unwrap();\n    let mut screens = std::collections::BTreeSet::new();\n    for _ in 0..60 * 60 * 40 {\n        let f = sim.bot_input();\n        sim.step(&f);\n        if sim.state.tick % 20 != 0 {\n            continue;\n        }\n        let ui = sim.play().unwrap().ui_frame(&sim).unwrap();\n        screens.insert(ui.screen.clone());\n        for n in ui.nodes.iter().chain(ui.top.iter()) {\n            if let Node::Text { size, text, .. } = n {\n                assert!(*size >= MIN_TEXT, \"{} too small on {}\", text, ui.screen);\n            }\n        }\n        if sim.outcome() != pav_core::games::Outcome::Playing {\n            break;\n        }\n    }\n    for want in [\"title\", \"slots\", \"names\", \"look\", \"dialog\", \"check\", \"report\", \"island\", \"schedule\", \"events\", \"card\", \"count\", \"event\", \"result\", \"stamp\", \"credits\"] {\n        assert!(screens.contains(want), \"never saw {want}: {screens:?}\");\n    }\n}\nEOF\npython3 - <<'EOF'\ns=open('crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/medley.rs').read()\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"impl Medley {\n    pub fn hud\"\"\",\"\"\"impl FitGame {\n    /// Two guests, ready for the pad (tests start here).\n    pub fn start_together_for_test(&mut self) {\n        let m = Medley {\n            hub: false,\n            seed: self.seed,\n            players: (0..2).map(|i| MPlayer { name: format!(\"Guest {}\", i + 1), ..Default::default() }).collect(),\n            phase: MPhase::Pass,\n            ..Default::default()\n        };\n        self.flow = Flow::Medley(Box::new(m));\n    }\n}\n\nimpl Medley {\n    pub fn hud\"\"\")\nopen('crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/medley.rs','w').write(s)\nEOF\ngrep -n \"^\\[dev-dependencies\\]\" -A6 crates/pav_core/Cargo.toml; CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=8 timeout 500 cargo test --locked -p pav_core --test fit --no-run --message-format=short 2>&1 | grep -E \"^(crates|error|warning: unused)|Finished|Executable\" | head -30","description":"Write the Rust test suite for the game and compile it","timeout":520000}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_01UweHjniixhdRJ9GALADshn":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223859__x35112d/work/WhiffFit-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-223859/engine"}}}
