WN, vec![KeyS, ArrowDown]),\n                (buttons::MENU_LEFT, vec![KeyA, ArrowLeft]),\n                (buttons::MENU_RIGHT, vec![KeyD, ArrowRight]),\n            ],\n        }\n    }\n\n    /// Defaults with a room's `[keys]` overrides applied. Returns problems found.\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"    pub back_held: bool,\n    pub any_activity: bool,\n}\"\"\",\"\"\"    pub back_held: bool,\n    pub any_activity: bool,\n    /// The stick before the deadzone, for the lean's own shaping.\n    pub raw_left: Vec2,\n    /// Options, unless Create is held (that pair belongs to the AI Hub).\n    pub pause_pressed: bool,\n}\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"    /// Game mode: the right mouse button is a skill and the gamepad uses the game layout.\n    pub game: bool,\n}\"\"\",\"\"\"    /// Game mode: the right mouse button is a skill and the gamepad uses the game layout.\n    pub game: bool,\n    /// Whiff Fit's layout.\n    pub fit: bool,\n    /// Keyboard and mouse: the mouse moved or clicked last.\n    pub mouse_recent: bool,\n    key_lean: Vec2,\n    lean_from: LeanFrom,\n    last_stick: Vec2,\n    last_cursor: Vec2,\n}\n\n/// The device that moved last wins the lean.\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, Default, PartialEq, Eq)]\nenum LeanFrom {\n    #[default]\n    Stick,\n    Keys,\n    Mouse,\n}\n\n/// What the game says about shaping the lean this frame.\n#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug)]\npub struct LeanShape {\n    pub deadzone: f32,\n    pub curve: f32,\n    pub key_rate: f32,\n    pub key_return: f32,\n    pub mouse_span: f32,\n    pub arrows_step: bool,\n    pub cursor_leans: bool,\n    pub fast: bool,\n}\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"            bindings: Bindings::default(),\n            game: false,\n        }\"\"\",\"\"\"            bindings: Bindings::default(),\n            game: false,\n            fit: false,\n            mouse_recent: false,\n            key_lean: Vec2::ZERO,\n            lean_from: LeanFrom::Stick,\n            last_stick: Vec2::ZERO,\n            last_cursor: Vec2::ZERO,\n        }\"\"