is the build order)\nAll code paths exist and compile: fit game (engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/), pav_ui/src/fit_ui.rs, pav_audio music+voice+sfx,\npav_app (app.rs, input.rs, weblink.rs), web/index.html, tools/{make_props,make_sets,make_clips}.py (generate JSON/TOML data), tools/build.sh, tests/run.sh (core|browser|hub|all).\nPassing: core tests except tuning in tests/fit.rs; hub harness 11/11; browser nearly all.\nRemaining: visual pass on every set (captures via `pav repl` from engine/), feel/tuning, polish, README.md, notes/decisions.md, notes/feedback.md (issue count), exit-interview.json, final build, cleanup (rm engine/target, tests/_served), chat reply with Source Info + feedback.\nDecisions: sets have NO [camera] (cues only); all game logic runs in Game::pre; UI built in sim as node list at 1920x1080; only current set is drawn (World.only_current).\nIssues caught by testing so far (for feedback): tick 1.6 tps from water zones per tile (merge_zones + per-zone grids) -> one zone per set; first pointer delta 0 hid hover; unbound keys didn't count as any-input; touch release lost pointer pos; prop schema errors (8) found by room_check; AiDef form; paddle gust too strong (bot 350-520).\n\"\"\"\nopen('PROGRESS.md','w').write(s)\nEOF\ncd WhiffFit-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-223859/engine && CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=8 cargo build --locked -p pav_tools --bin pav --message-format=short 2>&1 | grep -E \"^(crates|error)|Finished\" | cut -c1-200 | head; cat > ../tools/shots.sh <<'EOF'\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\n# Contact sheets of the events mid-play, from engine/: tools/shots.sh [ticks] [w] [h]\nticks=${1:-600}; w=${2:-640}; h=${3:-360}\nmkdir -p out\nfor e in breath_bloom pose_parade tempo_squats plank_standoff step_party floatie_spin morning_lap tide_table paddle_slalom tray_trek cannonball_cup big_stand; do\n  printf 'load scene=fit/event/%s\\ninput ticks=20\\ninput press=confirm\\ninput ticks=190\\nplay bot=true ticks=%s\\ncapture width=%s height=%s out=out/%s.p