{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjP7gtLMmUbfbBcxNpNJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01647wkiS7CqEQEdJJMmCpxn","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/flow.rs'\ns=open(p).read()\na=\"\"\"        if m.length() > 0.08 {\n            self.walk.clear();\n            self.walk_then = None;\n        } else if let Some(&next) = self.walk.first() {\"\"\"\nb=\"\"\"        // Walking up to something: within arm's reach is close enough (Pip is behind a desk).\n        if let Some(i) = self.walk_then {\n            let spot = self.spots.get(i).map(|s| s.id.and_then(|id| sim.feet(id)).unwrap_or(s.pos));\n            if spot.is_some_and(|p| Vec2::new(p.x - feet.x, p.z - feet.z).length() < 2.0) {\n                self.walk.clear();\n                self.walk_then = None;\n                self.use_spot(i, sim, ev);\n                return Vec2::ZERO;\n            }\n        }\n        if m.length() > 0.08 {\n            self.walk.clear();\n            self.walk_then = None;\n        } else if let Some(&next) = self.walk.first() {\"\"\"\nassert a in s\ns=s.replace(a,b,1)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ntimeout 300 cargo test --locked -q -p pav_core --test fit walking --message-format=short 2>&1 | grep -E \"^crates.*error|^error|FAILED|panicked|test result|the click\" | cut -c1-280 | head; cd .. && python3 - <<'EOF'\ns=open('../PROGRESS.md').read()\ns=s[:s.index('## Status')]\ns+=\"\"\"## Status (update as steps finish; plan section 17 is the build order)\nAll systems exist and pass tests: fit game (engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/), pav_ui/src/fit_ui.rs, pav_audio music+voice+sfx,\npav_app (app.rs, input.rs, weblink.rs), web/index.html, tools/{make_props,make_sets,make_clips}.py (generate JSON/TOML data), tools/build.sh, tools/tour.py + shots.sh (captures, run from engine/), tests/run.sh (core|browser|hub|all).\nRemaining: final look at a few screens at 1080p, README.md, notes/decisions.md, notes/feedback.md, exit-interview.json, tools/build.sh, tests/run.sh all, 1080p file:// look, cleanup (rm engine/target, engine/out, tests/_served, tests/__pycache__), chat reply with Source Info + feedback.\nDecisions: sets have NO [camera] (cues only); all game logic runs in Game::pre; UI built in sim as node list at 1920x1080; only current set is drawn (World.only_current); history off in game (test turns it on).\nIssues caught by testing so far (for feedback) ~20; critical 3 (1.6 tick/s from per-tile water zones; figures sinking through decks with no collider; player left at the Studio after the check so the island showed empty sky). Others: first pointer delta 0 hid hover; unbound keys didn't count as any-input; touch release lost pointer position; 8 prop schema errors via room_check; AiDef form; paddle gust too strong (bot 350-520); idle event never left card in test; pav load dropped an initial camera cue; prompt rows clipped labels; calendar double-dimmed; click on Pip never arrived (desk); text-size test sampled too late; plank score /60 in finale; plank line in finale.\n\"\"\"\nopen('../PROGRESS.md','w').write(s)\nEOF\ntools/build.sh 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c150-260; timeout 500 tests/run.sh browser 2>&1 | tail -8 | cut -c1-400","description":"Fix click-to-talk, rebuild the page and run browser tests","timeout":900000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9997,"cache_read_input_tokens":763013,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9997},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0691f0d6-f08e-44c9-b7bd-c57d7fb96b71","uuid":"ef03c778-7c63-4790-9ffe-d2fd09d67f6b","timestamp":"2026-11-05T07:25:07.305Z","req