= 0 { 0.65 } else { 0.55 }\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\npython3 ../tools/make_rules.py; timeout 500 cargo test --locked -q -p pav_core --test fit scores -- --ignored --nocapture 2>&1 | grep -E \"bot \\[|never ended|^error\" | cut -c1-200","description":"Tune difficulty numbers and reprint the balance table","timeout":520000}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_01DXwbFPUFi68x8uMNtiSf1z":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223859__x35112d/work/WhiffFit-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-223859/engine"}}}
