\", false),\n                    };\n                    gesture(sim, self.pid, clip, upper);\"\"\"),\n])\npatch(F+'events/plank.rs',[\n(\"\"\"            nudge += Vec2::new(r.laugh_nudge, r.laugh_nudge * 0.5);\n            cx.sfx(sound::GONG, 0.5, 0.7);\"\"\",\"\"\"            nudge += Vec2::new(r.laugh_nudge, r.laugh_nudge * 0.5);\n            cx.sfx(sound::GONG, 0.5, 0.7);\n            // He laughs so hard the picture shakes.\n            let at = cx.feet();\n            cx.ev.push(crate::frame::SimEvent::Slam { pos: at, radius: 1.6 });\"\"\"),\n])\npatch('../tools/make_sets.py',[\n(\"\"\"    r.obj(\"LIB/core/gull\", 9.8, 0.4, 11.8, yaw=-90, scale=2.2, name=\"judge3\")\"\"\",\"\"\"    r.obj(\"LIB/core/gull\", 9.8, 0.4, 11.8, yaw=-90, scale=2.2, name=\"judge3\")\n    for (x, z) in [(7.7, 10.2), (8.5, 11.0), (9.3, 11.8)]:\n        r.obj(\"LIB/core/scorecard\", x, 0.4, z, yaw=-90, scale=1.3)\"\"\"),\n])\ns=open('crates/pav_core/tests/fit.rs').read()\na='''    assert_eq!(seen.len(), 12, \"{seen:?}\");'''\nb='''    assert_eq!(seen.len(), 14, \"{seen:?}\");'''\nassert a in s\ns=s.replace(a,b)\na='''    for _ in 0..60 * 200 {\n        sim.step(&InputFrame::default());\n        if let Flow::Attract(a) = &game(&sim).flow {'''\nb='''    for _ in 0..60 * 240 {\n        sim.step(&InputFrame::default());\n        if let Flow::Attract(a) = &game(&sim).flow {'''\nassert a in s\ns=s.replace(a,b)\nopen('crates/pav_core/tests/fit.rs','w').write(s)\ns=open('../notes/decisions.md').read()\ns+=\"- Attract adds Breath Bloom and Tempo Squats to section 12's list, because section 5 gives every event an attract segment.\\n- The Schedule is a column of big rows rather than a sideways carousel: it holds six items, shows stars and subtitles at 10 feet, and moves the same way as every other menu.\\n\"\nopen('../notes/decisions.md','w').write(s)\ns=open('../README.md').read()\ns=s.replace(\"`tests/look.py` takes 1080p screenshots of the finished page.\",\"`tests/look.py` takes 1080p screenshots of the finished page; `tests/boot_time.py` times the page's boot.\")\nopen('../README.md','w').write(s)\nEOF\npython3 ../tools/make_sets.py >/dev/null; ./target/debug/pav room_check path=crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/sets/tower.toml 2>&1 | cut -c1-160; cd .. && tools/build.sh 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c150-260; (time tests/run.sh all) > tests/last_run.txt 2>&1; tail -7 tests/last_run.txt | cut -c1-600","description":"Close the last plan gaps, rebuild and run every test","timeout":2700000,"run_in_background":true},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1414,"cache_read_input_tokens":868143,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1414},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0691f0d6-f08e-44c9-b7bd-c57d7fb96b71","uuid":"9f6e8145-2e83-4888-8a4f-ec1395b279fa","timestamp":"2026-11-05T09:19:48.887Z","request_id":"req_011CgjXpbdeu5CsMmV6hwgqE","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01NKyHknwqkPWq1hYHsneo4q":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223859__x35112d/work/WhiffFit-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-223859/engine && git reset -q; python3 - <<'EOF'\ndef patch(path, pairs):\n    s = open(path).read()\n    for a, b in pairs:\n        assert a in s, (path, a[:80])\n        s = s.replace(a, b, 1)\n    open(path, 'w').write(s)\nF='crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/'\npatch(F+'flow.rs',[\n(\"\"\"pub const ATTRACT: [EventKind; 10] = [\n    EventKind::CannonballCup,\n    EventKind::PaddleSlalom,\n    EventKind::StepParty,\n    EventKind::PoseParade,\n    EventKind::TideTable,\n    EventKind::FloatieSpin,\n    EventKind::TrayTrek,\n    EventKind::PlankStandoff,\n    EventKind::MorningLap,\n    EventKind::BigStand,\n];\"\"\",