{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KhwJX7KgqdaN2UfHtEQeuj","type":"tool_result","content":"The complete suite, tests/run.sh all, in one run on the final page (built 03:41, unchanged after this).\nAfterwards, on the same build: the native window driven by a scripted pad through a full event under xvfb (no panics), and the title and About screens at 1920x1080 from file://.\n\n126 passed, 0 failed\n\nreal\t14m50.892s\nuser\t19m39.407s\nsys\t0m28.782s\n                    if m {\n                        G::Mouse(MouseBit::Left)\n                    } else {\n                        G::Key(\"W A S D\")\n                    }\n                }\n                Act::Jog => G::Key(\"Shift\"),\n                Act::Menu => G::Key(\"W S\"),\n                Act::Camera => G::Mouse(MouseBit::Right),\n            }\n        }\n3\ncd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223859__x35112d/work/WhiffFit-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-223859/engine && CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=8 cargo build --locked -p pav_app --message-format=short 2>&1 | grep -E \"^(crates.*error|error)|Finished\" | cut -c1-160; mkdir -p out; cat > target/debug/shardfall.toml <<'EOF'\nbackend = \"vulkan\"\nvsync = false\nwidth = 480\nheight = 270\nfullscreen = false\nscene = \"fit/event/pose_parade\"\nseed = 1\nEOF\ncat > out/pad.txt <<'EOF'\n# Into Pose Parade, then lean right, then left, then the result's Back.\n40\n12 hold=South\n140\n200 left=0.95,0\n200 left=-0.95,0\n200 left=0,0.95\nEOF\ncat > out/native.sh <<'EOF'\n#!/bin/sh\n./target/debug/shardfall --scene fit/event/pose_parade --no-vsync --pad-script out/pad.txt > out/native.log 2>&1 &\npid=$!\nfor n in 1 2 3 4 5 6; do\n  sleep 18\n  ffmpeg -y -loglevel error -f x11grab -video_size 480x270 -i \"$DISPLAY\" -frames:v 1 out/e$n.png 2>>out/import.log\ndone\nkill \"$pid\"\nwait \"$pid\"\nEOF\nchmod +x out/native.sh; rm -f out/e*.png; DISPLAY= timeout 170 xvfb-run -a -s \"-screen 0 480x270x24\" out/native.sh >/dev/null 2>&1; echo \"native panics: $(grep -cE 'panic|FAIL' out/native.log)\"; grep -E \"pad script|boot complete\" out/native.log | cut -c1-90; (cd out && magick \\( e1.png e2.png e3.png +append \\) \\( e4.png e5.png e6.png +append \\) -append native_event.png); cd .. && timeout 380 python3 tests/look.py 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-160; magick engine/out/look_title.png -resize 960x engine/out/t.png; magick engine/out/look_about1.png -resize 960x engine/out/a.png; magick engine/out/native_event.png -resize 960x engine/out/n.png; magick engine/out/t.png engine/out/a.png engine/out/n.png -append engine/out/final.png; ls -la --time-style=+%H:%M engine/out/final.png | cut -c24-","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0691f0d6-f08e-44c9-b7bd-c57d7fb96b71","uuid":"af9da1ef-f2f7-4d5a-9bf6-e565c5950011","timestamp":"2026-11-05T11:35:17.539Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"The complete suite, tests/run.sh all, in one run on the final page (built 03:41, unchanged after this).\nAfterwards, on the same build: the native window driven by a scripted pad through a full event under xvfb (no panics), and the title and About screens at 1920x1080 from file://.\n\n126 passed, 0 failed\n\nreal\t14m50.892s\nuser\t19m39.407s\nsys\t0m28.782s\n                    if m {\n                        G::Mouse(MouseBit::Left)\n                    } else {\n                        G::Key(\"W A S D\")\n                    }\n                }\n                Act::Jog => G::Key(\"Shift\"),\n                Act::Menu => G::Key(\"W S\"),\n                Act::Camera => G::Mouse(MouseBit::Right),\n            }\n        }\n3\ncd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build-v2__20261104-223859__x35112d/work/WhiffFit-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261104-223859/engine && CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=8 cargo build --locked -p pav_app --message-format=short 2>&1 | grep -E \"^(crates.*error|error)|Finished\" | cut -c1-160; mkdir -p out; cat > target/debug/shardfall.